(722360, 76864, 5822, '<td valign="top">Though I like the contrast and drama between background and subjects, I find the lighting to be too uneven so that the out rim roses are not evenly lit. Compositionally, I would have preferred a different shooting angle. Perhaps directly over the center flower and with all the roses bunched closer to gether</td>', 'Though I like the contrast and drama between background and subjects, I find the lighting to be too uneven so that the out rim roses are not evenly lit. Compositionally, I would have preferred a different shooting angle. Perhaps directly over the center flower and with all the roses bunched closer to gether', '2004-05-17 06:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(722363, 77003, 5822, '<td valign="top">Composition is a bit too busy and flash lighting a bit too harsh. Good detail is evident, though, as you can see the sap of the tree branch. Also, I like that background being dark black from use of the flash.</td>', 'Composition is a bit too busy and flash lighting a bit too harsh. Good detail is evident, though, as you can see the sap of the tree branch. Also, I like that background being dark black from use of the flash.', '2004-05-17 06:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
