(722376, 77177, 9089, '<td valign="top">Just my opinion, but I would have removed the floating leaves to the left</td>', 'Just my opinion, but I would have removed the floating leaves to the left', '2004-05-17 06:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(722378, 75846, 5822, '<td valign="top">Though I find your subject graceful, I wish it were bigger and more dominant in the frame and wish it had more contrast so that it''s veins could be seen and there was more to ponder.</td>', 'Though I find your subject graceful, I wish it were bigger and more dominant in the frame and wish it had more contrast so that it''s veins could be seen and there was more to ponder.', '2004-05-17 06:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(722379, 76874, 5822, '<td valign="top">Too much distracting glare in the glass and chrome of this guage.  Can see your camera and hand in the reflections.</td>', 'Too much distracting glare in the glass and chrome of this guage.  Can see your camera and hand in the reflections.', '2004-05-17 06:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(722382, 77169, 8643, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent action shot.  Would have preferred the crop very slightly less tight at the bottom.  Nice sense of movement and good focus on the main subject.</td>', 'This is an excellent action shot.  Would have preferred the crop very slightly less tight at the bottom.  Nice sense of movement and good focus on the main subject.', '2004-05-17 07:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(722384, 77182, 5822, '<td valign="top">I do not find the image humorous and find the fisheye and skewed shooting angle to be dizzying and distracting.</td>', 'I do not find the image humorous and find the fisheye and skewed shooting angle to be dizzying and distracting.', '2004-05-17 07:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(722386, 76938, 8643, '<td valign="top">I guess this means the reflecting pool has been filled with water again - my last 3 visits it has been empty.  This is an excellent capture and despite it being so well known, it is very appealingly composed.</td>', 'I guess this means the reflecting pool has been filled with water again - my last 3 visits it has been empty.  This is an excellent capture and despite it being so well known, it is very appealingly composed.', '2004-05-17 07:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(722392, 76938, 18644, '<td valign="top">When I saw the theme for this challenge I thought I would see more of this straight lines. Congrats on the compo.</td>', 'When I saw the theme for this challenge I thought I would see more of this straight lines. Congrats on the compo.', '2004-05-17 07:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(722393, 76081, 18644, '<td valign="top">Nice cropping, nice sense of center here.</td>', 'Nice cropping, nice sense of center here.', '2004-05-17 07:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(722396, 76618, 18644, '<td valign="top">You got my price for most original cropping in this challenge. The SSr has great front lines that really bring you to the center of the compo.</td>', 'You got my price for most original cropping in this challenge. The SSr has great front lines that really bring you to the center of the compo.', '2004-05-17 07:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(722398, 76684, 18644, '<td valign="top">Nice point of view.</td>', 'Nice point of view.', '2004-05-17 07:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(722400, 77129, 18644, '<td valign="top">IMO the border is distracting a bit. But the picture is worth the look. A great center point.</td>', 'IMO the border is distracting a bit. But the picture is worth the look. A great center point.', '2004-05-17 07:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(722401, 76976, 19668, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful +10</td>', 'Simply beautiful +10', '2004-05-17 07:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(722404, 76759, 5822, '<td valign="top">Love the use of the curved and diagnol lines to help center your subject. I also like the soft pastel colors of your background.  At first I didn''t like your subject (belt buckle) thinking it was too inconsequestial as subject, but now I find it to be a perfect style fitting with the rest of the compositon. I just wish your lighting was less harsh and would help bring out the belt buckle even more.  Very creative composition.</td>', 'Love the use of the curved and diagnol lines to help center your subject. I also like the soft pastel colors of your background.  At first I didn''t like your subject (belt buckle) thinking it was too inconsequestial as subject, but now I find it to be a perfect style fitting with the rest of the compositon. I just wish your lighting was less harsh and would help bring out the belt buckle even more.  Very creative composition.', '2004-05-17 07:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(722408, 76871, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition with the color contrast between the gold subject and desaturated tiny leaves.  Flash here is a bit too harsh, but not overly so.  Well done.</td>', 'Very interesting composition with the color contrast between the gold subject and desaturated tiny leaves.  Flash here is a bit too harsh, but not overly so.  Well done.', '2004-05-17 07:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(722410, 76998, 8643, '<td valign="top">This is brilliant.  I so wish I could capture a photo like this - full of colour and movement and yet with a high key, almost misty background.  Must see how it was done! 10</td>', 'This is brilliant.  I so wish I could capture a photo like this - full of colour and movement and yet with a high key, almost misty background.  Must see how it was done! 10', '2004-05-17 07:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(722416, 76762, 5822, '<td valign="top">Exposure problems with way blown out highlights and blocking of shadows areas.</td>', 'Exposure problems with way blown out highlights and blocking of shadows areas.', '2004-05-17 07:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(722421, 76408, 8643, '<td valign="top">What a superb portrait.  Love the skin tones and the clarity, the dark background, the lighting and the smile!</td>', 'What a superb portrait.  Love the skin tones and the clarity, the dark background, the lighting and the smile!', '2004-05-17 07:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(722425, 76914, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and sepia toning but the contrast is too high.</td>', 'I like the composition and sepia toning but the contrast is too high.', '2004-05-17 07:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(722426, 77001, 5822, '<td valign="top">Technically good, but suffers compositionally from distracting elements in background (bus, street lamp and sign, traffic signal and pole at top).</td>', 'Technically good, but suffers compositionally from distracting elements in background (bus, street lamp and sign, traffic signal and pole at top).', '2004-05-17 07:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(722428, 76389, 5822, '<td valign="top">Image suffers from uneven lighting..</td>', 'Image suffers from uneven lighting..', '2004-05-17 07:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(722429, 77171, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like sepia toning and contrast.  Your main subject could be more interesting and should have been more dominant in the image to meet the challenge better (as I think you already know based on your title).  Composition could be improved, I feel, if you moved slightly to the left to help bring out the bench more so that it wasn''t hidden behind the near bush.</td>', 'I like sepia toning and contrast.  Your main subject could be more interesting and should have been more dominant in the image to meet the challenge better (as I think you already know based on your title).  Composition could be improved, I feel, if you moved slightly to the left to help bring out the bench more so that it wasn''t hidden behind the near bush.', '2004-05-17 07:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(722431, 77039, 4729, '<td valign="top">Nice mood and composition perfect for the challenge!</td>', 'Nice mood and composition perfect for the challenge!', '2004-05-17 07:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(722436, 76335, 7684, '<td valign="top">10.</td>', '10.', '2004-05-17 07:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(722438, 76068, 20577, '<td valign="top">Could have done without the drool, but you get an 8 from me anyway!</td>', 'Could have done without the drool, but you get an 8 from me anyway!', '2004-05-17 08:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(722439, 76598, 7684, '<td valign="top">10.</td>', '10.', '2004-05-17 08:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(722441, 77138, 7684, '<td valign="top">9.</td>', '9.', '2004-05-17 08:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(722442, 76775, 20577, '<td valign="top">What is that floating around the flower?</td>', 'What is that floating around the flower?', '2004-05-17 08:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(722445, 75927, 7684, '<td valign="top">9.</td>', '9.', '2004-05-17 08:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(722446, 76741, 19035, '<td valign="top">My brother has one of these things...they sure are funny looking, nice photo.  Reminds me of a tribble from Star Trek.</td>', 'My brother has one of these things...they sure are funny looking, nice photo.  Reminds me of a tribble from Star Trek.', '2004-05-17 08:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(722447, 77032, 20577, '<td valign="top">Awesome! 10</td>', 'Awesome! 10', '2004-05-17 08:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
