(722718, 76974, 1368, '<td valign="top">I love this picture, got some great mood in it and I like the high contrast in it too, I gave it a top score!  and I just noticed it has the same title as my last entry :-)</td>', 'I love this picture, got some great mood in it and I like the high contrast in it too, I gave it a top score!  and I just noticed it has the same title as my last entry :-)', '2004-05-17 11:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
