(722739, 77043, 9089, '<td valign="top">Had to make me go google to find out what an ''orrery'' is didn''t ya???  :-)  Interesting look at the solar system.</td>', 'Had to make me go google to find out what an ''orrery'' is didn''t ya???  :-)  Interesting look at the solar system.', '2004-05-17 11:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(722748, 76274, 9821, '<td valign="top">kinda gross ... cool shot though</td>', 'kinda gross ... cool shot though', '2004-05-17 11:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(722749, 76862, 19035, '<td valign="top">nice photo - but the border is too thick in my opinion, it distracts away from the picture</td>', 'nice photo - but the border is too thick in my opinion, it distracts away from the picture', '2004-05-17 11:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(722751, 77114, 11518, '<td valign="top">Get closer to the bird or crop it tighter and yo got a winner. 5</td>', 'Get closer to the bird or crop it tighter and yo got a winner. 5', '2004-05-17 11:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(722753, 76158, 19035, '<td valign="top">wahoo</td>', 'wahoo', '2004-05-17 11:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(722754, 77005, 11518, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. who just got back from Spain...Nice picture.</td>', 'Hmmm. who just got back from Spain...Nice picture.', '2004-05-17 11:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(722757, 77132, 11738, '<td valign="top">You centered the crop, but tye distortions show that you were not directly underneath.  Avery hard shot to pull off.  Could also have used a little more light.</td>', 'You centered the crop, but tye distortions show that you were not directly underneath.  Avery hard shot to pull off.  Could also have used a little more light.', '2004-05-17 11:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(722761, 76390, 11518, '<td valign="top">The subject is the ants, they are not centered...nice shot though.</td>', 'The subject is the ants, they are not centered...nice shot though.', '2004-05-17 11:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(722764, 76085, 9821, '<td valign="top">This image seems to compete with itself a little. I know you framed it as such to put the flag in the center, but I can''t help but want to have the floor included in the shot (which would make the flag off center). Looks like a very cool place.</td>', 'This image seems to compete with itself a little. I know you framed it as such to put the flag in the center, but I can''t help but want to have the floor included in the shot (which would make the flag off center). Looks like a very cool place.', '2004-05-17 12:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(722766, 77136, 18403, '<td valign="top">Very compelling portrait.</td>', 'Very compelling portrait.', '2004-05-17 12:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(722768, 76704, 9821, '<td valign="top">too bad it''s so washed out in the center (flash?) ... good find</td>', 'too bad it''s so washed out in the center (flash?) ... good find', '2004-05-17 12:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(722769, 77032, 9821, '<td valign="top">I saw this on your website. My girlfriend and I liked it then, and I like it now. Great Job! ... 9</td>', 'I saw this on your website. My girlfriend and I liked it then, and I like it now. Great Job! ... 9', '2004-05-17 12:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(722770, 77039, 18403, '<td valign="top">The foreground trees seem too crisp, perhaps a reduction in contrast would help.  Nice composition! 7</td>', 'The foreground trees seem too crisp, perhaps a reduction in contrast would help.  Nice composition! 7', '2004-05-17 12:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(722771, 76363, 2764, '<td valign="top">ours is Clearwater9-8645</td>', 'ours is Clearwater9-8645', '2004-05-17 12:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(722772, 77102, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very impressive with the volumetric lighting. Excellent details even in the clouds. I think it would look better if the ground was cropped a bit more to allow more emphasis on the sun and sky. I also seems the horizon line is not 100% straight but if the ground really is that way, it can''t be helped so I won''t deduct for that. 7</td>', 'Very impressive with the volumetric lighting. Excellent details even in the clouds. I think it would look better if the ground was cropped a bit more to allow more emphasis on the sun and sky. I also seems the horizon line is not 100% straight but if the ground really is that way, it can''t be helped so I won''t deduct for that. 7', '2004-05-17 12:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(722773, 76538, 9821, '<td valign="top">i''m marking it down for not being able to see brain ... 1<br/> <br/>(all kidding aside - it''s out of focus, tilted, not centered, fake looking, and the thing which is supposed to be the "center" of attention is completely black with no detail at all)</td>', 'i''m marking it down for not being able to see brain ... 1 (all kidding aside - it''s out of focus, tilted, not centered, fake looking, and the thing which is supposed to be the "center" of attention is completely black with no detail at all)', '2004-05-17 12:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(722776, 76379, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very nice setup with excellent lighting and negative space. Only two minor flaws: camera might not have been level as I can see a slight angle and I might have cropped a bit tighter off the bottom. 7</td>', 'Very nice setup with excellent lighting and negative space. Only two minor flaws: camera might not have been level as I can see a slight angle and I might have cropped a bit tighter off the bottom. 7', '2004-05-17 12:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(722779, 77114, 20662, '<td valign="top">Would this have been more effective if you cropped in tighter? The bird is beautiful but bigger might have been better.</td>', 'Would this have been more effective if you cropped in tighter? The bird is beautiful but bigger might have been better.', '2004-05-17 12:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(722782, 76150, 2764, '<td valign="top">saturate the blues?<br/></td>', 'saturate the blues?', '2004-05-17 12:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(722783, 76762, 9821, '<td valign="top">just a little soft, but very good (not affecting my vote, but i don''t like the border).<br/> <br/>nice job</td>', 'just a little soft, but very good (not affecting my vote, but i don''t like the border). nice job', '2004-05-17 12:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(722784, 76753, 2764, '<td valign="top">the odd border makes it look like a still frame from a movie and maakes the whole scene appear to move - effective - 7</td>', 'the odd border makes it look like a still frame from a movie and maakes the whole scene appear to move - effective - 7', '2004-05-17 12:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(722788, 77138, 2764, '<td valign="top">oddly religious looking - 7</td>', 'oddly religious looking - 7', '2004-05-17 12:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(722789, 77014, 9821, '<td valign="top">nice lighting setup getting rid of all shadows</td>', 'nice lighting setup getting rid of all shadows', '2004-05-17 12:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(722791, 77022, 2764, '<td valign="top">eyeball is great - shiney skin id creepy - why ont crop waaay in and just have the green iris with the face?</td>', 'eyeball is great - shiney skin id creepy - why ont crop waaay in and just have the green iris with the face?', '2004-05-17 12:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(722793, 76961, 9821, '<td valign="top">very creative</td>', 'very creative', '2004-05-17 12:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(722804, 76292, 11738, '<td valign="top">Too bad about that thing sticking out on the left edge.  Cloning out the wires would have been good too.  Interesting crop.</td>', 'Too bad about that thing sticking out on the left edge.  Cloning out the wires would have been good too.  Interesting crop.', '2004-05-17 12:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(722808, 76609, 18403, '<td valign="top">Composition is great but the image quality is poor.  Focus is not crisp and the image seems to have a lot of noise.  An early morning or sunset photo might look better with the muted sunlight. Still a good effort.</td>', 'Composition is great but the image quality is poor.  Focus is not crisp and the image seems to have a lot of noise.  An early morning or sunset photo might look better with the muted sunlight. Still a good effort.', '2004-05-17 12:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(722809, 76740, 9821, '<td valign="top">i think you zoomed in too far ... great paint job :)</td>', 'i think you zoomed in too far ... great paint job :)', '2004-05-17 12:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(722812, 77059, 18403, '<td valign="top">Terrific composition, a bit over exposed. 7</td>', 'Terrific composition, a bit over exposed. 7', '2004-05-17 12:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(722819, 76753, 9821, '<td valign="top">the bright white sky takes away from it a little, but it''s an excellent shot</td>', 'the bright white sky takes away from it a little, but it''s an excellent shot', '2004-05-17 12:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(722820, 77129, 11895, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the focus but it''s a stretch to fit the challenge and the border looks gimmicky</td>', 'I like the colors and the focus but it''s a stretch to fit the challenge and the border looks gimmicky', '2004-05-17 12:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(722829, 77027, 9821, '<td valign="top">big feet</td>', 'big feet', '2004-05-17 12:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(722830, 77113, 18403, '<td valign="top">I think the natural colors would have been an improvement, but a nice shot anyway!</td>', 'I think the natural colors would have been an improvement, but a nice shot anyway!', '2004-05-17 12:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(722832, 75814, 18403, '<td valign="top">Perfect.</td>', 'Perfect.', '2004-05-17 12:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(722837, 76829, 11895, '<td valign="top">the blown out background is the only thing I don''t like about this one, very good fit for the challenge</td>', 'the blown out background is the only thing I don''t like about this one, very good fit for the challenge', '2004-05-17 12:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(722845, 76802, 5792, '<td valign="top">One of the better pet photos in a while.</td>', 'One of the better pet photos in a while.', '2004-05-17 12:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(722846, 77155, 18403, '<td valign="top">Difficult shot under the best of circumstances.  Would be improved if the reflection was in focus instead of the face.  Try using manual focus set to infinity. 7</td>', 'Difficult shot under the best of circumstances.  Would be improved if the reflection was in focus instead of the face.  Try using manual focus set to infinity. 7', '2004-05-17 13:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(722848, 77048, 18897, '<td valign="top">Very nice and compelling image, but the birdie stuff on the rock is disturbing. Not your fault it''s there but I think you could have cloned it away if you''d really wanted? Border works nicely on a centered subject I think.</td>', 'Very nice and compelling image, but the birdie stuff on the rock is disturbing. Not your fault it''s there but I think you could have cloned it away if you''d really wanted? Border works nicely on a centered subject I think.', '2004-05-17 13:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(722851, 76874, 18897, '<td valign="top">Just a few too many reflections in there...</td>', 'Just a few too many reflections in there...', '2004-05-17 13:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(722853, 76961, 18897, '<td valign="top">Points up for original composition :-)</td>', 'Points up for original composition :-)', '2004-05-17 13:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(722854, 76970, 18897, '<td valign="top">Very centered, but a bit on the dull side with the sky being all gray. Did you try other angles too, to bring in more/other subjects but with the headache sitll in center?</td>', 'Very centered, but a bit on the dull side with the sky being all gray. Did you try other angles too, to bring in more/other subjects but with the headache sitll in center?', '2004-05-17 13:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(722857, 76274, 18897, '<td valign="top">Love the dof and the sharpness in the water drop. Great colors everywhere. Not sure what to complain about here, so I won''t.</td>', 'Love the dof and the sharpness in the water drop. Great colors everywhere. Not sure what to complain about here, so I won''t.', '2004-05-17 13:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(722859, 76390, 327, '<td valign="top">Focus is just a bit soft. Maybe a bit more light. I love Peonies and know how sticky they are. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Focus is just a bit soft. Maybe a bit more light. I love Peonies and know how sticky they are. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-05-17 13:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(722860, 76389, 327, '<td valign="top">Light is a bit uneven and a lack of focus are hurting this shot. The flower is perfect for this challenge..</td>', 'Light is a bit uneven and a lack of focus are hurting this shot. The flower is perfect for this challenge..', '2004-05-17 13:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(722861, 76697, 327, '<td valign="top">The looooooong long sleep. :)</td>', 'The looooooong long sleep. :)', '2004-05-17 13:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(722865, 76704, 327, '<td valign="top">Funny to get two shots of these ants on Peonies. I went outside to see mine and ......yes covered with ants also!! :) That sticky must be very sweet. Your shot is okay but the light is harsh and causes a glare.</td>', 'Funny to get two shots of these ants on Peonies. I went outside to see mine and ......yes covered with ants also!! :) That sticky must be very sweet. Your shot is okay but the light is harsh and causes a glare.', '2004-05-17 13:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(722867, 76982, 5792, '<td valign="top">You might consider cropping it a little smaller to eliminate the shadow at the bottom, but leave the bug in the center. Still a very, very nice shot.</td>', 'You might consider cropping it a little smaller to eliminate the shadow at the bottom, but leave the bug in the center. Still a very, very nice shot.', '2004-05-17 13:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(722869, 75891, 18897, '<td valign="top">Very good macro stuff. Is the sharpness perhaps a little too close to the front? Seems you''ve blurred the straw a from the left side and left a too sharp line a cm in front of little ol'' bugger. Never mind that, I might be very wrong and it''s nitpicking anyways - I like it a lot, hope it does well!</td>', 'Very good macro stuff. Is the sharpness perhaps a little too close to the front? Seems you''ve blurred the straw a from the left side and left a too sharp line a cm in front of little ol'' bugger. Never mind that, I might be very wrong and it''s nitpicking anyways - I like it a lot, hope it does well!', '2004-05-17 13:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(722872, 75947, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice sepia tones</td>', 'Nice sepia tones', '2004-05-17 13:17:17.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(722873, 75927, 327, '<td valign="top">Fun take on the challenge. The light is harsh, and I wish I could see his eyes but I do like the idea here!</td>', 'Fun take on the challenge. The light is harsh, and I wish I could see his eyes but I do like the idea here!', '2004-05-17 13:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(722874, 77164, 18897, '<td valign="top">Well, it is centered, but it gives me the feeling of "it''s sunday and I''m out of ideas". I feel that the center object needs to hold more interest in itself to make this kind of composition work.</td>', 'Well, it is centered, but it gives me the feeling of "it''s sunday and I''m out of ideas". I feel that the center object needs to hold more interest in itself to make this kind of composition work.', '2004-05-17 13:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(722876, 76759, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, love the curves. Maybe a bit more focus. Good luck.</td>', 'Neat idea, love the curves. Maybe a bit more focus. Good luck.', '2004-05-17 13:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(722879, 76538, 327, '<td valign="top">Drama. I''ll bet that was fun cleaning up. I admire your creative thinking. Top of the head seems oof.</td>', 'Drama. I''ll bet that was fun cleaning up. I admire your creative thinking. Top of the head seems oof.', '2004-05-17 13:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(722882, 77149, 18897, '<td valign="top">You''re not alone in doing this but I''ll hand you the comment now, since it''s a "shame on a really nice image". This is not centered. I''ts close to, but it''s not. The house I''d say is the main object, and the door being the  very centerpoint of the house. Moving it out of the center probably makes for a better image, but in this challenge I feel it''s pushing the luck a bit.</td>', 'You''re not alone in doing this but I''ll hand you the comment now, since it''s a "shame on a really nice image". This is not centered. I''ts close to, but it''s not. The house I''d say is the main object, and the door being the  very centerpoint of the house. Moving it out of the center probably makes for a better image, but in this challenge I feel it''s pushing the luck a bit.', '2004-05-17 13:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(722885, 76853, 18897, '<td valign="top">And where was this shot in the silhouettes challenge? Good here, even better there. The colors are a little washed out towards the horizon. Perhaps a little contrast tweak and a saturation sponge to go with it?</td>', 'And where was this shot in the silhouettes challenge? Good here, even better there. The colors are a little washed out towards the horizon. Perhaps a little contrast tweak and a saturation sponge to go with it?', '2004-05-17 13:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(722886, 76351, 14620, '<td valign="top">Stunning!  Love the colors and the starkness of the background to help emphasize the beauty of the subject.  The splash of green is a nice touch.</td>', 'Stunning!  Love the colors and the starkness of the background to help emphasize the beauty of the subject.  The splash of green is a nice touch.', '2004-05-17 13:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(722887, 77141, 14620, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors!  I love the softness of the water against the rocks.  Very nice.</td>', 'Beautiful colors!  I love the softness of the water against the rocks.  Very nice.', '2004-05-17 13:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(722890, 77053, 14620, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition!  I Love the dark feel this photo has and I find the subject matter very intriguiging.</td>', 'Wonderful composition!  I Love the dark feel this photo has and I find the subject matter very intriguiging.', '2004-05-17 13:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(722893, 77168, 14620, '<td valign="top">Very Cool!!  Love the graininess of the photo and the textures are great.  I especially like the shadowing around the edges to bring more pop to the subject matter.  Well Done!</td>', 'Very Cool!!  Love the graininess of the photo and the textures are great.  I especially like the shadowing around the edges to bring more pop to the subject matter.  Well Done!', '2004-05-17 13:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(722895, 77137, 14620, '<td valign="top">Great clarity!! Love the colors and crispness  of the photo as well as the subject matter.</td>', 'Great clarity!! Love the colors and crispness  of the photo as well as the subject matter.', '2004-05-17 13:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(722898, 76259, 14620, '<td valign="top">Too Cute!  Love the expression!!</td>', 'Too Cute!  Love the expression!!', '2004-05-17 13:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(722901, 76855, 14620, '<td valign="top">Great colors!!  I really like the contrast of the dark subject against the bright, beautiful colors.</td>', 'Great colors!!  I really like the contrast of the dark subject against the bright, beautiful colors.', '2004-05-17 13:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(722909, 76880, 18897, '<td valign="top">Straight out of the family album and the kind of shot where you''d probably say "too centered" when asked. I think it still is - but since this is a centered challenge it makes one wonder if it might be ok? I personally don''t think so. I feel that the challenge here isn''t to just crop any subject down, but to find a subject that is centered and either so shaped/positioned that it lends itself to the alone composition or more likely supported by backgrounds, foregrounds and surroundings, creating a good composition while the main subject dead focus. Technically you have a working shot here and the happy girl is really heliping out, but I don''t think you''d entered it in any other challenge and the reasons goes for this one too.</td>', 'Straight out of the family album and the kind of shot where you''d probably say "too centered" when asked. I think it still is - but since this is a centered challenge it makes one wonder if it might be ok? I personally don''t think so. I feel that the challenge here isn''t to just crop any subject down, but to find a subject that is centered and either so shaped/positioned that it lends itself to the alone composition or more likely supported by backgrounds, foregrounds and surroundings, creating a good composition while the main subject dead focus. Technically you have a working shot here and the happy girl is really heliping out, but I don''t think you''d entered it in any other challenge and the reasons goes for this one too.', '2004-05-17 13:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(722911, 76821, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely beautiful. Great choice to use the sepia tones and I don''t care what anyone else says about the framing, it makes the shot! IMHO, of course. Well done. Good luck.</td>', 'This is absolutely beautiful. Great choice to use the sepia tones and I don''t care what anyone else says about the framing, it makes the shot! IMHO, of course. Well done. Good luck.', '2004-05-17 13:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(722915, 76540, 3032, '<td valign="top">Hey, where is the Vodka? Gary and no Vodka?<br/></td>', 'Hey, where is the Vodka? Gary and no Vodka?', '2004-05-17 13:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(722916, 77089, 18897, '<td valign="top">I realize one could argue that this one in fact is centered, but I do get the feeling that it isn''t. The blue bells catching the eye is way out of it and also not surrounding the center which would have helped out. On my TFT it looks a bit over-sharpened, something I manage to do a lot to my own images on my other (CRT) monitor. Skipping that last USM seems to be a good idea sometimes. It''s nothing I''d take points off for, just a possibly useful hint.</td>', 'I realize one could argue that this one in fact is centered, but I do get the feeling that it isn''t. The blue bells catching the eye is way out of it and also not surrounding the center which would have helped out. On my TFT it looks a bit over-sharpened, something I manage to do a lot to my own images on my other (CRT) monitor. Skipping that last USM seems to be a good idea sometimes. It''s nothing I''d take points off for, just a possibly useful hint.', '2004-05-17 13:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(722917, 76590, 9295, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this one. Extraordinary. I love how the depth of field forces the eye to the focal point and the bright greens are such a nice contrast to the color of the birds. You captured a rare scene beautifully. Good luck!</td>', 'I keep coming back to this one. Extraordinary. I love how the depth of field forces the eye to the focal point and the bright greens are such a nice contrast to the color of the birds. You captured a rare scene beautifully. Good luck!', '2004-05-17 13:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(722918, 76847, 18897, '<td valign="top">Ah, untitled when it should have been "Litteraly Centered". Nice colors in this one!</td>', 'Ah, untitled when it should have been "Litteraly Centered". Nice colors in this one!', '2004-05-17 13:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(722921, 77153, 9295, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, although your shot fits the challenge , I don''t think it is one that benefits from the "centered subject" theme. My feeling is that the purpose of the challenge is to find a subject that feels better centered than if you were to offset it. With this picture, although the focus is good and the bright color of the grass is appealing, the stroller, especially coupled with your title, does not give me the sense of Lost Childhood as well as if it were the more typical "rule of thirds" composition.</td>', 'Unfortunately, although your shot fits the challenge , I don''t think it is one that benefits from the "centered subject" theme. My feeling is that the purpose of the challenge is to find a subject that feels better centered than if you were to offset it. With this picture, although the focus is good and the bright color of the grass is appealing, the stroller, especially coupled with your title, does not give me the sense of Lost Childhood as well as if it were the more typical "rule of thirds" composition.', '2004-05-17 13:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(722923, 77159, 2764, '<td valign="top">Ahhhh - and a lovely border too 10</td>', 'Ahhhh - and a lovely border too 10', '2004-05-17 13:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(722924, 77060, 18897, '<td valign="top">Great challenge interpretation and good use of the advanced editing possibilities. Perhaps a bit overexposed right side of the face? I think I would have gone at it to leave more focus on the eye.</td>', 'Great challenge interpretation and good use of the advanced editing possibilities. Perhaps a bit overexposed right side of the face? I think I would have gone at it to leave more focus on the eye.', '2004-05-17 13:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(722926, 76682, 16777, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I am not crazy about the frame though.</td>', 'Great shot, I am not crazy about the frame though.', '2004-05-17 13:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(722927, 76971, 16777, '<td valign="top">Seems a little out of focus.</td>', 'Seems a little out of focus.', '2004-05-17 13:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(722930, 76919, 18897, '<td valign="top">Hehe, one of the few images not having anything at all in the center that I feel meet the challenge well anyway. Either the angle or the light is creating the illusion of the right arrow being longer, not sure it actually is, but I would have adjusted a bit for that in the cropping.</td>', 'Hehe, one of the few images not having anything at all in the center that I feel meet the challenge well anyway. Either the angle or the light is creating the illusion of the right arrow being longer, not sure it actually is, but I would have adjusted a bit for that in the cropping.', '2004-05-17 13:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(722932, 76458, 12857, '<td valign="top">Most of the other flowers I scored average.  I like what you did here.  It made your entry really stand out from all the others.  Good Job</td>', 'Most of the other flowers I scored average.  I like what you did here.  It made your entry really stand out from all the others.  Good Job', '2004-05-17 13:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
