(723240, 76577, 20992, '<td valign="top">how did you manage to keep the bee so still?? <br/>Amazing shot, but the purple background makes it somewhat humourous and I think that''s a shame, since it is such a beautiful macro..</td>', 'how did you manage to keep the bee so still?? Amazing shot, but the purple background makes it somewhat humourous and I think that''s a shame, since it is such a beautiful macro..', '2004-05-17 17:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(723243, 76504, 20992, '<td valign="top">nice! Everything is pointing outwards, nice daring colours of nature.. great dynamics in this picture, for once I like the small DOF in those flower pictures (since you didn''t explicitly portraited the flower as a flower, but as a composition)</td>', 'nice! Everything is pointing outwards, nice daring colours of nature.. great dynamics in this picture, for once I like the small DOF in those flower pictures (since you didn''t explicitly portraited the flower as a flower, but as a composition)', '2004-05-17 17:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(723250, 77110, 20992, '<td valign="top">whooh red! I would have liked the sky to be a bit more blue to give more ''life'' to the red and two more ''but''s: it seems like the lighthouse is a bit out of balance and the border...it''s personal, I know, but I find it an offence to your own creativity to let photoshop create this cliche border around your photo.. There are a lot more aspects in your picture that I do like, I give it a 7</td>', 'whooh red! I would have liked the sky to be a bit more blue to give more ''life'' to the red and two more ''but''s: it seems like the lighthouse is a bit out of balance and the border...it''s personal, I know, but I find it an offence to your own creativity to let photoshop create this cliche border around your photo.. There are a lot more aspects in your picture that I do like, I give it a 7', '2004-05-17 17:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(723252, 77169, 20992, '<td valign="top">shame about that front foot, but then again, it is about the girl.. great colours, fit well together, the red on the little girl just makes her get even more attention (apart from being centered!)</td>', 'shame about that front foot, but then again, it is about the girl.. great colours, fit well together, the red on the little girl just makes her get even more attention (apart from being centered!)', '2004-05-17 17:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(723254, 77055, 20992, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but it''s a bit too obvious that you used a CD for this..the colours are realy splashing, but the eye is too dark to be in the center of attention, unfortunately the heavy colours snatch all of it away from the center.. Further more, there is grain in your picture that isn''t in it''s place here...</td>', 'I like the idea, but it''s a bit too obvious that you used a CD for this..the colours are realy splashing, but the eye is too dark to be in the center of attention, unfortunately the heavy colours snatch all of it away from the center.. Further more, there is grain in your picture that isn''t in it''s place here...', '2004-05-17 17:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(723255, 77138, 16301, '<td valign="top">Icelandic sailor? Where is his boat? Did it sink?<br/> <br/>You know, there are excellent photos in this challenge, but the originality in this one just strikes me. Thanks for blowing my mind with this photo, a 10 for that.<br/> <br/>Good luck...</td>', 'Icelandic sailor? Where is his boat? Did it sink? You know, there are excellent photos in this challenge, but the originality in this one just strikes me. Thanks for blowing my mind with this photo, a 10 for that. Good luck...', '2004-05-17 17:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(723257, 76149, 20992, '<td valign="top">this picture has the "aaah factor" all over it!! Pity that it seems like you zoomed in a bit too mucht..it''s not sharp..a little bit unsharpness can help the little duck become more furry and soft, but this is too much..</td>', 'this picture has the "aaah factor" all over it!! Pity that it seems like you zoomed in a bit too mucht..it''s not sharp..a little bit unsharpness can help the little duck become more furry and soft, but this is too much..', '2004-05-17 17:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(723260, 76969, 20992, '<td valign="top">great catch! That worm''s days are over!! Unfortunately you seemed to have zoomed in too much so that the overall picture became unsharp..pity...</td>', 'great catch! That worm''s days are over!! Unfortunately you seemed to have zoomed in too much so that the overall picture became unsharp..pity...', '2004-05-17 17:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(723263, 76618, 5354, '<td valign="top">Number one for me - superb crop, and that face ;-)</td>', 'Number one for me - superb crop, and that face ;-)', '2004-05-17 17:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(723265, 76850, 5354, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, one of the top images of the challeng for me. Congrats.</td>', 'Beautiful image, one of the top images of the challeng for me. Congrats.', '2004-05-17 17:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(723266, 76672, 20992, '<td valign="top">even though the clock tower is in the center of the composition it looks very odd there so far away from me, the spectator... It looks as if the parc and the trees are the main subjects of interest and then suddenly there is that tower! The effect is, mentioned already, odd and I don''t realy like it..but on the other hand you score some points for making creative use of the centered composition by overruling all rules about it!!</td>', 'even though the clock tower is in the center of the composition it looks very odd there so far away from me, the spectator... It looks as if the parc and the trees are the main subjects of interest and then suddenly there is that tower! The effect is, mentioned already, odd and I don''t realy like it..but on the other hand you score some points for making creative use of the centered composition by overruling all rules about it!!', '2004-05-17 17:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(723268, 76273, 5354, '<td valign="top">Aaagh !! - looks like an alien face. <br/>Wonderful image, top marks from me.</td>', 'Aaagh !! - looks like an alien face. Wonderful image, top marks from me.', '2004-05-17 17:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(723270, 77168, 5354, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully start, love the shading around the edge.</td>', 'Wonderfully start, love the shading around the edge.', '2004-05-17 17:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(723272, 76684, 8522, '<td valign="top">This photo makes me REALLY dizzy, as I''m not too fond of heights. I''d have liked to see the edge of the platform at the bottom straightened. I feel the greens are a tad over-saturated. Interesting and unsusual composition, which works well. Nice use of symmetry.</td>', 'This photo makes me REALLY dizzy, as I''m not too fond of heights. I''d have liked to see the edge of the platform at the bottom straightened. I feel the greens are a tad over-saturated. Interesting and unsusual composition, which works well. Nice use of symmetry.', '2004-05-17 17:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(723273, 76990, 5354, '<td valign="top">Excellent image, one of my favourites</td>', 'Excellent image, one of my favourites', '2004-05-17 17:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(723276, 77102, 20992, '<td valign="top">it seems like you couldn''t chose between the sun and the ..eh..thingy (and your horizon is not straight..) so I would have liked it more when you would have chosen only 1 subject..now it is a bit of a chaos there in the middle in an otherwise serene shot..Apart from that I think you have caught a great light, great colour and that must be rewarded!</td>', 'it seems like you couldn''t chose between the sun and the ..eh..thingy (and your horizon is not straight..) so I would have liked it more when you would have chosen only 1 subject..now it is a bit of a chaos there in the middle in an otherwise serene shot..Apart from that I think you have caught a great light, great colour and that must be rewarded!', '2004-05-17 17:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(723277, 76789, 8522, '<td valign="top">This photo doesn''t really connect with me... I wonder what you were trying to achieve with this shot. I don''t think your choice of b&amp;w helped here, as the result is a bit flat and dull. More sharpening is needed.</td>', 'This photo doesn''t really connect with me... I wonder what you were trying to achieve with this shot. I don''t think your choice of b&w helped here, as the result is a bit flat and dull. More sharpening is needed.', '2004-05-17 17:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(723281, 76274, 9763, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.  I love the DOF, the clarity, the subject.  Great color, tone, feel and composition (centered works perfectly for this photo).  The only thing I would change would be the lighting under the leaf... I''d add a tiny little bit to lighten the eggs.  I love the square crop!</td>', 'Beautiful photo.  I love the DOF, the clarity, the subject.  Great color, tone, feel and composition (centered works perfectly for this photo).  The only thing I would change would be the lighting under the leaf... I''d add a tiny little bit to lighten the eggs.  I love the square crop!', '2004-05-17 17:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(723283, 76959, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great shot, shame the lighting is a bit too harsh. Some nice colours. More sharpness would also have been good. Maybe this is picky, but I wouldn''t call this centred. The head/eyes are the focal point of any animal, which is not in the centre here. I''m not convinced by your post-processing which has left a posterised effect as the different levels of colour don''t run into each other smoothly. I suspect this is a side-effect of NeatImage gone a bit wrong.</td>', 'Great shot, shame the lighting is a bit too harsh. Some nice colours. More sharpness would also have been good. Maybe this is picky, but I wouldn''t call this centred. The head/eyes are the focal point of any animal, which is not in the centre here. I''m not convinced by your post-processing which has left a posterised effect as the different levels of colour don''t run into each other smoothly. I suspect this is a side-effect of NeatImage gone a bit wrong.', '2004-05-17 17:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(723284, 76541, 20992, '<td valign="top">I recognize it as a watch, but why didn''t you show the front of it?? Even when you''ve called the picture ''dawn of time''... Further: smart use of two objects that together create an almost surreal sphere (I realy would have liked seeing the numbers..), but a bit boring colouring..great idea though!</td>', 'I recognize it as a watch, but why didn''t you show the front of it?? Even when you''ve called the picture ''dawn of time''... Further: smart use of two objects that together create an almost surreal sphere (I realy would have liked seeing the numbers..), but a bit boring colouring..great idea though!', '2004-05-17 17:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(723286, 76272, 9763, '<td valign="top">Nice photo overall, but I would change it in the following ways: lessen the lighting it is getting, fill the background with more petals (to cover the green), show more contrast between petals with different lighting, focus a little clearer on the pink center, it''s a bit out of focus.  I like the feel of the photo.</td>', 'Nice photo overall, but I would change it in the following ways: lessen the lighting it is getting, fill the background with more petals (to cover the green), show more contrast between petals with different lighting, focus a little clearer on the pink center, it''s a bit out of focus.  I like the feel of the photo.', '2004-05-17 17:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(723289, 76862, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice, technically competent shot. Shame the sky is overcast. Lacking the ''wow'' factor for me here.</td>', 'Nice, technically competent shot. Shame the sky is overcast. Lacking the ''wow'' factor for me here.', '2004-05-17 17:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(723290, 77180, 20992, '<td valign="top">unusual photo that stands out of the rest because the centered object isn''t that obviously visible..I think it''s great though and I must add some points only for creativism and daring to send this in!</td>', 'unusual photo that stands out of the rest because the centered object isn''t that obviously visible..I think it''s great though and I must add some points only for creativism and daring to send this in!', '2004-05-17 17:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(723291, 76408, 9821, '<td valign="top">great job</td>', 'great job', '2004-05-17 17:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(723292, 77179, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting snapshot... but would have been much more interesting with a real spider! Highlights are a bit burnt out. Very effective dof.</td>', 'Interesting snapshot... but would have been much more interesting with a real spider! Highlights are a bit burnt out. Very effective dof.', '2004-05-17 17:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(723293, 76952, 20992, '<td valign="top">:lol: pity though that you didn''t work this marvelous idea out better: the white could have been more white and the object is not realy sharp..</td>', ':lol: pity though that you didn''t work this marvelous idea out better: the white could have been more white and the object is not realy sharp..', '2004-05-17 17:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(723295, 76633, 9763, '<td valign="top">Wow, will this be a butterfly?  I really love the color, water drops, composition, lighting and focus.  I think the background is bit overpowering with white.  Light blue or dull white (like overcast) may have been better, but hard to control of course.  The webbing in the top corner takes away from the overall appeal, but is not bad.  Again, the composition is beautiful!!!</td>', 'Wow, will this be a butterfly?  I really love the color, water drops, composition, lighting and focus.  I think the background is bit overpowering with white.  Light blue or dull white (like overcast) may have been better, but hard to control of course.  The webbing in the top corner takes away from the overall appeal, but is not bad.  Again, the composition is beautiful!!!', '2004-05-17 17:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(723296, 76150, 9763, '<td valign="top">This photo is a bit grainy and out of focus.  I like the subject''s expression.  The photo has real interest.  It would be better with focus and clarity.  Also, the colors a tad drab.  I''d like to see his blue eyes shine!</td>', 'This photo is a bit grainy and out of focus.  I like the subject''s expression.  The photo has real interest.  It would be better with focus and clarity.  Also, the colors a tad drab.  I''d like to see his blue eyes shine!', '2004-05-17 17:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(723297, 77011, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great shot, spoilt by a few blemishes that could have been cloned out (Bottom left of frame, top third of frame off-centre to the right). I''d have prefered a tad more contrast. Great colour, composition and effect.</td>', 'Great shot, spoilt by a few blemishes that could have been cloned out (Bottom left of frame, top third of frame off-centre to the right). I''d have prefered a tad more contrast. Great colour, composition and effect.', '2004-05-17 17:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(723298, 77155, 20992, '<td valign="top">this one plays with me! I have seen this idea been worked out before though and then the person who wore the glasses was completely sharp, I miss that here, also the overlighted areas on the nose and on the right of the face are a bit disturbing..composition and colours are realy smooth though..like it a lot!!!</td>', 'this one plays with me! I have seen this idea been worked out before though and then the person who wore the glasses was completely sharp, I miss that here, also the overlighted areas on the nose and on the right of the face are a bit disturbing..composition and colours are realy smooth though..like it a lot!!!', '2004-05-17 17:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(723299, 76762, 20779, '<td valign="top">One of my 4 top picks for this challenge. Perfect just the way it is.</td>', 'One of my 4 top picks for this challenge. Perfect just the way it is.', '2004-05-17 17:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(723301, 77014, 9763, '<td valign="top">Great lighting!!!  I like how professional this looks.  It''s not the most exciting subject ever, but it''s enticing.  I want to eat it!  I like how small it is too, glad you didn''t blow it up more (though others may say otherwise).  Technically, great.  Interest, okay.  Good job.</td>', 'Great lighting!!!  I like how professional this looks.  It''s not the most exciting subject ever, but it''s enticing.  I want to eat it!  I like how small it is too, glad you didn''t blow it up more (though others may say otherwise).  Technically, great.  Interest, okay.  Good job.', '2004-05-17 17:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(723302, 76144, 20779, '<td valign="top">This is one of my top 4. I am curious to see how the rest of DPC repsonds to the colorization. I think it''s done beautifully and the colors blend softly.</td>', 'This is one of my top 4. I am curious to see how the rest of DPC repsonds to the colorization. I think it''s done beautifully and the colors blend softly.', '2004-05-17 17:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(723304, 76361, 9763, '<td valign="top">Kermit got fat and lost his shiny green!  Heehee, nice shot.  I like the clarity and focus.  The bottom right corner is a bit distracting.  The color is very nice, so is the lighting. Would also like to see less shadow.</td>', 'Kermit got fat and lost his shiny green!  Heehee, nice shot.  I like the clarity and focus.  The bottom right corner is a bit distracting.  The color is very nice, so is the lighting. Would also like to see less shadow.', '2004-05-17 18:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(723305, 76672, 8522, '<td valign="top">I''d have used the ''distort'' or ''perspective'' tools in PS to correct the leaning verticals on the right. Sky is a bit washed out... a little less exposure would have helped, you could have rescued the shadow detail using curves in PS. Shot is lacking a ''wow'' factor for me.</td>', 'I''d have used the ''distort'' or ''perspective'' tools in PS to correct the leaning verticals on the right. Sky is a bit washed out... a little less exposure would have helped, you could have rescued the shadow detail using curves in PS. Shot is lacking a ''wow'' factor for me.', '2004-05-17 18:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(723306, 77048, 20779, '<td valign="top">One of my top 4 this round. Truly takes me in, and for me, nothing I would change about it.</td>', 'One of my top 4 this round. Truly takes me in, and for me, nothing I would change about it.', '2004-05-17 18:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(723308, 77149, 20992, '<td valign="top">the house is in the center, but meanwhile everything else gets my attention, because the house looks a bit dull..the tree in the front is also blocking my sight..maybe you should have stepped a few metres to the front??</td>', 'the house is in the center, but meanwhile everything else gets my attention, because the house looks a bit dull..the tree in the front is also blocking my sight..maybe you should have stepped a few metres to the front??', '2004-05-17 18:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(723309, 76259, 20779, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big frog fan, but this is done too well too ignore! One of my top 4 picks this time. It''s just perfect.</td>', 'I''m not a big frog fan, but this is done too well too ignore! One of my top 4 picks this time. It''s just perfect.', '2004-05-17 18:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(723310, 76988, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great capture... but you need to reduce the noise in the background using NeatImage. Shot has perhaps a little too much contrast... I''d like to see the tree trunk a tad darker and the background a tad lighter.</td>', 'Great capture... but you need to reduce the noise in the background using NeatImage. Shot has perhaps a little too much contrast... I''d like to see the tree trunk a tad darker and the background a tad lighter.', '2004-05-17 18:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(723311, 77162, 20992, '<td valign="top">when the dog would have looked into the camera it would have been a lot more appealing to me..nice fluffy dog though!</td>', 'when the dog would have looked into the camera it would have been a lot more appealing to me..nice fluffy dog though!', '2004-05-17 18:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(723313, 76773, 20779, '<td valign="top">Fantastic, compelling shot. I hope you don''t lose anything for being a central focus instead of perfect "centric" composition. 8.</td>', 'Fantastic, compelling shot. I hope you don''t lose anything for being a central focus instead of perfect "centric" composition. 8.', '2004-05-17 18:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(723314, 76751, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great shot... a little too much contrast for my taste here though. I''d like to see more detail in the figure. NeatImage in the sky would have helped with the noise levels, and you really need to clone out the white pixel dots in the sea. Love the shallow dof.</td>', 'Great shot... a little too much contrast for my taste here though. I''d like to see more detail in the figure. NeatImage in the sky would have helped with the noise levels, and you really need to clone out the white pixel dots in the sea. Love the shallow dof.', '2004-05-17 18:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(723319, 76158, 20992, '<td valign="top">great one! This must score high, and not because it shows a naked woman, but because of the use of light and the adding of grain is superb, her hands are not only hiding her butt (excuse me if this isn''t a decent English word, but I don''t know many words for it in English and this one seemed the most decent one..) but they become part of the whole picture.. the background works just right for the paleness of the model and her hair!</td>', 'great one! This must score high, and not because it shows a naked woman, but because of the use of light and the adding of grain is superb, her hands are not only hiding her butt (excuse me if this isn''t a decent English word, but I don''t know many words for it in English and this one seemed the most decent one..) but they become part of the whole picture.. the background works just right for the paleness of the model and her hair!', '2004-05-17 18:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(723321, 75934, 8522, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous... I''d have liked the sky colours a tad richer. I love how the lights in the reflection are made much longer.</td>', 'Gorgeous... I''d have liked the sky colours a tad richer. I love how the lights in the reflection are made much longer.', '2004-05-17 18:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(723322, 77138, 20779, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking. As far as I am concerned this is a central focus and that is what this challenge is about for me. I am not sure if the luminous backround with the plain, matte fabric being worn in contrast moves it one notch up or down for me. I''ll let you know if I decide! 8.</td>', 'Breathtaking. As far as I am concerned this is a central focus and that is what this challenge is about for me. I am not sure if the luminous backround with the plain, matte fabric being worn in contrast moves it one notch up or down for me. I''ll let you know if I decide! 8.', '2004-05-17 18:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(723323, 77039, 9763, '<td valign="top">Beatiful photo.  Too bad that street sign is over to the right.  Nice center of the road.  The bottom corners are a bit dark though.  I love the fog.  Though the focus should be on the line in the center in the road, the trees pull you outward, which takes away from "dead center", but it''s still very very nice.  I see the end of the road is dead center and the feel is so great! 9</td>', 'Beatiful photo.  Too bad that street sign is over to the right.  Nice center of the road.  The bottom corners are a bit dark though.  I love the fog.  Though the focus should be on the line in the center in the road, the trees pull you outward, which takes away from "dead center", but it''s still very very nice.  I see the end of the road is dead center and the feel is so great! 9', '2004-05-17 18:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(723325, 76991, 20992, '<td valign="top">you photographed into the sunlight and now it is falling over your centerpiece!</td>', 'you photographed into the sunlight and now it is falling over your centerpiece!', '2004-05-17 18:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(723328, 76872, 9763, '<td valign="top">Creepy, but cool.  I like the concept.  The color is a bit drab.  The shadow could be fixed with additional fill in light.  Nice clarity.</td>', 'Creepy, but cool.  I like the concept.  The color is a bit drab.  The shadow could be fixed with additional fill in light.  Nice clarity.', '2004-05-17 18:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(723329, 76379, 20779, '<td valign="top">Yes, it''s a classic, some say overdone, concept . . . but the perfect pop of color and the graceful lines made it an 8 for me. It is a slightest variance from the usual too, in that it is a rich dark brown background vs. a black one.</td>', 'Yes, it''s a classic, some say overdone, concept . . . but the perfect pop of color and the graceful lines made it an 8 for me. It is a slightest variance from the usual too, in that it is a rich dark brown background vs. a black one.', '2004-05-17 18:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(723330, 76085, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great shot, almost perfectly symmetrical. Very arresting image. Some great colours, especially in the skylights.</td>', 'Great shot, almost perfectly symmetrical. Very arresting image. Some great colours, especially in the skylights.', '2004-05-17 18:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(723331, 76577, 9763, '<td valign="top">My favorite photo of the challenge!  Congrats.  I hope you get a ribbon!  This is pure perfection.  If this bee is alive, you deserve an award.  If dead, well.... nice job in focus and interest.  Great color!!!</td>', 'My favorite photo of the challenge!  Congrats.  I hope you get a ribbon!  This is pure perfection.  If this bee is alive, you deserve an award.  If dead, well.... nice job in focus and interest.  Great color!!!', '2004-05-17 18:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(723334, 77003, 16595, '<td valign="top">looks like a wasp to me.Very nice macro though</td>', 'looks like a wasp to me.Very nice macro though', '2004-05-17 18:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(723336, 77171, 8522, '<td valign="top">Bit of an overdose of sepia here... too much red or magenta. Good sepia effects are usually quite subtle. Compositionally there is so much texture here, it is hard to know what to focus on. Maybe colour would have been better.</td>', 'Bit of an overdose of sepia here... too much red or magenta. Good sepia effects are usually quite subtle. Compositionally there is so much texture here, it is hard to know what to focus on. Maybe colour would have been better.', '2004-05-17 18:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(723337, 76925, 20779, '<td valign="top">Perfect catch.</td>', 'Perfect catch.', '2004-05-17 18:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(723338, 77059, 20992, '<td valign="top">yep great composition! Maybe the grass is a bit over saturated, but on the other hand that works well in this picture!! (and knowing the cow doesn''t even know he''s the center of attention over here makes it even more nice!!)</td>', 'yep great composition! Maybe the grass is a bit over saturated, but on the other hand that works well in this picture!! (and knowing the cow doesn''t even know he''s the center of attention over here makes it even more nice!!)', '2004-05-17 18:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(723340, 76802, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very different. Really stood out to me. I hope people don''t berate you for a perfect center thing. 8.</td>', 'Very different. Really stood out to me. I hope people don''t berate you for a perfect center thing. 8.', '2004-05-17 18:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(723341, 77182, 20992, '<td valign="top">the sky is coloured in or something and that is a pity..because this is a great shot, it''s humourous!!</td>', 'the sky is coloured in or something and that is a pity..because this is a great shot, it''s humourous!!', '2004-05-17 18:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(723343, 77177, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Very unusual composition that almost works for me. I feel the photo is lopsided a tad as my eye keeps being drawn to the left which is disconcerting for my sense of balance. Gorgeous colours and saturation. Great lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful. Very unusual composition that almost works for me. I feel the photo is lopsided a tad as my eye keeps being drawn to the left which is disconcerting for my sense of balance. Gorgeous colours and saturation. Great lighting.', '2004-05-17 18:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(723346, 76158, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing shot and I am not even a man! Extremely well done, and the B &amp; W was a great choice -- that''s what makes it so classy, but not dull. This is another one I hope people don''t make a issue of a perfectly centered "object".</td>', 'Very intriguing shot and I am not even a man! Extremely well done, and the B & W was a great choice -- that''s what makes it so classy, but not dull. This is another one I hope people don''t make a issue of a perfectly centered "object".', '2004-05-17 18:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(723348, 77168, 20992, '<td valign="top">Ooh I like this a lot!! This is photojournalism style.. nice b/w (lots pure blacks and pure whites..great!) the grain adds that little more..wauw this one is really really great!! This one must score high, it must!!</td>', 'Ooh I like this a lot!! This is photojournalism style.. nice b/w (lots pure blacks and pure whites..great!) the grain adds that little more..wauw this one is really really great!! This one must score high, it must!!', '2004-05-17 18:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(723349, 76618, 20779, '<td valign="top">This would go great with my Abstract entry! I liked this very much and the minimal use of color really works.</td>', 'This would go great with my Abstract entry! I liked this very much and the minimal use of color really works.', '2004-05-17 18:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(723350, 76495, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great use of this often used technique... here it seems quite fresh. I love the textures at the bottom of the frame. Nice sharpness. Nice idea to have a reflection at the bottom. Great silhouette at the top. Lovely colour and saturation.</td>', 'Great use of this often used technique... here it seems quite fresh. I love the textures at the bottom of the frame. Nice sharpness. Nice idea to have a reflection at the bottom. Great silhouette at the top. Lovely colour and saturation.', '2004-05-17 18:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(723352, 76968, 20779, '<td valign="top">This is one of those that pulled me back and made me realize what a great composition it is. Not just a snapshot at all.</td>', 'This is one of those that pulled me back and made me realize what a great composition it is. Not just a snapshot at all.', '2004-05-17 18:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(723353, 77060, 20779, '<td valign="top">Not sure if this will score well with most people, but I really think it is a striking, well focused, colorful photo that really grabs you. The eyes being the "center" works for me. I also like the contrast of dark behind him, light in front.</td>', 'Not sure if this will score well with most people, but I really think it is a striking, well focused, colorful photo that really grabs you. The eyes being the "center" works for me. I also like the contrast of dark behind him, light in front.', '2004-05-17 18:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(723355, 76347, 20779, '<td valign="top">Couldn''t resist him/her, even though I usually score pet photos on the low side. This is so well done, and really is a centered composition that works.</td>', 'Couldn''t resist him/her, even though I usually score pet photos on the low side. This is so well done, and really is a centered composition that works.', '2004-05-17 18:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(723357, 76740, 20779, '<td valign="top">I will be interested to see how other people react . . . it is very "processed" and not centered in the usual way, but it really stands out to me as a great composition and treatment.</td>', 'I will be interested to see how other people react . . . it is very "processed" and not centered in the usual way, but it really stands out to me as a great composition and treatment.', '2004-05-17 18:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(723360, 76850, 20779, '<td valign="top">I really think this is a fun idea here and certainly "meets the challenge". The composition or focal interest is quite strong enough for me to really draw me in. I also think hte seeds of the berry might be a little busy with the surrounding bubbles. Very good focus. The white sections are a little distracting.</td>', 'I really think this is a fun idea here and certainly "meets the challenge". The composition or focal interest is quite strong enough for me to really draw me in. I also think hte seeds of the berry might be a little busy with the surrounding bubbles. Very good focus. The white sections are a little distracting.', '2004-05-17 18:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(723362, 77129, 20779, '<td valign="top">I hope people look at this long enough to really appreciate the "center" here. I love the strong colors, too. Very well done!</td>', 'I hope people look at this long enough to really appreciate the "center" here. I love the strong colors, too. Very well done!', '2004-05-17 18:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(723365, 77160, 20779, '<td valign="top">This is truly an intriguing view and great textures and lighting. I scored it a little lower for just not having a strong interest/focus for me. Browns are a bit dominant for my taste.</td>', 'This is truly an intriguing view and great textures and lighting. I scored it a little lower for just not having a strong interest/focus for me. Browns are a bit dominant for my taste.', '2004-05-17 18:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(723370, 76919, 20992, '<td valign="top">great!! You had a lucky eye finding this one!!</td>', 'great!! You had a lucky eye finding this one!!', '2004-05-17 18:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(723371, 76104, 15002, '<td valign="top">beautiful picture but the center of the frame is the lawn</td>', 'beautiful picture but the center of the frame is the lawn', '2004-05-17 18:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(723372, 77182, 15002, '<td valign="top">very cool perspective</td>', 'very cool perspective', '2004-05-17 18:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(723373, 76150, 20779, '<td valign="top">Great photojournalism feel; focus a bit soft, but that might be right for this one. I am not picky about the center thing, but it didn''t really make me that there was a strong focal point centered either. The subject is not my taste, so that may affect me giving it a lower score than otherwise.</td>', 'Great photojournalism feel; focus a bit soft, but that might be right for this one. I am not picky about the center thing, but it didn''t really make me that there was a strong focal point centered either. The subject is not my taste, so that may affect me giving it a lower score than otherwise.', '2004-05-17 18:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(723376, 76741, 20779, '<td valign="top">Cute clsoe-up. I feel that the cropping is "making" this a centered focus for me and not the subject or shot. Focus is a bit hazy. If you could shoot him looking up a little more so you "catch" his eye, I think it would make it a more lively or engaging shot.</td>', 'Cute clsoe-up. I feel that the cropping is "making" this a centered focus for me and not the subject or shot. Focus is a bit hazy. If you could shoot him looking up a little more so you "catch" his eye, I think it would make it a more lively or engaging shot.', '2004-05-17 18:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(723377, 77180, 15002, '<td valign="top">i love the picture.  is this your Mustang?  However to me the steering wheel is focus of attention, not the shifter.</td>', 'i love the picture.  is this your Mustang?  However to me the steering wheel is focus of attention, not the shifter.', '2004-05-17 18:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(723378, 76698, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, crisp colors and definition. For me, too much center and not enough surrounding area.</td>', 'Beautiful, crisp colors and definition. For me, too much center and not enough surrounding area.', '2004-05-17 18:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(723383, 76970, 20779, '<td valign="top">It meets the challenge, but has no real interest for me. The tree distracts. If the tree were removed, and the colors brightened/contrasted up a bit more, I think it might have more interest.</td>', 'It meets the challenge, but has no real interest for me. The tree distracts. If the tree were removed, and the colors brightened/contrasted up a bit more, I think it might have more interest.', '2004-05-17 18:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(723386, 76335, 15002, '<td valign="top">leveling the shelves would help</td>', 'leveling the shelves would help', '2004-05-17 18:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(723388, 77061, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very interesting ring of fire effect. I think it would have been even more interesting with some detail still visible inside the candle/ring. The texture of the wax is well shot, but not necessarily appealing to me.</td>', 'Very interesting ring of fire effect. I think it would have been even more interesting with some detail still visible inside the candle/ring. The texture of the wax is well shot, but not necessarily appealing to me.', '2004-05-17 18:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(723391, 76981, 16636, '<td valign="top">Shame that the sky is so bleached out. Nice tight crop</td>', 'Shame that the sky is so bleached out. Nice tight crop', '2004-05-17 18:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(723392, 76855, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very colorful and crisp. I feel that for me it is too tightly cropped in order to "make" it a centered composition. It doesn''t draw me in. It could use a little straightening. IHere, the column goes thorugh our whole picture; I would like to have seen the original to see where it is in relation to its surroundings.</td>', 'Very colorful and crisp. I feel that for me it is too tightly cropped in order to "make" it a centered composition. It doesn''t draw me in. It could use a little straightening. IHere, the column goes thorugh our whole picture; I would like to have seen the original to see where it is in relation to its surroundings.', '2004-05-17 18:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(723394, 77113, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot and nice pinstriped ring. I need a little more interest, focus or contrast to make me want to look. Focus too fuzzy for me for this purpose; reminds me of any x-ray.</td>', 'Very interesting shot and nice pinstriped ring. I need a little more interest, focus or contrast to make me want to look. Focus too fuzzy for me for this purpose; reminds me of any x-ray.', '2004-05-17 18:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(723396, 77157, 21367, '<td valign="top">Very cool, could use a little more lighting and sharpness in the center.</td>', 'Very cool, could use a little more lighting and sharpness in the center.', '2004-05-17 18:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(723398, 76805, 16636, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot, nice take on the challenge - 9</td>', 'I like this one a lot, nice take on the challenge - 9', '2004-05-17 18:39:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(723399, 76998, 20779, '<td valign="top">Her red board really "pops". If the focus were a little sharper and a little less "busy", it could a bit more effective, I thnk.</td>', 'Her red board really "pops". If the focus were a little sharper and a little less "busy", it could a bit more effective, I thnk.', '2004-05-17 18:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(723400, 77060, 21367, '<td valign="top">Theres a lot going on in this picture, moving drumstick and necklace seem to draw me away from your intended target.  Nice expression, nice shot.</td>', 'Theres a lot going on in this picture, moving drumstick and necklace seem to draw me away from your intended target.  Nice expression, nice shot.', '2004-05-17 18:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(723402, 76671, 20779, '<td valign="top">Love the brilliant colors. Is the center one raised above on glass, so that it appears so separated? I think it would be a more engaging shot with less contrast between the foreground and background focus. I probably would have cleaned up the white dots on the center candy -- but that is a picky thing.</td>', 'Love the brilliant colors. Is the center one raised above on glass, so that it appears so separated? I think it would be a more engaging shot with less contrast between the foreground and background focus. I probably would have cleaned up the white dots on the center candy -- but that is a picky thing.', '2004-05-17 18:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(723407, 76622, 20779, '<td valign="top">I really gravitated to the creamy yellow center. The colorful spiral might look a little more engaging with some additional thickness maybe -- looks a little like pened lines right now.</td>', 'I really gravitated to the creamy yellow center. The colorful spiral might look a little more engaging with some additional thickness maybe -- looks a little like pened lines right now.', '2004-05-17 18:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(723409, 76751, 15002, '<td valign="top">would like to see the color version</td>', 'would like to see the color version', '2004-05-17 18:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(723412, 76946, 6999, '<td valign="top">Despite the rrather odd blurring and strange smoothness of areas of this shot (do i smell Neatimage?), I''m not completely convinced that it warrants the centred composition - in that sense that the challenge really requires. Tough one this week, I suspect.</td>', 'Despite the rrather odd blurring and strange smoothness of areas of this shot (do i smell Neatimage?), I''m not completely convinced that it warrants the centred composition - in that sense that the challenge really requires. Tough one this week, I suspect.', '2004-05-17 18:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(723415, 77059, 21367, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent shot and done any other way would have lessened the emotion of the picture.  I give this picture high marks on it''s own, but for the challenge where I perceived dead center to be both horizontal and vertical I can not give the highest mark.   Excellent Picture this is a keeper.</td>', 'This is an excellent shot and done any other way would have lessened the emotion of the picture.  I give this picture high marks on it''s own, but for the challenge where I perceived dead center to be both horizontal and vertical I can not give the highest mark.   Excellent Picture this is a keeper.', '2004-05-17 18:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(723417, 76821, 6999, '<td valign="top">Has a quality almost of Lartigue, and of the early experimental photographers - Fox Talbot''s leaf image springs to mind. kind of works here, though I''m not sure that it will for those with less knowledge of the history of the medium.</td>', 'Has a quality almost of Lartigue, and of the early experimental photographers - Fox Talbot''s leaf image springs to mind. kind of works here, though I''m not sure that it will for those with less knowledge of the history of the medium.', '2004-05-17 18:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(723420, 76957, 21367, '<td valign="top">Not quite the center but a very nice picture none the less, Excellent dof and the lighting quite pleasent.</td>', 'Not quite the center but a very nice picture none the less, Excellent dof and the lighting quite pleasent.', '2004-05-17 18:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(723421, 76745, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wonderful light, and quite an achievement having that depth of field and yet still communicating the three-dimensionality of the flower.Good colour too.</td>', 'Wonderful light, and quite an achievement having that depth of field and yet still communicating the three-dimensionality of the flower.Good colour too.', '2004-05-17 18:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(723423, 77141, 19668, '<td valign="top">Great picture!<br/>Nice contrasts between warm and cold, sharp and unsharp, hard and soft.<br/>+10</td>', 'Great picture!Nice contrasts between warm and cold, sharp and unsharp, hard and soft.+10', '2004-05-17 18:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(723425, 77115, 15002, '<td valign="top">don''t care for the de-sat effect</td>', 'don''t care for the de-sat effect', '2004-05-17 18:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(723426, 77039, 6999, '<td valign="top">Mystical, threatening, highly atmospheric. Love the sense of light tailing off into the corners (i''m sure there''s a technical term for that, but can''t bring it to mind at the moment). The street-sign adds an element of potential information to the scene, as though there might actually be a destination ahead, as peple might come from that direction ... only who are they?</td>', 'Mystical, threatening, highly atmospheric. Love the sense of light tailing off into the corners (i''m sure there''s a technical term for that, but can''t bring it to mind at the moment). The street-sign adds an element of potential information to the scene, as though there might actually be a destination ahead, as peple might come from that direction ... only who are they?', '2004-05-17 18:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(723429, 76829, 9763, '<td valign="top">I also entered a spider, but mine is plastic.  I like yours so much better.  Great focus, great shadow, great color.  The lighting is a bit bright, washing out the photo a bit.  I love the photo over all :)</td>', 'I also entered a spider, but mine is plastic.  I like yours so much better.  Great focus, great shadow, great color.  The lighting is a bit bright, washing out the photo a bit.  I love the photo over all :)', '2004-05-17 18:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(723430, 76974, 6999, '<td valign="top">To my eye, you''ve taken this slightly too far in contrast, and certainly in the decision not to rotate the shot to keep the bench horizontal. There are areas where the light is entrancing - around the left leg of the bench for example, but otherwise it seems to bluntly a dull portrait.</td>', 'To my eye, you''ve taken this slightly too far in contrast, and certainly in the decision not to rotate the shot to keep the bench horizontal. There are areas where the light is entrancing - around the left leg of the bench for example, but otherwise it seems to bluntly a dull portrait.', '2004-05-17 18:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(723433, 77060, 15002, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  This should do very well.</td>', 'Excellent!  This should do very well.', '2004-05-17 18:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(723437, 76965, 15002, '<td valign="top">you managed to make the ugliest plant look great.  well done</td>', 'you managed to make the ugliest plant look great.  well done', '2004-05-17 18:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(723438, 76363, 6999, '<td valign="top">An odd entry. Not that it''s a bad subject: that dial cries out for a centred composition. However your lighting lets you down, as nothing here portrays the texture of the bakelite, and you seem to have compromised betweeen a full image of the ''phone and a closer concentration on the dial, and I cannot concieve of a good reason for this halfway crop.</td>', 'An odd entry. Not that it''s a bad subject: that dial cries out for a centred composition. However your lighting lets you down, as nothing here portrays the texture of the bakelite, and you seem to have compromised betweeen a full image of the ''phone and a closer concentration on the dial, and I cannot concieve of a good reason for this halfway crop.', '2004-05-17 18:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(723439, 77115, 21367, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, I may have gone the other way having the childs face in color and all the surroundings done in b/w (and possibly blurred a bit).  That would insure we are steered to the center of picture.  As it stands the surrounding are much to colorful and festive to not have the eyes wander to look at.</td>', 'Neat idea, I may have gone the other way having the childs face in color and all the surroundings done in b/w (and possibly blurred a bit).  That would insure we are steered to the center of picture.  As it stands the surrounding are much to colorful and festive to not have the eyes wander to look at.', '2004-05-17 18:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(723440, 75927, 15002, '<td valign="top">the difference in the two sides of the grill looks odd</td>', 'the difference in the two sides of the grill looks odd', '2004-05-17 18:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(723443, 76541, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good sense of some sort of texture, though it might well be due to processing rather than your shot, as far as it looks. God, what an awful attempt to say what I mean :-)<br/> <br/>There is interest here; but it isn''t a shot that does anything for me photographically, must be final judgement. 4</td>', 'Good sense of some sort of texture, though it might well be due to processing rather than your shot, as far as it looks. God, what an awful attempt to say what I mean :-) There is interest here; but it isn''t a shot that does anything for me photographically, must be final judgement. 4', '2004-05-17 19:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(723446, 76969, 6999, '<td valign="top">Lacks - well a bunch of stuff really, other than a difficult moment to catch. I''m not sure that difficulty provides enough imapct to overcome the shortcomings of the shot however. Focus, detail, plasticity are all missing, and frankly it doesn''t really call out for a centred composition - doesn''t depend on it for its impact, if you see what I mean. 5 - for some sense of personality.</td>', 'Lacks - well a bunch of stuff really, other than a difficult moment to catch. I''m not sure that difficulty provides enough imapct to overcome the shortcomings of the shot however. Focus, detail, plasticity are all missing, and frankly it doesn''t really call out for a centred composition - doesn''t depend on it for its impact, if you see what I mean. 5 - for some sense of personality.', '2004-05-17 19:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(723447, 76741, 18349, '<td valign="top">What a cutie pie...glad she''s not someone''s coat!  :o)<br/> <br/>Molly does appear to be slightly OOF...but she is nicely centered.</td>', 'What a cutie pie...glad she''s not someone''s coat!  :o) Molly does appear to be slightly OOF...but she is nicely centered.', '2004-05-17 19:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(723448, 77161, 15002, '<td valign="top">what an odd picture.  Im not sure why I like it, but I definately do</td>', 'what an odd picture.  Im not sure why I like it, but I definately do', '2004-05-17 19:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(723451, 77015, 18349, '<td valign="top">Lighting appears to be just too harsh...and the cross is OOF.  It is nicely centered, however, even if it is on a diagonal.</td>', 'Lighting appears to be just too harsh...and the cross is OOF.  It is nicely centered, however, even if it is on a diagonal.', '2004-05-17 19:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(723456, 76072, 18349, '<td valign="top">Whites appear to be a bit blown out.</td>', 'Whites appear to be a bit blown out.', '2004-05-17 19:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(723458, 76081, 6999, '<td valign="top">so nearly submitted a shot starting from the same idea myself. So maybe I''ll be a touch harsh on you having played with dandelion macros for a couple of days myself. It lacks a fine edge of impact (only just) - perhaps I mean more a sense of texture, a sense of really being close to the thing, involved with it. Fine detail in the seeds is good, but the finenness of the head itself is missing. Is this actually pushed up against the lens? Can''t work out how you''ve lost no seeds, but at the same time they''re not in the way ... 6</td>', 'so nearly submitted a shot starting from the same idea myself. So maybe I''ll be a touch harsh on you having played with dandelion macros for a couple of days myself. It lacks a fine edge of impact (only just) - perhaps I mean more a sense of texture, a sense of really being close to the thing, involved with it. Fine detail in the seeds is good, but the finenness of the head itself is missing. Is this actually pushed up against the lens? Can''t work out how you''ve lost no seeds, but at the same time they''re not in the way ... 6', '2004-05-17 19:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(723463, 76379, 17166, '<td valign="top">great use of negative space, like how the lighting on the table fades perfectly to the edges.</td>', 'great use of negative space, like how the lighting on the table fades perfectly to the edges.', '2004-05-17 19:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(723464, 76857, 6999, '<td valign="top">Some strong elements here - think I would have composed a little more carefully to include the pawns in the background more evenly, as their apparently sniggering expressions are priceless. Technically, some sense of over-sharpening, pixelation along the brights of his hat etc. just makes it seem a touch heavily cropped, or over-processed. 6</td>', 'Some strong elements here - think I would have composed a little more carefully to include the pawns in the background more evenly, as their apparently sniggering expressions are priceless. Technically, some sense of over-sharpening, pixelation along the brights of his hat etc. just makes it seem a touch heavily cropped, or over-processed. 6', '2004-05-17 19:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(723467, 76743, 17166, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture - really full of character.</td>', 'Fantastic capture - really full of character.', '2004-05-17 19:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
