(723471, 75740, 16790, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning.  Gorgeous colours and fantastic clarity.  I also like the angle of this quite a lot.  Beautiful - 10.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning.  Gorgeous colours and fantastic clarity.  I also like the angle of this quite a lot.  Beautiful - 10.', '2004-05-17 19:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(723475, 76217, 16790, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture.  Gorgeous colours, flawless focus, fits the challenge brilliantly.  So vivid and crisp!  Beautiful.  The border also really works for this.</td>', 'Fantastic capture.  Gorgeous colours, flawless focus, fits the challenge brilliantly.  So vivid and crisp!  Beautiful.  The border also really works for this.', '2004-05-17 19:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(723478, 76682, 21367, '<td valign="top">I think a little less dof would have gotten you higher marks.  I might have masked the center flower and used gaussian blur on the background just enough to make the center flower start popping out.  Very nice shot, the colors and lighting are wonderful.  In this particular challenge I might not have used the frame you have choosen at it is interesting and draws my attention outward.</td>', 'I think a little less dof would have gotten you higher marks.  I might have masked the center flower and used gaussian blur on the background just enough to make the center flower start popping out.  Very nice shot, the colors and lighting are wonderful.  In this particular challenge I might not have used the frame you have choosen at it is interesting and draws my attention outward.', '2004-05-17 19:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(723481, 77168, 16790, '<td valign="top">This has the feel of film; I like it very much.  The grain and vignetting fit.  Very interesting and unexpected subject - excellent choice going with black and white.</td>', 'This has the feel of film; I like it very much.  The grain and vignetting fit.  Very interesting and unexpected subject - excellent choice going with black and white.', '2004-05-17 19:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(723483, 77022, 6999, '<td valign="top">There''s a sense of liquidity in the flesh around the eye that is both rather distracting and rather unpleasantly death-like, especially in the desaturated colour. I find it unappealing, I''m afraid. Doesn''t say anything to me. 3</td>', 'There''s a sense of liquidity in the flesh around the eye that is both rather distracting and rather unpleasantly death-like, especially in the desaturated colour. I find it unappealing, I''m afraid. Doesn''t say anything to me. 3', '2004-05-17 19:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(723485, 77110, 16790, '<td valign="top">Lovely, vivid colouring on this.  The angle and composition really emphasize the size of the lighthouse.  The only thing I don''t care much for is the border (the drop shadow distracts me) but I''m not taking off points for that.</td>', 'Lovely, vivid colouring on this.  The angle and composition really emphasize the size of the lighthouse.  The only thing I don''t care much for is the border (the drop shadow distracts me) but I''m not taking off points for that.', '2004-05-17 19:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
