(723555, 75846, 20779, '<td valign="top">I almost submitted a very similar shot, so of course I like the concept and simplicity. For me, the leaf doesn''t create enough interest and isn''t bold/striking enough. Maybe a little sharper focus. The hint of a shadow on the left I would either like to see more of or not at all.</td>', 'I almost submitted a very similar shot, so of course I like the concept and simplicity. For me, the leaf doesn''t create enough interest and isn''t bold/striking enough. Maybe a little sharper focus. The hint of a shadow on the left I would either like to see more of or not at all.', '2004-05-17 20:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
