(723583, 76609, 20779, '<td valign="top">I love palms! I think if they were a little closer together in relation to the space surrounding them, they would appear as a subject of focus together better.  I would like to see the colors brightened/saturated more deeply and a littler sharper focus.</td>', 'I love palms! I think if they were a little closer together in relation to the space surrounding them, they would appear as a subject of focus together better.  I would like to see the colors brightened/saturated more deeply and a littler sharper focus.', '2004-05-17 20:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
