(723779, 77029, 21367, '<td valign="top">Keeps me tied to the center (pardon the pun).  Great idea and execution,  If somehow you could have blurred the top of the peg so that just the knot was in focus I think this would have done better.  Maybe a small amout of gaussian blur could have acheived that effect, at least the very top of the peg where there is a lot of cracks and hammer marks that seem to stand out.</td>', 'Keeps me tied to the center (pardon the pun).  Great idea and execution,  If somehow you could have blurred the top of the peg so that just the knot was in focus I think this would have done better.  Maybe a small amout of gaussian blur could have acheived that effect, at least the very top of the peg where there is a lot of cracks and hammer marks that seem to stand out.', '2004-05-17 23:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
