(723811, 76980, 21367, '<td valign="top">Good shot, nice detail.  For me the lighting seems to be a little harse in some of the white spots on the log, I don''t  think a little better detail on the log would be a distraction from your main subject (the frog).  Or I may have used soft edges on this picture to give it a dreamy effect, cover for the bright areas of the log and push the viewer closer to the center.  Still a very good shot.</td>', 'Good shot, nice detail.  For me the lighting seems to be a little harse in some of the white spots on the log, I don''t  think a little better detail on the log would be a distraction from your main subject (the frog).  Or I may have used soft edges on this picture to give it a dreamy effect, cover for the bright areas of the log and push the viewer closer to the center.  Still a very good shot.', '2004-05-17 23:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
