(724096, 76150, 16777, '<td valign="top">Seems a little out of focus.</td>', 'Seems a little out of focus.', '2004-05-18 02:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(724108, 77056, 10867, '<td valign="top">I like this picture a lot, but the little girl is not really right in the centre of the frame.  She is a bit to the right of centre.</td>', 'I like this picture a lot, but the little girl is not really right in the centre of the frame.  She is a bit to the right of centre.', '2004-05-18 02:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(724115, 77048, 14454, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2004-05-18 03:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(724121, 77108, 20235, '<td valign="top">Centered composition dominates, and the way the trail of gulls draws the eye across the picture is interesting. Very nice photo.</td>', 'Centered composition dominates, and the way the trail of gulls draws the eye across the picture is interesting. Very nice photo.', '2004-05-18 03:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(724122, 77009, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture. Colors seem very nicely saturated.</td>', 'Very nice picture. Colors seem very nicely saturated.', '2004-05-18 03:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(724124, 76976, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very intersting picture. The way the shadows play off each other make for a nice B&amp;W photo</td>', 'Very intersting picture. The way the shadows play off each other make for a nice B&W photo', '2004-05-18 03:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(724126, 76335, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. Camera seems a little tilted counter clockwise?</td>', 'Nice picture. Camera seems a little tilted counter clockwise?', '2004-05-18 03:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(724129, 77115, 20235, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. I wonder if it would have had a better effect if the surroundings were desaturated instead of the center?</td>', 'Interesting picture. I wonder if it would have had a better effect if the surroundings were desaturated instead of the center?', '2004-05-18 03:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(724131, 76068, 20235, '<td valign="top">Haha, great picture!.... and so true.</td>', 'Haha, great picture!.... and so true.', '2004-05-18 03:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(724155, 76684, 16636, '<td valign="top">nice idea, would have worked well for the unusual viewpoint challenge as well</td>', 'nice idea, would have worked well for the unusual viewpoint challenge as well', '2004-05-18 04:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(724156, 76990, 16636, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2004-05-18 04:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(724176, 77168, 6999, '<td valign="top">Graininess gives a certain photojournalistic quality, especially with the vignetting. get a sense that there might have been some fascinating textures available here, but that you may have wiped them out a little with that level of contrast. 7</td>', 'Graininess gives a certain photojournalistic quality, especially with the vignetting. get a sense that there might have been some fascinating textures available here, but that you may have wiped them out a little with that level of contrast. 7', '2004-05-18 05:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(724179, 77184, 6999, '<td valign="top">Small image, and even then appears to lack detail and clarity. Appears focussed, but nevertheless has an impression of <i>not</i> being in focus. 4</td>', 'Small image, and even then appears to lack detail and clarity. Appears focussed, but nevertheless has an impression of not being in focus. 4', '2004-05-18 05:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(724181, 76970, 6999, '<td valign="top">Exceptionally sparse composition, though i think you could have afforded to brighten the whole thing to a greater extent: your sky is only mid-grey, and absolutely featureless - might have had more impact if you had taken this closer to a silhouettte. Perhaps what will most let your score down is that this is not really an image suited to a centred composition, you''ve just cropped it that way. 3</td>', 'Exceptionally sparse composition, though i think you could have afforded to brighten the whole thing to a greater extent: your sky is only mid-grey, and absolutely featureless - might have had more impact if you had taken this closer to a silhouettte. Perhaps what will most let your score down is that this is not really an image suited to a centred composition, you''ve just cropped it that way. 3', '2004-05-18 05:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(724182, 77055, 6999, '<td valign="top">One of remarkable few images so far to display an understanding of the requirements graphically of a centred composition. There is a problem for me in the overall sense of lack of clarity - the eye itself is so comparatively dark that it is difficult to fix my eye on any detail there. I think perhaps some dodging/burning work might have helped the balance of brightness in the shot. 5</td>', 'One of remarkable few images so far to display an understanding of the requirements graphically of a centred composition. There is a problem for me in the overall sense of lack of clarity - the eye itself is so comparatively dark that it is difficult to fix my eye on any detail there. I think perhaps some dodging/burning work might have helped the balance of brightness in the shot. 5', '2004-05-18 05:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(724184, 77153, 6999, '<td valign="top">Difficult balance to achieve between concentration on this old pushchair and a suitable sense of isolation. Seems like quite a lot of sharpening has gone on - has that brittle, fine pixelation. I quite like the shot, but it isn''t completely getting through to me. 5</td>', 'Difficult balance to achieve between concentration on this old pushchair and a suitable sense of isolation. Seems like quite a lot of sharpening has gone on - has that brittle, fine pixelation. I quite like the shot, but it isn''t completely getting through to me. 5', '2004-05-18 05:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(724186, 76751, 6999, '<td valign="top">Gentle halo-ing around the subject is effective in drawing and keeping the eye there, cntred composition used efffectively for once: isolating from background, and illustrating the height of this jump. Good work. 6</td>', 'Gentle halo-ing around the subject is effective in drawing and keeping the eye there, cntred composition used efffectively for once: isolating from background, and illustrating the height of this jump. Good work. 6', '2004-05-18 05:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(724187, 76864, 6999, '<td valign="top">Having gone to the trouble of making that asymettrical border, it might have been an idea to use levels just to take the black in the image all the way to absolute black. Good detail and light, especially the fading away toward edges. One of the better flower portraits here. 6</td>', 'Having gone to the trouble of making that asymettrical border, it might have been an idea to use levels just to take the black in the image all the way to absolute black. Good detail and light, especially the fading away toward edges. One of the better flower portraits here. 6', '2004-05-18 05:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(724226, 77116, 7743, '<td valign="top">The arch nicely frames the horse.  The arches to the left and right don''t add anything to the photo.  They could probably be cropped out and the image would still be balanced.</td>', 'The arch nicely frames the horse.  The arches to the left and right don''t add anything to the photo.  They could probably be cropped out and the image would still be balanced.', '2004-05-18 07:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(724249, 76217, 772, '<td valign="top">This photo is very nicely executed.  The square composition accents the ''centered subject'' theme with a lot of strength.  Your subject is also nicely separated and contrasted from the background with your depth of field choice.  This photo has strong elements of shape, texture, perspective, color, contrast, and subject choice.  Each of these integrate nicely to form a strong photo.  The insects also provide something extra in this photo.  They help create a dual subject and increase the overall interest/impact.  Excellent work :)<br/></td>', 'This photo is very nicely executed.  The square composition accents the ''centered subject'' theme with a lot of strength.  Your subject is also nicely separated and contrasted from the background with your depth of field choice.  This photo has strong elements of shape, texture, perspective, color, contrast, and subject choice.  Each of these integrate nicely to form a strong photo.  The insects also provide something extra in this photo.  They help create a dual subject and increase the overall interest/impact.  Excellent work :)', '2004-05-18 08:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(724261, 77168, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot... very moody...  urban blight...  despair... loneliness...</td>', 'Excellent shot... very moody...  urban blight...  despair... loneliness...', '2004-05-18 09:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(724370, 77184, 14620, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice idea, but there just isn''t enough to hold interest.  The background seems a little dull, maybe if it were brighter or a different color that could really catch the eye and draw you in.</td>', 'It''s a nice idea, but there just isn''t enough to hold interest.  The background seems a little dull, maybe if it were brighter or a different color that could really catch the eye and draw you in.', '2004-05-18 11:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(724374, 77129, 17012, '<td valign="top">A bit too much orange</td>', 'A bit too much orange', '2004-05-18 11:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(724375, 76968, 14620, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject and composition but just seems  a slight bit blurry.  Maybe a faster shutter speed would help.  It''s sometimes hard to get little ones to stay still for very long. :)  But overall the colors are nice and she has a very cute expression.</td>', 'Beautiful subject and composition but just seems  a slight bit blurry.  Maybe a faster shutter speed would help.  It''s sometimes hard to get little ones to stay still for very long. :)  But overall the colors are nice and she has a very cute expression.', '2004-05-18 11:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(724376, 77014, 17012, '<td valign="top">Great Poster Material</td>', 'Great Poster Material', '2004-05-18 11:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(724377, 76400, 17012, '<td valign="top">great mix of bw and colour and depth of field</td>', 'great mix of bw and colour and depth of field', '2004-05-18 11:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(724378, 76773, 17012, '<td valign="top">great news shot</td>', 'great news shot', '2004-05-18 11:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
