(724540, 77060, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject matter; I like the dramatic/action capture here with the theatrical lighting. The intensity of the light coming from the left of the performer, though, too great (creating a large blown out area on the face and a gaping shadow from the nose) work well here to provide the performer with a "possesed" look.  Well done.</td>', 'Very interesting subject matter; I like the dramatic/action capture here with the theatrical lighting. The intensity of the light coming from the left of the performer, though, too great (creating a large blown out area on the face and a gaping shadow from the nose) work well here to provide the performer with a "possesed" look.  Well done.', '2004-05-18 14:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(724543, 76802, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very effecive use of the b/w - blue.  Could use a little more in focus - but still a very strong entry.</td>', 'Very effecive use of the b/w - blue.  Could use a little more in focus - but still a very strong entry.', '2004-05-18 14:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(724544, 76072, 5822, '<td valign="top">To my eye, there is not enough of seperation between main subject and background, creating some confusion even with the narrow DOF you''ve achieved. I think the problem lies in the lighting and common toning/coloring. I also find the lighting to be too bright on the main flowers...contrast is too high here and you have nearly blown out areas and very dark shadows. A little hard to look at.</td>', 'To my eye, there is not enough of seperation between main subject and background, creating some confusion even with the narrow DOF you''ve achieved. I think the problem lies in the lighting and common toning/coloring. I also find the lighting to be too bright on the main flowers...contrast is too high here and you have nearly blown out areas and very dark shadows. A little hard to look at.', '2004-05-18 14:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(724548, 77118, 5822, '<td valign="top">Though color is good, subject appears too dark. Can be corrected with proper choice of metering mode.</td>', 'Though color is good, subject appears too dark. Can be corrected with proper choice of metering mode.', '2004-05-18 14:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(724550, 76964, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very good DOF but your subject is too small within the relative confines of the framing you''ve chosen and is hard to see detail.  I do like the color contrast between the yellow of the spider and the green background.</td>', 'Very good DOF but your subject is too small within the relative confines of the framing you''ve chosen and is hard to see detail.  I do like the color contrast between the yellow of the spider and the green background.', '2004-05-18 14:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(724552, 76541, 19608, '<td valign="top">Exceptionally wonderful "mandala-like" image.  The back of the watch - with the vertical lines changing color midway is superb.  (How many folks asked you why you didn''t show the front?)<br/> <br/>There absolutely no doubt about its "centeredness" - micrometer gang will go nuts.  Wonderful selection of colors, textures.<br/> <br/>Basically a "perfect" image that should be way up in the standings.  Thanks for sharing it.</td>', 'Exceptionally wonderful "mandala-like" image.  The back of the watch - with the vertical lines changing color midway is superb.  (How many folks asked you why you didn''t show the front?) There absolutely no doubt about its "centeredness" - micrometer gang will go nuts.  Wonderful selection of colors, textures. Basically a "perfect" image that should be way up in the standings.  Thanks for sharing it.', '2004-05-18 14:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(724553, 77113, 19608, '<td valign="top">Centered - you bet!  The micrometer gang will go crazy.  Very nice presentation with a lot of mystery.</td>', 'Centered - you bet!  The micrometer gang will go crazy.  Very nice presentation with a lot of mystery.', '2004-05-18 14:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
