(724555, 76968, 19608, '<td valign="top">What a cutie.    Exceptionally nice lighting, PERFECT focus on the eyes.   Very nice pose.  There does seem to be some motling in the skin, most likely compression problems (no deduction, but a bit bothersome.)   The red and silver objects to the right of the face are a bit of a detractor.  But a VERY nice entry nonetheless.</td>', 'What a cutie.    Exceptionally nice lighting, PERFECT focus on the eyes.   Very nice pose.  There does seem to be some motling in the skin, most likely compression problems (no deduction, but a bit bothersome.)   The red and silver objects to the right of the face are a bit of a detractor.  But a VERY nice entry nonetheless.', '2004-05-18 14:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(724557, 76538, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very origianal and pun-filled title.  ANd it really looks real - yu must go through a lot of models!    Nice exposure - and a bit mysterious.</td>', 'A very origianal and pun-filled title.  ANd it really looks real - yu must go through a lot of models!    Nice exposure - and a bit mysterious.', '2004-05-18 14:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
