(724677, 76821, 9821, '<td valign="top">I could be wrong, but the sides of the image look somehow blurred more than the rest of the image. I like it though ... 8</td>', 'I could be wrong, but the sides of the image look somehow blurred more than the rest of the image. I like it though ... 8', '2004-05-18 15:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(724678, 77032, 18485, '<td valign="top">very arresting image.  amazing lighting, interesting subject.  well executed.  9</td>', 'very arresting image.  amazing lighting, interesting subject.  well executed.  9', '2004-05-18 15:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(724679, 76773, 9821, '<td valign="top">can''t go wrong with a fire like that ... 8</td>', 'can''t go wrong with a fire like that ... 8', '2004-05-18 15:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(724680, 76751, 18485, '<td valign="top">wow.  great shot.  very nice center subject.</td>', 'wow.  great shot.  very nice center subject.', '2004-05-18 15:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(724681, 75814, 9821, '<td valign="top">cliche, but well done ... 8</td>', 'cliche, but well done ... 8', '2004-05-18 15:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(724683, 76504, 9821, '<td valign="top">very 3-d, nice colors ... 8</td>', 'very 3-d, nice colors ... 8', '2004-05-18 15:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(724684, 77056, 18485, '<td valign="top">i hope you don''t get dinged for not being "dead" center.  this is a beautiful candid/portrait with a nicely centered subject.  good luck</td>', 'i hope you don''t get dinged for not being "dead" center.  this is a beautiful candid/portrait with a nicely centered subject.  good luck', '2004-05-18 15:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(724685, 76379, 9821, '<td valign="top">nice use of negative space ... 8</td>', 'nice use of negative space ... 8', '2004-05-18 15:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(724686, 76273, 18485, '<td valign="top">wow.  great subject, nice symmetry.</td>', 'wow.  great subject, nice symmetry.', '2004-05-18 15:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(724688, 76081, 18485, '<td valign="top">when they said centered...  great macro.</td>', 'when they said centered...  great macro.', '2004-05-18 15:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(724689, 76351, 18485, '<td valign="top">maybe a touch over highlighted but very effective use of negative space.</td>', 'maybe a touch over highlighted but very effective use of negative space.', '2004-05-18 15:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(724691, 77060, 18485, '<td valign="top">nicely captured.  a bit creapy.</td>', 'nicely captured.  a bit creapy.', '2004-05-18 15:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(724692, 76829, 18485, '<td valign="top">beautiful detail, nice image</td>', 'beautiful detail, nice image', '2004-05-18 15:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(724693, 75947, 6999, '<td valign="top">Something givess the impression of being astray here - it seeems tilted, but it isn''t when you look closely - I guess just not taken from directly head on. This does highlight a problem with this challenge though - to me, a centred composition absolutely requires a strong graphical element to an image, which this has with those curved shadows and pointing lines - but those graphical elements have to be very regular. Good detail here, though that direct light has lost you some element of texture and perhaps mystery from the scene. 6</td>', 'Something givess the impression of being astray here - it seeems tilted, but it isn''t when you look closely - I guess just not taken from directly head on. This does highlight a problem with this challenge though - to me, a centred composition absolutely requires a strong graphical element to an image, which this has with those curved shadows and pointing lines - but those graphical elements have to be very regular. Good detail here, though that direct light has lost you some element of texture and perhaps mystery from the scene. 6', '2004-05-18 15:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(724694, 76726, 9821, '<td valign="top">crisp colors ... very nice ... 8</td>', 'crisp colors ... very nice ... 8', '2004-05-18 15:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(724695, 77127, 20235, '<td valign="top">As much as I hate to say it, I not really seeing the centered composition in this photo.</td>', 'As much as I hate to say it, I not really seeing the centered composition in this photo.', '2004-05-18 15:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(724700, 76819, 9821, '<td valign="top">his/her head looks just a little soft ... great shot ... 8</td>', 'his/her head looks just a little soft ... great shot ... 8', '2004-05-18 15:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(724701, 76217, 18485, '<td valign="top">well done.  gotta love a daisy</td>', 'well done.  gotta love a daisy', '2004-05-18 15:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(724702, 76262, 9821, '<td valign="top">tilts to the right ... nice though ... 8</td>', 'tilts to the right ... nice though ... 8', '2004-05-18 15:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(724703, 77039, 18485, '<td valign="top">almost the opposite of the challenge.  great shot, beautiful lighting and mood.  7</td>', 'almost the opposite of the challenge.  great shot, beautiful lighting and mood.  7', '2004-05-18 15:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(724704, 76262, 20235, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture. The lighting and perspective really make some nice effects. It seems like the camera is slightly tilted though, or maybe slight barrel distortion?</td>', 'I really like this picture. The lighting and perspective really make some nice effects. It seems like the camera is slightly tilted though, or maybe slight barrel distortion?', '2004-05-18 15:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(724705, 76577, 9821, '<td valign="top">perhaps too close ... looks like a floating head ... great shot ... 8</td>', 'perhaps too close ... looks like a floating head ... great shot ... 8', '2004-05-18 15:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(724707, 76829, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice high-key work, DOF effective, the light perhaps just a shade too even on the little critter to give much sense of texture and fine detail. Difficult subject though - especially if (s)he''s alive. Think I''d have worked just a little more on taking the background tho white - still some blue noise visible in areas. Close though. 6</td>', 'Nice high-key work, DOF effective, the light perhaps just a shade too even on the little critter to give much sense of texture and fine detail. Difficult subject though - especially if (s)he''s alive. Think I''d have worked just a little more on taking the background tho white - still some blue noise visible in areas. Close though. 6', '2004-05-18 15:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(724708, 76961, 18485, '<td valign="top">cool idea.  don''t like the shadow in the right lower region.</td>', 'cool idea.  don''t like the shadow in the right lower region.', '2004-05-18 15:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(724709, 76959, 9821, '<td valign="top">great ... 8</td>', 'great ... 8', '2004-05-18 15:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(724710, 76408, 18485, '<td valign="top">nice portrait.  a bit too pinky-red on my monitor.</td>', 'nice portrait.  a bit too pinky-red on my monitor.', '2004-05-18 15:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(724711, 76773, 18485, '<td valign="top">great capture.  nice photojournalism (i hope you didn''t stage this?!!)</td>', 'great capture.  nice photojournalism (i hope you didn''t stage this?!!)', '2004-05-18 15:15:22.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(724712, 76347, 9821, '<td valign="top">maybe a slightly tighter crop to remove the hind leg, but great as is ... 8</td>', 'maybe a slightly tighter crop to remove the hind leg, but great as is ... 8', '2004-05-18 15:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(724713, 76844, 18485, '<td valign="top">BEST-BRIDGE-EVER!!  great idea.  never seen it photographed from this interesting (and arresting) angle.</td>', 'BEST-BRIDGE-EVER!!  great idea.  never seen it photographed from this interesting (and arresting) angle.', '2004-05-18 15:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(724714, 76818, 9821, '<td valign="top">It''s been done, but you''ve done it well ... 8</td>', 'It''s been done, but you''ve done it well ... 8', '2004-05-18 15:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(724716, 76590, 18485, '<td valign="top">great shot.  wish the wee ones were a bit more in focus.</td>', 'great shot.  wish the wee ones were a bit more in focus.', '2004-05-18 15:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(724717, 75983, 9821, '<td valign="top">great sky, good subject for this composition ... 8</td>', 'great sky, good subject for this composition ... 8', '2004-05-18 15:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(724718, 77009, 9821, '<td valign="top">:) ... 8</td>', ':) ... 8', '2004-05-18 15:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(724720, 76932, 18485, '<td valign="top">now that is centered!!  it might be my monitor but the photo seems over sharpened to me.  great shot.</td>', 'now that is centered!!  it might be my monitor but the photo seems over sharpened to me.  great shot.', '2004-05-18 15:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(724721, 77168, 9821, '<td valign="top">i love this type of shot, looks like you used a Holga ... 8</td>', 'i love this type of shot, looks like you used a Holga ... 8', '2004-05-18 15:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(724722, 76821, 18485, '<td valign="top">lovely mood created here.  well done. 8</td>', 'lovely mood created here.  well done. 8', '2004-05-18 15:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(724723, 77108, 9821, '<td valign="top">I like the high contrast here ... well done ... 8</td>', 'I like the high contrast here ... well done ... 8', '2004-05-18 15:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(724736, 76751, 20925, '<td valign="top">Love the angle and subject.  Think the blurred water really adds depth to the shot.</td>', 'Love the angle and subject.  Think the blurred water really adds depth to the shot.', '2004-05-18 15:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(724737, 77014, 20925, '<td valign="top">Really like the clarity and simplicity.  But, are my eyes buggin'' or is the shadow a little lavender?</td>', 'Really like the clarity and simplicity.  But, are my eyes buggin'' or is the shadow a little lavender?', '2004-05-18 15:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(724739, 76273, 6999, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail - man he loks like a plastic toy - and great light, especially the rich green of the background. suitably regular and symmetrical subject to carry the composition (unlike so many who''ve just plonked something dead centre without a thought). Hope it does well - has an oddness that I like. 7</td>', 'Excellent detail - man he loks like a plastic toy - and great light, especially the rich green of the background. suitably regular and symmetrical subject to carry the composition (unlike so many who''ve just plonked something dead centre without a thought). Hope it does well - has an oddness that I like. 7', '2004-05-18 15:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(724741, 76209, 6999, '<td valign="top">The blat of that flash is  real pity -- murdering the detail in foreground. I guess it would have been near-impossible without it, but that doesn''t stop it causing problems. Would it have been impossible to crop in tighter on the hand and the butterfly? Might have made for a much less snap-shot-like composition.</td>', 'The blat of that flash is  real pity -- murdering the detail in foreground. I guess it would have been near-impossible without it, but that doesn''t stop it causing problems. Would it have been impossible to crop in tighter on the hand and the butterfly? Might have made for a much less snap-shot-like composition.', '2004-05-18 15:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(724746, 76144, 6999, '<td valign="top">Don''t like this I fear. Quite apart from the over-the-top colouring (obfiously, only my opinion), it seems slightly over-exposed (details blowing out in the more saturated areas), and the direct light isn''t helping communicate the softness of the flower - which would make a real contrast with the bizarre tones. 4</td>', 'Don''t like this I fear. Quite apart from the over-the-top colouring (obfiously, only my opinion), it seems slightly over-exposed (details blowing out in the more saturated areas), and the direct light isn''t helping communicate the softness of the flower - which would make a real contrast with the bizarre tones. 4', '2004-05-18 15:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(724749, 77107, 9982, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but a bit gloomy. Maybe levels could be adjusted.</td>', 'Nice shot but a bit gloomy. Maybe levels could be adjusted.', '2004-05-18 15:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(724750, 76735, 6999, '<td valign="top">Huh? Without being properly in focus its very diffficult to find anything constructive to say about this shot. 2</td>', 'Huh? Without being properly in focus its very diffficult to find anything constructive to say about this shot. 2', '2004-05-18 15:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(724754, 76947, 9982, '<td valign="top">Nice title. Very centred too.</td>', 'Nice title. Very centred too.', '2004-05-18 15:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(724757, 77161, 6999, '<td valign="top">Excellent smoothness and clarity to this macro work. Tooo much of a shoe-in to the theme for me however - sure, as a pair they''re arguably centred, though equally validly, as individuals, they''re nicely (almost) on the classic thirds lines. Composition could have been simplified to good effect i think - bin the coloured egg-cup, white-out the wood and there''d be a suitably scandinavian feel to this. 4</td>', 'Excellent smoothness and clarity to this macro work. Tooo much of a shoe-in to the theme for me however - sure, as a pair they''re arguably centred, though equally validly, as individuals, they''re nicely (almost) on the classic thirds lines. Composition could have been simplified to good effect i think - bin the coloured egg-cup, white-out the wood and there''d be a suitably scandinavian feel to this. 4', '2004-05-18 15:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(724760, 76805, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice approach to the challenge - and kind of works. Fence is a touch too insignificant in the image though: perhaps if you''d been able to make more of it''s shadow ... Good perspective work, no lens distortion that registers with me, and that helps carry of the regularity of the composition very well. 6</td>', 'Nice approach to the challenge - and kind of works. Fence is a touch too insignificant in the image though: perhaps if you''d been able to make more of it''s shadow ... Good perspective work, no lens distortion that registers with me, and that helps carry of the regularity of the composition very well. 6', '2004-05-18 15:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(724762, 76217, 6999, '<td valign="top">Took me ages to notice that there''s two of them ...<br/> <br/>Excellent dissociation of subject from background - good regularity, and good light. your title implies a subject other than the flower, and to be honest the bugs are a touch too blended into the flower tonally to be a clear subject. Intriguing work though, and one of few that meets the challenge correctly (as opposed to being simply something plonked dead centre): this actually depends for its effect on this composition. 7</td>', 'Took me ages to notice that there''s two of them ... Excellent dissociation of subject from background - good regularity, and good light. your title implies a subject other than the flower, and to be honest the bugs are a touch too blended into the flower tonally to be a clear subject. Intriguing work though, and one of few that meets the challenge correctly (as opposed to being simply something plonked dead centre): this actually depends for its effect on this composition. 7', '2004-05-18 15:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(724764, 76960, 21367, '<td valign="top">Very cool picture, I like the detail and atmosphere you captured.  But for this challenge (as I read it) it seems to be a little busy on top.  perhaps a square crop from the bottom, putting the flame near the center, and omitting those cute guys on top of the balloon that keep drawing me upward would have done better with me.  Great Shot, I love all the colors you got going on here.</td>', 'Very cool picture, I like the detail and atmosphere you captured.  But for this challenge (as I read it) it seems to be a little busy on top.  perhaps a square crop from the bottom, putting the flame near the center, and omitting those cute guys on top of the balloon that keep drawing me upward would have done better with me.  Great Shot, I love all the colors you got going on here.', '2004-05-18 15:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(724766, 76819, 21367, '<td valign="top">Very good shot, the turtle is the center of focus here and it keeps ones attention.</td>', 'Very good shot, the turtle is the center of focus here and it keeps ones attention.', '2004-05-18 15:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(724769, 76976, 8139, '<td valign="top">one of my favorites. To center the emptiness is a treat of connoisseurs.</td>', 'one of my favorites. To center the emptiness is a treat of connoisseurs.', '2004-05-18 15:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(724771, 77111, 6999, '<td valign="top">my first reaction, sitting back from the monitor and therefore seeing far too dark an image, was - whoa, someone''s superimposed an audio waveform over a picture. obviously  much clearer at proper viewing angle, but that impression remains, and is actually quite intriguing. Interaction of slopes and angles and progression of trees is interesting.</td>', 'my first reaction, sitting back from the monitor and therefore seeing far too dark an image, was - whoa, someone''s superimposed an audio waveform over a picture. obviously  much clearer at proper viewing angle, but that impression remains, and is actually quite intriguing. Interaction of slopes and angles and progression of trees is interesting.', '2004-05-18 15:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(724772, 76850, 19608, '<td valign="top">An original take on centered!  Nice colors, composition.</td>', 'An original take on centered!  Nice colors, composition.', '2004-05-18 15:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(724775, 77041, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent specimen.  Works very well in its centered composition. Good focus throughout.</td>', 'Excellent specimen.  Works very well in its centered composition. Good focus throughout.', '2004-05-18 15:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(724776, 76945, 6999, '<td valign="top">Fabulous light. Christ-figure looks a touch washed out (dodging?), and seems to have lost a touch of detail through that - just enough to stop him popping out of scene nicely. Murkiness and shading of the remainder of the screen is wonderfully done though. 7</td>', 'Fabulous light. Christ-figure looks a touch washed out (dodging?), and seems to have lost a touch of detail through that - just enough to stop him popping out of scene nicely. Murkiness and shading of the remainder of the screen is wonderfully done though. 7', '2004-05-18 15:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(724777, 76938, 19608, '<td valign="top">It is certainly centered and was taken at the PERFECT time of day.  This duk colors make the monument really pop.  Well done.</td>', 'It is certainly centered and was taken at the PERFECT time of day.  This duk colors make the monument really pop.  Well done.', '2004-05-18 15:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(724781, 77032, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great light - rear-threequarter angle is always effective, and a certain commendable confidence in not using any fill to assuage the crowd. room to breathe in the framing too. composition works, though not sure exactly why. 7</td>', 'Great light - rear-threequarter angle is always effective, and a certain commendable confidence in not using any fill to assuage the crowd. room to breathe in the framing too. composition works, though not sure exactly why. 7', '2004-05-18 15:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(724782, 76292, 9982, '<td valign="top">magic</td>', 'magic', '2004-05-18 16:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(724783, 76973, 9982, '<td valign="top">Love the design but is the lighting a bit harsh?</td>', 'Love the design but is the lighting a bit harsh?', '2004-05-18 16:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(724784, 77136, 21367, '<td valign="top">The hand is the center of this shot, but I am drawn to the child to see why they would have their head down.  It is an emotional shot but I keep being drawn away to the child.   I believe you are going for the don''t talk to me (mom, dad) feel. For this particular challenge I may have had the child sitting up in the center of the shot with head hung low, one hand covering face the other up as you have it but almost covering the face-in-hand behind.  Keep the veiwer in the center by making them try to look beyond the hand to see what is wrong.   A little windy but thats my thoughts.</td>', 'The hand is the center of this shot, but I am drawn to the child to see why they would have their head down.  It is an emotional shot but I keep being drawn away to the child.   I believe you are going for the don''t talk to me (mom, dad) feel. For this particular challenge I may have had the child sitting up in the center of the shot with head hung low, one hand covering face the other up as you have it but almost covering the face-in-hand behind.  Keep the veiwer in the center by making them try to look beyond the hand to see what is wrong.   A little windy but thats my thoughts.', '2004-05-18 16:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(724797, 77023, 18897, '<td valign="top">A rather unusual way of centering things. Unusual is good here of course, but the subject is in itself pretty uninteresting. <br/> <br/>Nice light on the building which I think you could have moved upwards in the picture to make it appear even more centered.<br/> <br/> No clouds might have made more of a clean impact - did you try to clone them out?</td>', 'A rather unusual way of centering things. Unusual is good here of course, but the subject is in itself pretty uninteresting.  Nice light on the building which I think you could have moved upwards in the picture to make it appear even more centered.  No clouds might have made more of a clean impact - did you try to clone them out?', '2004-05-18 16:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(724798, 77053, 16053, '<td valign="top">Not interely centered but nice shot though. Nice background.</td>', 'Not interely centered but nice shot though. Nice background.', '2004-05-18 16:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(724799, 76741, 16053, '<td valign="top">Extremely photogenic, Molly. Nice subject. Nice to see that other people also choseen their pets for subject. A bit on the soft side the image... But appeeling.</td>', 'Extremely photogenic, Molly. Nice subject. Nice to see that other people also choseen their pets for subject. A bit on the soft side the image... But appeeling.', '2004-05-18 16:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(724801, 76850, 18897, '<td valign="top">Guessing this one is on-board flashed? Think it would have been better with some other light source, this makes it look very flat. But I give you credit for dead centering and a really annoying color :-)</td>', 'Guessing this one is on-board flashed? Think it would have been better with some other light source, this makes it look very flat. But I give you credit for dead centering and a really annoying color :-)', '2004-05-18 16:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(724803, 75755, 16053, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what to think of this one... What is supposed to be in the center? the lack of the flowers that looks like a hole? The frame inside the picture? what ever the awnser is I don''t like it.</td>', 'I don''t know what to think of this one... What is supposed to be in the center? the lack of the flowers that looks like a hole? The frame inside the picture? what ever the awnser is I don''t like it.', '2004-05-18 16:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(724806, 76217, 16053, '<td valign="top">Nice to see.. A flower as a subject withought being just another picture of a flower. Did you erase the foot of the sunflower?</td>', 'Nice to see.. A flower as a subject withought being just another picture of a flower. Did you erase the foot of the sunflower?', '2004-05-18 16:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(724808, 77110, 14620, '<td valign="top">Great colors!  Would make a very nice postcard. :-)</td>', 'Great colors!  Would make a very nice postcard. :-)', '2004-05-18 16:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(724809, 76805, 16053, '<td valign="top">Good idea... Strong photo. I thing the only thing I changed if I could was taking the shot fron a lower point of view making the stick pointin to the sky and making it above the horizon level. But I loved it.</td>', 'Good idea... Strong photo. I thing the only thing I changed if I could was taking the shot fron a lower point of view making the stick pointin to the sky and making it above the horizon level. But I loved it.', '2004-05-18 16:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(724810, 76959, 18897, '<td valign="top">Nice catch. The shadows and high contrast makes it lose some detail. Probably along with not having all that many pixels to work with from the start?<br/> <br/>Would have been nice if it had looked more to the side to make the head stand out more. Guess it''s hard to tell a bird to "please look that way" :-)<br/> <br/>Nut should have been dead center I think. But I guess it''s close enough..</td>', 'Nice catch. The shadows and high contrast makes it lose some detail. Probably along with not having all that many pixels to work with from the start? Would have been nice if it had looked more to the side to make the head stand out more. Guess it''s hard to tell a bird to "please look that way" :-) Nut should have been dead center I think. But I guess it''s close enough..', '2004-05-18 16:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(724811, 76081, 14620, '<td valign="top">Great details!!  This is quite a beautiful shot.  Well Done!</td>', 'Great details!!  This is quite a beautiful shot.  Well Done!', '2004-05-18 16:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(724813, 76751, 14620, '<td valign="top">I really like the high contrast b&amp;w treatment here.  It''s quite cool.  Also, a very interesting subject.  Nice Job!</td>', 'I really like the high contrast b&w treatment here.  It''s quite cool.  Also, a very interesting subject.  Nice Job!', '2004-05-18 16:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(724816, 76379, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is so simple, yet beautiful.  The lighting you chose makes this shot.  I also really like the use of negative space.</td>', 'This is so simple, yet beautiful.  The lighting you chose makes this shot.  I also really like the use of negative space.', '2004-05-18 16:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(724819, 76457, 9982, '<td valign="top">lovely</td>', 'lovely', '2004-05-18 16:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(724821, 76504, 19035, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, technically very good, I guess Im getting tired of seeing so many flower shots though. - 6.</td>', 'Nice shot, technically very good, I guess Im getting tired of seeing so many flower shots though. - 6.', '2004-05-18 16:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(724823, 77136, 19035, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, black and white does well here too - 7.</td>', 'Nice idea, black and white does well here too - 7.', '2004-05-18 16:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(724833, 75908, 21367, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool shot.   I don''t know what it is but for me it just seems to be missing something in center.  Could be sharpness or detail, I can''t quite put my finger on it.  I might have used a color version of this unless it was really over cast and the sky was very white.  It is a very good composition.</td>', 'Pretty cool shot.   I don''t know what it is but for me it just seems to be missing something in center.  Could be sharpness or detail, I can''t quite put my finger on it.  I might have used a color version of this unless it was really over cast and the sky was very white.  It is a very good composition.', '2004-05-18 16:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(724861, 77003, 19205, '<td valign="top">The bee gets lost in the background..</td>', 'The bee gets lost in the background..', '2004-05-18 16:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(724866, 77108, 17166, '<td valign="top">Nice subject - line of flying gulls suggests action.  Wish you had used the full 150kballowed instead of shrinking to 97k as it looks like some jpeg artifacts, for example the jagged edges of the gull wings.</td>', 'Nice subject - line of flying gulls suggests action.  Wish you had used the full 150kballowed instead of shrinking to 97k as it looks like some jpeg artifacts, for example the jagged edges of the gull wings.', '2004-05-18 16:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(724869, 76976, 17166, '<td valign="top">Nice toning, works well in B&amp;W</td>', 'Nice toning, works well in B&W', '2004-05-18 16:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(724880, 75814, 19608, '<td valign="top">This is an image I can see hanging in the reception area of a fancy office.  Very simple but bold.  Relaxing.  The black background works extremely well with the yelllows.  Focus and exposure near perfect.  Compositionally, I am a little disappointed on the petals behind the 4 main subjects - the ones between the top right and left flowers and the ones behind the bottom right flower.  But that''s very minor point.  The thin yellow border?  Probably OK, but I''d like to see it without just to be sure.  Overall a very strong entry that should finish high.</td>', 'This is an image I can see hanging in the reception area of a fancy office.  Very simple but bold.  Relaxing.  The black background works extremely well with the yelllows.  Focus and exposure near perfect.  Compositionally, I am a little disappointed on the petals behind the 4 main subjects - the ones between the top right and left flowers and the ones behind the bottom right flower.  But that''s very minor point.  The thin yellow border?  Probably OK, but I''d like to see it without just to be sure.  Overall a very strong entry that should finish high.', '2004-05-18 17:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(724891, 77039, 16148, '<td valign="top">I really like what you have here.  Did you burn the bottom left and right corners?  The darkness doesn''t look natural.  Good luck.</td>', 'I really like what you have here.  Did you burn the bottom left and right corners?  The darkness doesn''t look natural.  Good luck.', '2004-05-18 17:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(724894, 76932, 16148, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and subject but I think you over did it with post processing.  I''d like to see more natural colors in this one.</td>', 'Nice idea and subject but I think you over did it with post processing.  I''d like to see more natural colors in this one.', '2004-05-18 17:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(724898, 77032, 16148, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  Very crisp action shot for such low lighting.  Good luck.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  Very crisp action shot for such low lighting.  Good luck.', '2004-05-18 17:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(724906, 76457, 16148, '<td valign="top">Nice title, composition, and technically beautiful.  The black and white works well.  One of my top picks for the challenge.</td>', 'Nice title, composition, and technically beautiful.  The black and white works well.  One of my top picks for the challenge.', '2004-05-18 17:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(724967, 77048, 18485, '<td valign="top">excellent reaiization of the challenge.  great use of ambient light and shadow.</td>', 'excellent reaiization of the challenge.  great use of ambient light and shadow.', '2004-05-18 18:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(724985, 76081, 9668, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Great large sized image. Great technical setup, good visual appeal. 9</td>', 'Very nice! Great large sized image. Great technical setup, good visual appeal. 9', '2004-05-18 18:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(725002, 77153, 9668, '<td valign="top">Image seems way too over sharpened. and seems a bit over exposed as well. I like the border, and it''s a cool idea.</td>', 'Image seems way too over sharpened. and seems a bit over exposed as well. I like the border, and it''s a cool idea.', '2004-05-18 18:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(725003, 76862, 9668, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection. Seems too dark to me. Lovely scenery.</td>', 'Nice reflection. Seems too dark to me. Lovely scenery.', '2004-05-18 18:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(725011, 76351, 9668, '<td valign="top">Stands out very well: simplistic. I like the subtle gradient border. Only critique would be that the vase is too distracting, but doesn''t make that much of a difference. Great job.</td>', 'Stands out very well: simplistic. I like the subtle gradient border. Only critique would be that the vase is too distracting, but doesn''t make that much of a difference. Great job.', '2004-05-18 18:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(725014, 76847, 21367, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Subject centered, excellent colors...especially the way the blue plays into the green and the green into the ground/background colors.  Excellent dof that makes the Ball holder (I think)  really stand.  Subject matter a little different for me but still high marks.</td>', 'I like this.  Subject centered, excellent colors...especially the way the blue plays into the green and the green into the ground/background colors.  Excellent dof that makes the Ball holder (I think)  really stand.  Subject matter a little different for me but still high marks.', '2004-05-18 18:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(725016, 77155, 21367, '<td valign="top">Great Idea...</td>', 'Great Idea...', '2004-05-18 18:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(725017, 76970, 9668, '<td valign="top">Background is too grainy, IMO. Ball doesn''t seems exactly dead center. I like the tree in the lower left corner. Adds good perspective.</td>', 'Background is too grainy, IMO. Ball doesn''t seems exactly dead center. I like the tree in the lower left corner. Adds good perspective.', '2004-05-18 18:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(725022, 77176, 21367, '<td valign="top">Nice use of b/w, excellent shadows.  I may have cropped a little more from the sides as horizontal lines on the left seem to distract more than add any value to the picture.  <br/> <br/>I think you could have even cropped this with just the window frame (dark gray) and inward and we still would have picked up on the fact that the venus was through a window.  Great Idea, very good picture.</td>', 'Nice use of b/w, excellent shadows.  I may have cropped a little more from the sides as horizontal lines on the left seem to distract more than add any value to the picture.   I think you could have even cropped this with just the window frame (dark gray) and inward and we still would have picked up on the fact that the venus was through a window.  Great Idea, very good picture.', '2004-05-18 18:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(725024, 76982, 21367, '<td valign="top">Great dof, and red bug definately stands out in the center of the picture.  Great job.</td>', 'Great dof, and red bug definately stands out in the center of the picture.  Great job.', '2004-05-18 18:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(725026, 77168, 3697, '<td valign="top">I like it :) Great black and white treatment and the noise really adds to the photo.</td>', 'I like it :) Great black and white treatment and the noise really adds to the photo.', '2004-05-18 18:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(725028, 77048, 21367, '<td valign="top">Excellent Composition...high marks to ya...Great colors and reflection, very calm feeling.</td>', 'Excellent Composition...high marks to ya...Great colors and reflection, very calm feeling.', '2004-05-18 18:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(725030, 76802, 9668, '<td valign="top">I love that the only color is in the eye of the cat. The lower left corner seems too grainy. I like the composition, nice layout.</td>', 'I love that the only color is in the eye of the cat. The lower left corner seems too grainy. I like the composition, nice layout.', '2004-05-18 18:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(725038, 77005, 21367, '<td valign="top">Excellent Idea, this definately draws one down into the center of the picture.   Gets a little fuzzy near the center, to draw me completely into the center I would like to see it a little sharper near the arches.   Still a very good picture.</td>', 'Excellent Idea, this definately draws one down into the center of the picture.   Gets a little fuzzy near the center, to draw me completely into the center I would like to see it a little sharper near the arches.   Still a very good picture.', '2004-05-18 18:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(725039, 76168, 7743, '<td valign="top">I believe you''ve got the exposure right here, however without the horizon or something to focus on in the distance it feels out of balance.</td>', 'I believe you''ve got the exposure right here, however without the horizon or something to focus on in the distance it feels out of balance.', '2004-05-18 18:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(725041, 76361, 11895, '<td valign="top">very good shot, I like the depth of field, but Kermy was green</td>', 'very good shot, I like the depth of field, but Kermy was green', '2004-05-18 18:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(725042, 76219, 6999, '<td valign="top">The large amount of negative space certainly helps to make the centred composition work - good imagination there. I like the incidental, real-world feel of this shot, and the level of detail (especially in the colouring) on the fly. There''s something ... kind of casual about the whole thing (in a good way) that I can''t quite explain. Speaks of lazy summer days somehow. Must be the light. It''s always the light.</td>', 'The large amount of negative space certainly helps to make the centred composition work - good imagination there. I like the incidental, real-world feel of this shot, and the level of detail (especially in the colouring) on the fly. There''s something ... kind of casual about the whole thing (in a good way) that I can''t quite explain. Speaks of lazy summer days somehow. Must be the light. It''s always the light.', '2004-05-18 18:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(725043, 77059, 7743, '<td valign="top">Having the horizon very low in an image can produce a dramatic effect by miniturizing objects against a large field, however the challenge was to have the main subject dead center. If I were to rate this without respect to the challenge I would give it a 7, but since it doesn''t meet the challenge (IMHO) I can only give it a 4, sorry.</td>', 'Having the horizon very low in an image can produce a dramatic effect by miniturizing objects against a large field, however the challenge was to have the main subject dead center. If I were to rate this without respect to the challenge I would give it a 7, but since it doesn''t meet the challenge (IMHO) I can only give it a 4, sorry.', '2004-05-18 19:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(725046, 77121, 9668, '<td valign="top">Nice soft focus. Good color. Seems just a tad overexposed.</td>', 'Nice soft focus. Good color. Seems just a tad overexposed.', '2004-05-18 19:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(725048, 76968, 7743, '<td valign="top">You seem to have caught the little girl''s spirit nicely here, however the focus seems to be a bit off and the wind chime on the right is distracting. 5</td>', 'You seem to have caught the little girl''s spirit nicely here, however the focus seems to be a bit off and the wind chime on the right is distracting. 5', '2004-05-18 19:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(725049, 77161, 21367, '<td valign="top">Great clarity and dof, I also like the purple/green added to balance the nuetral colors of the shot.</td>', 'Great clarity and dof, I also like the purple/green added to balance the nuetral colors of the shot.', '2004-05-18 19:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(725050, 76274, 9668, '<td valign="top">Intense shot! Definate wow factor. Lovely.</td>', 'Intense shot! Definate wow factor. Lovely.', '2004-05-18 19:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(725054, 77121, 21367, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but I think there is a little too much going on here.  The darker tree on the right tends to over power the ghost like tree in the center.  Maybe a little more detail on the White tree and unfocus (blur) the darker tree might have helped this for me.  Still a good shot.</td>', 'Nice shot but I think there is a little too much going on here.  The darker tree on the right tends to over power the ghost like tree in the center.  Maybe a little more detail on the White tree and unfocus (blur) the darker tree might have helped this for me.  Still a good shot.', '2004-05-18 19:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(725055, 76379, 21367, '<td valign="top">Very simple, very cool.  Nice color on the dark background just the right amount of woodgrain showing for effect.  The only thing that I would have done would be to crop quite a bit from the top, you flower would still remain the center focus of this shot.  Great Job.</td>', 'Very simple, very cool.  Nice color on the dark background just the right amount of woodgrain showing for effect.  The only thing that I would have done would be to crop quite a bit from the top, you flower would still remain the center focus of this shot.  Great Job.', '2004-05-18 19:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(725063, 76504, 19608, '<td valign="top">Definitely a centered composition with some great colors.  Some may complain about the shallow DoF - but with a macro this close, you had little choice.  Actually, the soft focus on the areas below the "ball" are pleasant and add an artistic feel.  Well done</td>', 'Definitely a centered composition with some great colors.  Some may complain about the shallow DoF - but with a macro this close, you had little choice.  Actually, the soft focus on the areas below the "ball" are pleasant and add an artistic feel.  Well done', '2004-05-18 19:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(725067, 75934, 19608, '<td valign="top">You picked the perfect time of day for this shot.  Colors are magical.  I like the fact there was enough breeze to give a hint of rippling on the water surface.  Normally, I''d say to crop out some sky - as it''s not needed..... but then  it wouldn''t be centered (slap my typing hands!).  Overall an excellent image with high finish potential.</td>', 'You picked the perfect time of day for this shot.  Colors are magical.  I like the fact there was enough breeze to give a hint of rippling on the water surface.  Normally, I''d say to crop out some sky - as it''s not needed..... but then  it wouldn''t be centered (slap my typing hands!).  Overall an excellent image with high finish potential.', '2004-05-18 19:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(725070, 76773, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wow - is that dynamic!  Great capture.  Did you notice that the silhouette of the bucket has a fire pattern behind it that makes it look as if the bucket itself was on fire?  Is that shape in the car a human head?  If this doesn''t finish very high, I''ll be very shocked.</td>', 'Wow - is that dynamic!  Great capture.  Did you notice that the silhouette of the bucket has a fire pattern behind it that makes it look as if the bucket itself was on fire?  Is that shape in the car a human head?  If this doesn''t finish very high, I''ll be very shocked.', '2004-05-18 19:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(725072, 77124, 19608, '<td valign="top">WONDEFUL abstract.  Great colors, pattern, exposure, composition.  It will drive the micrometer crown wild trying to figure out what''s centered.... <br/> <br/>A very well done omage destined for a top finish.</td>', 'WONDEFUL abstract.  Great colors, pattern, exposure, composition.  It will drive the micrometer crown wild trying to figure out what''s centered....  A very well done omage destined for a top finish.', '2004-05-18 19:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(725078, 76990, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent seeing!  Perfectly centered and very graphic.  YOur choice to invert the black and white makes it more magical.  Should score high!  (And it would also be a great entry for "unusual angle."</td>', 'Excellent seeing!  Perfectly centered and very graphic.  YOur choice to invert the black and white makes it more magical.  Should score high!  (And it would also be a great entry for "unusual angle."', '2004-05-18 19:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(725092, 77104, 6388, '<td valign="top">i like the contrast of the few fallen leaves...almost makes me wish there were more of them.  maybe a little oversaturated greens.  nice abstract though.</td>', 'i like the contrast of the few fallen leaves...almost makes me wish there were more of them.  maybe a little oversaturated greens.  nice abstract though.', '2004-05-18 19:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(725098, 75908, 6388, '<td valign="top">the ''it''s not centred'' people will get you for this.  very nice though for me.  it IS in the centre, and it''s very nicely exposed and suitably sharp. Nice contrast (or burning as the case may be).  I predict it will do well, but not nearly as well as it should.  p</td>', 'the ''it''s not centred'' people will get you for this.  very nice though for me.  it IS in the centre, and it''s very nicely exposed and suitably sharp. Nice contrast (or burning as the case may be).  I predict it will do well, but not nearly as well as it should.  p', '2004-05-18 19:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(725099, 76408, 6388, '<td valign="top">very nice.  she''ll be very happy with this :)  great contrast between she and the tree - nice idea.  great smile.  P</td>', 'very nice.  she''ll be very happy with this :)  great contrast between she and the tree - nice idea.  great smile.  P', '2004-05-18 19:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(725100, 76864, 21367, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot.  I like it.  I might have adjusted the lighting on the rose to the left of the center rose to match the other surrounding roses.  Good job.</td>', 'Very cool shot.  I like it.  I might have adjusted the lighting on the rose to the left of the center rose to match the other surrounding roses.  Good job.', '2004-05-18 19:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(725104, 77023, 6388, '<td valign="top">nice idea.  will get grief from the ''not centred'' people, but we should just pretend they don''t exist.  I wish the shadow on the bottom part of the left side wasn''t there 9from another building i presume).  that would have balanced it out a little better.  maybe wait an hour next time so the sun gets higher :)</td>', 'nice idea.  will get grief from the ''not centred'' people, but we should just pretend they don''t exist.  I wish the shadow on the bottom part of the left side wasn''t there 9from another building i presume).  that would have balanced it out a little better.  maybe wait an hour next time so the sun gets higher :)', '2004-05-18 19:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(725105, 76789, 6388, '<td valign="top">nice.  a little flat for my tastes...I''d try burning the shadows a little (or upping the contrast a bit, making sure not to blow out the sky)  I love that the door is open.</td>', 'nice.  a little flat for my tastes...I''d try burning the shadows a little (or upping the contrast a bit, making sure not to blow out the sky)  I love that the door is open.', '2004-05-18 19:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(725106, 76961, 6388, '<td valign="top">great idea. this should do well. I love shallow DOF, but i might have gone a little deeper so all the petals were in focus.  then the jeans might be in focus...not sure.  love the idea anyway. good luck.  P</td>', 'great idea. this should do well. I love shallow DOF, but i might have gone a little deeper so all the petals were in focus.  then the jeans might be in focus...not sure.  love the idea anyway. good luck.  P', '2004-05-18 19:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(725108, 75927, 6388, '<td valign="top">fill flash?  hard to tell but that was my guess since the pilots knuckles are a bit blown out.   a little burning would take care of that.  great car, great idea.  P</td>', 'fill flash?  hard to tell but that was my guess since the pilots knuckles are a bit blown out.   a little burning would take care of that.  great car, great idea.  P', '2004-05-18 19:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(725112, 76743, 6388, '<td valign="top">wonderful.  i can''t tell if you rotated it or not (looks that way) but either way, what a great look for the frog.  like he''s hugging it :)  I''d like to see it with his face dodged a little to bring out the detail a bit, but that''s about all I''d change.  great job; this will do well.  P</td>', 'wonderful.  i can''t tell if you rotated it or not (looks that way) but either way, what a great look for the frog.  like he''s hugging it :)  I''d like to see it with his face dodged a little to bring out the detail a bit, but that''s about all I''d change.  great job; this will do well.  P', '2004-05-18 19:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(725113, 76862, 7743, '<td valign="top">Dull grey skies or very bright skies always present a challenge.  If you want the sky to be exposed right then the shadows are too dark.  If you expose for the shadows then the sky is blown out.  In this situation it appears that the dark areas in your image are about a 1/2 to 1 stop under exposed.  A different perspective that includes less of the sky may have helped this situation. 5</td>', 'Dull grey skies or very bright skies always present a challenge.  If you want the sky to be exposed right then the shadows are too dark.  If you expose for the shadows then the sky is blown out.  In this situation it appears that the dark areas in your image are about a 1/2 to 1 stop under exposed.  A different perspective that includes less of the sky may have helped this situation. 5', '2004-05-18 19:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(725115, 76805, 17503, '<td valign="top">would have been cooler if the fence angle was ever so slightly at an angle, to show more perspective. Cool pic though, I love the open space. Where was this taken?</td>', 'would have been cooler if the fence angle was ever so slightly at an angle, to show more perspective. Cool pic though, I love the open space. Where was this taken?', '2004-05-18 19:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(725119, 76621, 6388, '<td valign="top">nice ride.  simple composition, and you managed to keep the chrome from blowing out everywhere - that''s a chore.  well done.  P</td>', 'nice ride.  simple composition, and you managed to keep the chrome from blowing out everywhere - that''s a chore.  well done.  P', '2004-05-18 19:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(725120, 77056, 6388, '<td valign="top">the not-centred police will get you for this, though i think it fits nicely.  the background is a little blown out, but there''s nothing wrong with a high-key setting when you have a cutie face smiling in it :)  P</td>', 'the not-centred police will get you for this, though i think it fits nicely.  the background is a little blown out, but there''s nothing wrong with a high-key setting when you have a cutie face smiling in it :)  P', '2004-05-18 19:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(725128, 76006, 7743, '<td valign="top">Very nice soft focus (created by the veil).  To achieve slightly better balance I would suggest cropping a small amount from the right. 8</td>', 'Very nice soft focus (created by the veil).  To achieve slightly better balance I would suggest cropping a small amount from the right. 8', '2004-05-18 19:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(725130, 76852, 6388, '<td valign="top">not sure about the rotation.  it actually throws the balance off a little, though i generally like that kind of thing.  great image though, nice and sharp, with lots of contrast and detail.  P</td>', 'not sure about the rotation.  it actually throws the balance off a little, though i generally like that kind of thing.  great image though, nice and sharp, with lots of contrast and detail.  P', '2004-05-18 20:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(725132, 76791, 6388, '<td valign="top">I think I entered something just like this in the Silhouettes challenge:)  nice idea (great minds think alike).  it could use a little more contrast for my taste.  P</td>', 'I think I entered something just like this in the Silhouettes challenge:)  nice idea (great minds think alike).  it could use a little more contrast for my taste.  P', '2004-05-18 20:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(725134, 75934, 6388, '<td valign="top">I suspect this should do quite well.  very sharp for a sunset picture.  not too many blown out highlights, which is rare for what I''d guess is a pretty long exposure.  Great work.</td>', 'I suspect this should do quite well.  very sharp for a sunset picture.  not too many blown out highlights, which is rare for what I''d guess is a pretty long exposure.  Great work.', '2004-05-18 20:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(725137, 76946, 6388, '<td valign="top">It looks pretty soft (in a Neat-Imaged kind of way) but it works here.  I''d like to see a little more contrast...particularly darker blacks.  a little well-placed burning would do famously methinks.  great job.  P</td>', 'It looks pretty soft (in a Neat-Imaged kind of way) but it works here.  I''d like to see a little more contrast...particularly darker blacks.  a little well-placed burning would do famously methinks.  great job.  P', '2004-05-18 20:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(725139, 77059, 6388, '<td valign="top">a little too high-key for me, but brought down a touch it''s my favourite image in the whole challenge.  I love it. 9  P</td>', 'a little too high-key for me, but brought down a touch it''s my favourite image in the whole challenge.  I love it. 9  P', '2004-05-18 20:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(725142, 76274, 6388, '<td valign="top">very nice.  a bit alien-like, but nice.  not contrasty enough for my taste, but fabulous DOF and clarity.  well done.  P</td>', 'very nice.  a bit alien-like, but nice.  not contrasty enough for my taste, but fabulous DOF and clarity.  well done.  P', '2004-05-18 20:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
