(725249, 77168, 8054, '<td valign="top">This has a photojournalistic feel to it and I like it. The noise and purposeful vignetting add to the feel and focus attention. I wish the vignetting was a bit more even, other than that, good job.</td>', 'This has a photojournalistic feel to it and I like it. The noise and purposeful vignetting add to the feel and focus attention. I wish the vignetting was a bit more even, other than that, good job.', '2004-05-18 21:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
