(725253, 77104, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple geometric designs accented by natural materials make for an interesting combination. The green leaves look almost purposefully placed but are a welcome touch as they break up the monotony of the ground pattern.</td>', 'Nice and simple geometric designs accented by natural materials make for an interesting combination. The green leaves look almost purposefully placed but are a welcome touch as they break up the monotony of the ground pattern.', '2004-05-18 21:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
