(725256, 76829, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! <br/>Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! <br/> <br/>I''m so f*?% jealous.  What a great shot.  I love bugs and I love wihte backgrounds.   Even the shadow works well.  How big is this little guy?   Great shot.  I really hope you ribbon; my favorite so far.  Jacko.   10</td>', 'Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow!  I''m so f*?% jealous.  What a great shot.  I love bugs and I love wihte backgrounds.   Even the shadow works well.  How big is this little guy?   Great shot.  I really hope you ribbon; my favorite so far.  Jacko.   10', '2004-05-18 21:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(725257, 76752, 8054, '<td valign="top">Not sure if it was possible to keep the insect 100% in focus while blurring the stalk or not. I would have appreciated seeing sharper details of the wings and especially the eyes. Nice job cropping as the background has nicely muted colors and are not distracting. 7</td>', 'Not sure if it was possible to keep the insect 100% in focus while blurring the stalk or not. I would have appreciated seeing sharper details of the wings and especially the eyes. Nice job cropping as the background has nicely muted colors and are not distracting. 7', '2004-05-18 21:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
