(725279, 76745, 8054, '<td valign="top">Amazing details of the flower petals and inner parts. Not much iin the way of the ladybug despite the title. Now if the ladybug was on one of the petals, I could understand the title. But in its current form, the ladybug just sorta blends in with the flower, unfortunately. The background is also too much in focus. I would rate this higher if it were blurred. Contrast can also use some minor adjustments. Good overall effort.</td>', 'Amazing details of the flower petals and inner parts. Not much iin the way of the ladybug despite the title. Now if the ladybug was on one of the petals, I could understand the title. But in its current form, the ladybug just sorta blends in with the flower, unfortunately. The background is also too much in focus. I would rate this higher if it were blurred. Contrast can also use some minor adjustments. Good overall effort.', '2004-05-18 21:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(725280, 76821, 11518, '<td valign="top">Godd idea but I would have preferred this to be less processed</td>', 'Godd idea but I would have preferred this to be less processed', '2004-05-18 21:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
