(725285, 77172, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice job focusing on just the center flower. Colors and saturation are excellent. I would have cleaned up the flowers physically by removing the dead petals etc. Those are distracting in my opinion. Background is nicely blurred and muted. 7</td>', 'Nice job focusing on just the center flower. Colors and saturation are excellent. I would have cleaned up the flowers physically by removing the dead petals etc. Those are distracting in my opinion. Background is nicely blurred and muted. 7', '2004-05-18 21:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
