(725301, 76621, 11518, '<td valign="top">NIce but the streaks on the top left and bottom left are distracting.  This being an advanced editing rule challange, removing the streaks is allowed.  Nice capture otherwise.  I like how you made the background black to bring out the bike.</td>', 'NIce but the streaks on the top left and bottom left are distracting.  This being an advanced editing rule challange, removing the streaks is allowed.  Nice capture otherwise.  I like how you made the background black to bring out the bike.', '2004-05-18 22:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
