(726444, 77159, 14603, '<td valign="top">Like the way the colour drops away into the dark centre and a nice uncluttered background adds impact.</td>', 'Like the way the colour drops away into the dark centre and a nice uncluttered background adds impact.', '2004-05-19 10:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
