(726475, 77115, 14603, '<td valign="top">Personally, I like partial desat shots but there are many who will score it down because they reckon it has taken the attention away from the subject.I think it does quite the opposite.<br/>I hope that doesn`t happen to you..good luck</td>', 'Personally, I like partial desat shots but there are many who will score it down because they reckon it has taken the attention away from the subject.I think it does quite the opposite.I hope that doesn`t happen to you..good luck', '2004-05-19 10:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(726487, 76761, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and geometrically pleasing to the eye..maybe just tilting a little to the left..then again that could be my eyes :) Good exposure and nice use of perspective.<br/>well done</td>', 'Nice composition and geometrically pleasing to the eye..maybe just tilting a little to the left..then again that could be my eyes :) Good exposure and nice use of perspective.well done', '2004-05-19 11:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(726505, 76974, 14603, '<td valign="top">This works well in b/w as it helps to isolate the subject from the background. <br/>You have a nice tonal range in the image as well.</td>', 'This works well in b/w as it helps to isolate the subject from the background. You have a nice tonal range in the image as well.', '2004-05-19 11:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(726511, 77180, 19952, '<td valign="top">Great picture! The only thing that strikes me is that the item in the center -the gear shift- is the only thing that seems a bit soft. Maybe that''s just because it''s the only thing that isn''t shiny. Anyway, really nice shot.</td>', 'Great picture! The only thing that strikes me is that the item in the center -the gear shift- is the only thing that seems a bit soft. Maybe that''s just because it''s the only thing that isn''t shiny. Anyway, really nice shot.', '2004-05-19 11:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(726535, 76855, 19952, '<td valign="top">What a great shot! The tower seems a tiny bit crooked and it would show more detail if it were lightened a bit (just the tower, not the lanterns), but this is a great photo with excellent colors. Nice job!</td>', 'What a great shot! The tower seems a tiny bit crooked and it would show more detail if it were lightened a bit (just the tower, not the lanterns), but this is a great photo with excellent colors. Nice job!', '2004-05-19 11:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(726538, 76577, 19952, '<td valign="top">I have never been more jealous of another person''s photo equipment - not to mention the talent it took to get such a great shot. :-) Really nice job!</td>', 'I have never been more jealous of another person''s photo equipment - not to mention the talent it took to get such a great shot. :-) Really nice job!', '2004-05-19 11:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
