(726556, 77061, 7322, '<td valign="top">I would have appreciated this more if most of the candle rim had not been out of focus. The flame doesn''t appear to be as sharply focused as it could be.</td>', 'I would have appreciated this more if most of the candle rim had not been out of focus. The flame doesn''t appear to be as sharply focused as it could be.', '2004-05-19 11:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
