(726560, 76881, 7322, '<td valign="top">That splotch of flesh colored background is extremely distracting. You need a much simpler background to pull this shot off.</td>', 'That splotch of flesh colored background is extremely distracting. You need a much simpler background to pull this shot off.', '2004-05-19 11:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(726561, 76672, 7322, '<td valign="top">The subject matter is too far away to make a strong visual statement. It''s a rather boring shot.</td>', 'The subject matter is too far away to make a strong visual statement. It''s a rather boring shot.', '2004-05-19 11:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(726564, 77003, 7322, '<td valign="top">The evergreen branch makes a very distracting background for the bee. This is a visually cluttered shot.</td>', 'The evergreen branch makes a very distracting background for the bee. This is a visually cluttered shot.', '2004-05-19 11:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(726565, 77138, 14603, '<td valign="top">Powerful image ..I like the way the subject has shielded the sun but allowed the rays to show through......fantastic sky also.<br/>My only minor quibble is the slightly plastic appearance of the sea. (neat image ?)<br/>The horizon line appears to drop from left to right but this can often be an optical illusion caused by the contours of the coastline...either way it doesn`t spoil this excellent image for me.<br/>Well done</td>', 'Powerful image ..I like the way the subject has shielded the sun but allowed the rays to show through......fantastic sky also.My only minor quibble is the slightly plastic appearance of the sea. (neat image ?)The horizon line appears to drop from left to right but this can often be an optical illusion caused by the contours of the coastline...either way it doesn`t spoil this excellent image for me.Well done', '2004-05-19 11:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(726566, 76805, 21594, '<td valign="top">nice ideea to centre it on two directions but the fence is almost invisible...if you didn''t mention i wouldn''t knew was a fence</td>', 'nice ideea to centre it on two directions but the fence is almost invisible...if you didn''t mention i wouldn''t knew was a fence', '2004-05-19 11:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(726569, 77156, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the dancer''s expression, the focus and color are good. But there is too much clutter going on to really appreciate this shot. The guy playing that hammered string instrument directly behind her is the worst distraction. If you could have placed yourself at some point where you would see less going on behind her it would have helped. I would suggest cropping this shot really tightly and Photoshopping out the guy''s white shirt and you''ll have a really nice shot.</td>', 'I like the dancer''s expression, the focus and color are good. But there is too much clutter going on to really appreciate this shot. The guy playing that hammered string instrument directly behind her is the worst distraction. If you could have placed yourself at some point where you would see less going on behind her it would have helped. I would suggest cropping this shot really tightly and Photoshopping out the guy''s white shirt and you''ll have a really nice shot.', '2004-05-19 11:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(726570, 76795, 21594, '<td valign="top">good capture...i would like atighter crop...the ''visitor'' brakes the symetry of the centred composition which i like very much</td>', 'good capture...i would like atighter crop...the ''visitor'' brakes the symetry of the centred composition which i like very much', '2004-05-19 11:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(726572, 76292, 21594, '<td valign="top">good...a darker sky would help</td>', 'good...a darker sky would help', '2004-05-19 11:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(726573, 77153, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice effort but this just says to me, "Baby carriage in the middle of a field". The baby carriage without the baby is not interesting enough to be a main visual element, no matter what you title the picture.</td>', 'Nice effort but this just says to me, "Baby carriage in the middle of a field". The baby carriage without the baby is not interesting enough to be a main visual element, no matter what you title the picture.', '2004-05-19 11:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
