(726578, 77180, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot in terms of sharpness. You''ve got the gear shift pretty dead center (I''m not measuring). But I don''t know....it''s a car interior and the main focus is the gear shift? The sepia tone was a good choice in terms of helping to tone down the visual clutter.</td>', 'This is a nice shot in terms of sharpness. You''ve got the gear shift pretty dead center (I''m not measuring). But I don''t know....it''s a car interior and the main focus is the gear shift? The sepia tone was a good choice in terms of helping to tone down the visual clutter.', '2004-05-19 11:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(726581, 77041, 19952, '<td valign="top">What a great photo. Absolutely beautiful.</td>', 'What a great photo. Absolutely beautiful.', '2004-05-19 11:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(726582, 77185, 7322, '<td valign="top">That weird thing on the eye is disturbing but not in a good way. It''s just creepy. Sometimes simple is best. Just the eye would have been fine.</td>', 'That weird thing on the eye is disturbing but not in a good way. It''s just creepy. Sometimes simple is best. Just the eye would have been fine.', '2004-05-19 11:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
