(726600, 77129, 7322, '<td valign="top">The stamen is centered, yes, but it isn'' t really the main visual element of this photograph. I had a hard time seeing it against the background. The main visual element of this photo seems to be color.</td>', 'The stamen is centered, yes, but it isn'' t really the main visual element of this photograph. I had a hard time seeing it against the background. The main visual element of this photo seems to be color.', '2004-05-19 11:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(726601, 76274, 19952, '<td valign="top">Excellent soft colors and a great shot. Very nice!</td>', 'Excellent soft colors and a great shot. Very nice!', '2004-05-19 11:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(726604, 76743, 14603, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and excellent clarity..coupled with the "cute" pose, should ensure that this image scores well.</td>', 'Good lighting and excellent clarity..coupled with the "cute" pose, should ensure that this image scores well.', '2004-05-19 11:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(726606, 77109, 19952, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t have included the other flower in the frame, but the photo is just beautiful regardless. Really nice shot.</td>', 'I wouldn''t have included the other flower in the frame, but the photo is just beautiful regardless. Really nice shot.', '2004-05-19 11:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(726609, 77110, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the red and the blue. I also like the slightly blurred trees. I''m trying not to be a stickler about the guidelines of the challenge but they did say specifically, ''dead center'' and this isn''t. It is only horizontally centered. I gave it a five because of that. Otherwise I would give it a 6.</td>', 'I like the red and the blue. I also like the slightly blurred trees. I''m trying not to be a stickler about the guidelines of the challenge but they did say specifically, ''dead center'' and this isn''t. It is only horizontally centered. I gave it a five because of that. Otherwise I would give it a 6.', '2004-05-19 11:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
