(726633, 76217, 19952, '<td valign="top">Really crisp photo of a great subject. I expect this photo to make an appearance on an insect porn site any time now... Very nice job!</td>', 'Really crisp photo of a great subject. I expect this photo to make an appearance on an insect porn site any time now... Very nice job!', '2004-05-19 12:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(726634, 77116, 7322, '<td valign="top">This might have been a lovely shot if I could see it better. Please take advantage of the 640 pixel max we are allowed. The horse is just to small to appreciate at this size. I like the use of the grapevine arbors as a framing device. I think maybe one would have sufficed, allowing you to move in closer to the horse. I''m not sure if you could have kept the horse dead center but it is likely you could have. In spite of the small size of your image, I gave this a 5 for its potential.</td>', 'This might have been a lovely shot if I could see it better. Please take advantage of the 640 pixel max we are allowed. The horse is just to small to appreciate at this size. I like the use of the grapevine arbors as a framing device. I think maybe one would have sufficed, allowing you to move in closer to the horse. I''m not sure if you could have kept the horse dead center but it is likely you could have. In spite of the small size of your image, I gave this a 5 for its potential.', '2004-05-19 12:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(726636, 77161, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is horizontally centered but not dead center. To my eye, dead center is about where the green dot on the egg cup is---not the main visual element of this photo. The focus is excellent. That dark corner of tablecloth is pretty distracting. Nice blurred background. The subject is kind of dull.</td>', 'This is horizontally centered but not dead center. To my eye, dead center is about where the green dot on the egg cup is---not the main visual element of this photo. The focus is excellent. That dark corner of tablecloth is pretty distracting. Nice blurred background. The subject is kind of dull.', '2004-05-19 12:04:51.000000', NULL, 1);
