(726649, 76209, 7322, '<td valign="top">The child''s skin tone is rather washed out (from flash, I suspect). I''m baffled by the choice of black and white for a butterfly garden. The background could have used a bit more blurring. The fence in the lower left corner is distracting. The composition is really nice (with a teeny bit more cropping of the left side of the frame). I gave it a 5.</td>', 'The child''s skin tone is rather washed out (from flash, I suspect). I''m baffled by the choice of black and white for a butterfly garden. The background could have used a bit more blurring. The fence in the lower left corner is distracting. The composition is really nice (with a teeny bit more cropping of the left side of the frame). I gave it a 5.', '2004-05-19 12:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
