(726659, 76952, 20210, '<td valign="top">I was wondering how many people would have a gun-barrel handy to try this.  I really do like the idea, but this rendition doesn''t have the effect I was imagining.  I guess I''d like to be scared by it. :)  Maybe move the barrel dead center in the frame, and it could use a lot more sharpness across the whole tip of the gun.  But these are nitpicks, great shot!</td>', 'I was wondering how many people would have a gun-barrel handy to try this.  I really do like the idea, but this rendition doesn''t have the effect I was imagining.  I guess I''d like to be scared by it. :)  Maybe move the barrel dead center in the frame, and it could use a lot more sharpness across the whole tip of the gun.  But these are nitpicks, great shot!', '2004-05-19 12:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
