(727806, 77149, 8054, '<td valign="top">I like the house in the background and I feel that it should have more presence in the photo. In this current state it''s the tree that takes precedence as it covers a higher percentage of the frame than the house does and it''s in the foreground; a double whammy, if you will.</td>', 'I like the house in the background and I feel that it should have more presence in the photo. In this current state it''s the tree that takes precedence as it covers a higher percentage of the frame than the house does and it''s in the foreground; a double whammy, if you will.', '2004-05-19 18:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(727811, 76772, 8054, '<td valign="top">This appears to be a mostly centered shed. Look at the right side and there appears to be a roofline extension that runs into the frame edge. Now, considering the challenge, I feel that the roofline extension should be treated equally and get the same amount of neagative space as the left side and top and it clearly does not. However, you have fairly good focus and colors seem well saturated.</td>', 'This appears to be a mostly centered shed. Look at the right side and there appears to be a roofline extension that runs into the frame edge. Now, considering the challenge, I feel that the roofline extension should be treated equally and get the same amount of neagative space as the left side and top and it clearly does not. However, you have fairly good focus and colors seem well saturated.', '2004-05-19 18:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
