(727850, 77180, 16126, '<td valign="top">Composition is very good, and I like the ''slick'' atmosphere of this image a lot! The link to the challenge seems a bit weak though, I guess the knob of the stick-shift is centered intentionally...</td>', 'Composition is very good, and I like the ''slick'' atmosphere of this image a lot! The link to the challenge seems a bit weak though, I guess the knob of the stick-shift is centered intentionally...', '2004-05-19 19:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
