(727915, 76457, 9411, '<td valign="top">hmm, not something you see every day.. an urban bovine. I like the use of black and white. she is well camouflaged, took me a second to deduce what was here. nice textures, good use of B&amp;W.  maybe a touch more contrast, the light is just a little flat. 8</td>', 'hmm, not something you see every day.. an urban bovine. I like the use of black and white. she is well camouflaged, took me a second to deduce what was here. nice textures, good use of B&W.  maybe a touch more contrast, the light is just a little flat. 8', '2004-05-19 19:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(727918, 76871, 9411, '<td valign="top">Normally I love selective desaturation. This one is leaving me wanting more. Possibly if you hadn''t completely removed it all, left just a touch the image would have worked better for me.. of course this is just my opinion.  It''s a great shot. So it''s all a matter of taste, I love seeing the little bits of her legs showing.  8</td>', 'Normally I love selective desaturation. This one is leaving me wanting more. Possibly if you hadn''t completely removed it all, left just a touch the image would have worked better for me.. of course this is just my opinion.  It''s a great shot. So it''s all a matter of taste, I love seeing the little bits of her legs showing.  8', '2004-05-19 19:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(727921, 76158, 9411, '<td valign="top">well, this is not screaming Viva Las Vegas at me. So I''m not sure what the title is about.  I really like the shot, though. grainy, vignetted, super tones. like a Holga gone wild.  Maybe just a touch close on the top and bottom crop.. nicely done. 8</td>', 'well, this is not screaming Viva Las Vegas at me. So I''m not sure what the title is about.  I really like the shot, though. grainy, vignetted, super tones. like a Holga gone wild.  Maybe just a touch close on the top and bottom crop.. nicely done. 8', '2004-05-19 19:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(727926, 77124, 4747, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2004-05-19 19:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(728028, 75891, 8054, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF. Amazingly sharp details of most of the ladybug. The head area is a bit blurry but that''s because of the very shallow DOF. Colors are also very nice. 8</td>', 'Excellent DOF. Amazingly sharp details of most of the ladybug. The head area is a bit blurry but that''s because of the very shallow DOF. Colors are also very nice. 8', '2004-05-19 20:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
