(728068, 77132, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice (back)lighting and very good details in the glass. Slight compression artifacts but not enough to distract me. 7</td>', 'Nice (back)lighting and very good details in the glass. Slight compression artifacts but not enough to distract me. 7', '2004-05-19 20:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(728073, 77089, 8054, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see the four flowers in full focus rather than just the one on top and the leaf. Background is a bit busy, too.</td>', 'I would have liked to see the four flowers in full focus rather than just the one on top and the leaf. Background is a bit busy, too.', '2004-05-19 20:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(728080, 76998, 8054, '<td valign="top">You might get points deducted for those who do not know what "wahine" means (not wahini). It''s a Hawaiian word that means "woman." Lighting seems a bit bright and extra hazy. Focus seems a bit soft. Nice vibrant colors on the surfboard.</td>', 'You might get points deducted for those who do not know what "wahine" means (not wahini). It''s a Hawaiian word that means "woman." Lighting seems a bit bright and extra hazy. Focus seems a bit soft. Nice vibrant colors on the surfboard.', '2004-05-19 21:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(728084, 76704, 8054, '<td valign="top">Lighting is harsh and looks like it''s oversharpened a bit. Good colors and saturation.</td>', 'Lighting is harsh and looks like it''s oversharpened a bit. Good colors and saturation.', '2004-05-19 21:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(728152, 77022, 1280, '<td valign="top">Is that a face reflected?  That could be clearer, not that I''ve ever done it though.  However the iris is amazing!  Fantastic pattern, though also a little too soft focus. That''s where the focus should be crisp, in the pupil and the iris.  I like how you used the colour selection.</td>', 'Is that a face reflected?  That could be clearer, not that I''ve ever done it though.  However the iris is amazing!  Fantastic pattern, though also a little too soft focus. That''s where the focus should be crisp, in the pupil and the iris.  I like how you used the colour selection.', '2004-05-19 21:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(728158, 76983, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of art.  Pretty well focused.</td>', 'Nice capture of art.  Pretty well focused.', '2004-05-19 21:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(728159, 76735, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and subject, but the focus is softer than it should be.</td>', 'Nice idea and subject, but the focus is softer than it should be.', '2004-05-19 21:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(728161, 76698, 1280, '<td valign="top">Pretty.  The uneven lighting detracts a bit, and the focus in the center could be a bit sharper to reveal more detail.</td>', 'Pretty.  The uneven lighting detracts a bit, and the focus in the center could be a bit sharper to reveal more detail.', '2004-05-19 21:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(728162, 76577, 7350, '<td valign="top">If this is who I think it is, I''m guessing this bee is dead, and has possibly been in your freezer for weeks, waiting for this challenge.  Anyway, nice detail, very hairy.  10.</td>', 'If this is who I think it is, I''m guessing this bee is dead, and has possibly been in your freezer for weeks, waiting for this challenge.  Anyway, nice detail, very hairy.  10.', '2004-05-19 21:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(728166, 76293, 1280, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.  Is it a lighthouse?  It''s a bit tough to tell.  So there isn''t a clear subject.  The leading lines, however,  are very good.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.  Is it a lighthouse?  It''s a bit tough to tell.  So there isn''t a clear subject.  The leading lines, however,  are very good.', '2004-05-19 21:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(728174, 76343, 2158, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I really like the way you have managed to make the parked cars enhance the shot where in so many photos they are a distraction.</td>', 'Great shot.  I really like the way you have managed to make the parked cars enhance the shot where in so many photos they are a distraction.', '2004-05-19 22:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(728183, 76871, 1280, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture of froggy.  I''d much rather see the colour of his environment personally.  But experimenting is fun, and I applaud your efforts. :-)</td>', 'Wonderful capture of froggy.  I''d much rather see the colour of his environment personally.  But experimenting is fun, and I applaud your efforts. :-)', '2004-05-19 22:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(728189, 77056, 1280, '<td valign="top">Oh this is sweet.  The child is beautiful, and worthy of being the "central figure."<br/>She''s ;beautifully framed by the red, which also coordinates nicely with her blouse.  Good job over all.</td>', 'Oh this is sweet.  The child is beautiful, and worthy of being the "central figure."She''s ;beautifully framed by the red, which also coordinates nicely with her blouse.  Good job over all.', '2004-05-19 22:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(728199, 76006, 4210, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful. Meets the challenge, but is still off center enough to catch the eyes of the veiwer.</td>', 'Very beautiful. Meets the challenge, but is still off center enough to catch the eyes of the veiwer.', '2004-05-19 22:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(728203, 76743, 4210, '<td valign="top">Aww, this is so cute! I love the colours, DOF, and just the fuzzy warmness of the image.</td>', 'Aww, this is so cute! I love the colours, DOF, and just the fuzzy warmness of the image.', '2004-05-19 22:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(728212, 76818, 1280, '<td valign="top">Pretty!  Interesting center, could be a bit brighter.</td>', 'Pretty!  Interesting center, could be a bit brighter.', '2004-05-19 22:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(728217, 76150, 2716, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see a less noisy image, however it''s a very strong portrait with lots of character.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'I''d like to see a less noisy image, however it''s a very strong portrait with lots of character.  Jacko.  8', '2004-05-19 22:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(728245, 77172, 164, '<td valign="top">Great lighting</td>', 'Great lighting', '2004-05-19 23:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
