(728456, 76292, 18677, '<td valign="top">I like the yellow.  I wish you would''ve cloned out the power lines</td>', 'I like the yellow.  I wish you would''ve cloned out the power lines', '2004-05-20 01:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(728457, 77114, 18677, '<td valign="top">very nice colors.  I''d prefer a slightly tighter crop and slightly shallower DOF</td>', 'very nice colors.  I''d prefer a slightly tighter crop and slightly shallower DOF', '2004-05-20 01:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(728458, 77009, 4767, '<td valign="top">A little homage to St Ansel, eh?  Who can criticise such a photographic icon?  Especially when it''s well done...  (I''d have liked it centered horizontally AND vertically, but that''s a minor nit-pick).  Well done.</td>', 'A little homage to St Ansel, eh?  Who can criticise such a photographic icon?  Especially when it''s well done...  (I''d have liked it centered horizontally AND vertically, but that''s a minor nit-pick).  Well done.', '2004-05-20 01:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(728459, 76991, 18677, '<td valign="top">either oversharpened or not resized properly. image quality is extremely poor</td>', 'either oversharpened or not resized properly. image quality is extremely poor', '2004-05-20 01:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(728467, 76209, 18677, '<td valign="top">47K ?  the limit is 150.  It is compressed too much.  Less compression would significantly improve the quality of this one.  The JPEG artifacts in the background are visible enough to distract from the subject</td>', '47K ?  the limit is 150.  It is compressed too much.  Less compression would significantly improve the quality of this one.  The JPEG artifacts in the background are visible enough to distract from the subject', '2004-05-20 01:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(728484, 76343, 21367, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.  With all the detail here you have still accomplished forcing the viewer  down the center and into the center of the shot.  Great job.  They is a little blown out at the top but dosen''t distract from the over all shot.</td>', 'Very nice capture.  With all the detail here you have still accomplished forcing the viewer  down the center and into the center of the shot.  Great job.  They is a little blown out at the top but dosen''t distract from the over all shot.', '2004-05-20 01:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(728488, 76603, 21367, '<td valign="top">Excellent close up, I think a little less dof would have made this a better shot.  Just my thought.  Lovely colors and very nice detail.</td>', 'Excellent close up, I think a little less dof would have made this a better shot.  Just my thought.  Lovely colors and very nice detail.', '2004-05-20 02:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(728493, 77168, 21179, '<td valign="top">this is a sweet photo. it has a great worn look to it to match the chair. well done.<br/>visually interesting subject and well composed</td>', 'this is a sweet photo. it has a great worn look to it to match the chair. well done.visually interesting subject and well composed', '2004-05-20 02:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
