(728614, 76773, 20395, '<td valign="top">What''s sitting in the passenger, er, drivers? seat??? <br/>In all seriousness, this is an excellent photo I''m sure I''ll see in the top ten!</td>', 'What''s sitting in the passenger, er, drivers? seat??? In all seriousness, this is an excellent photo I''m sure I''ll see in the top ten!', '2004-05-20 06:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(728615, 77121, 20395, '<td valign="top">The darker tree near the front really competes for focus. I like the hazy light, but I''d also like some more dark values to provide a little contrast. Interesting shot.</td>', 'The darker tree near the front really competes for focus. I like the hazy light, but I''d also like some more dark values to provide a little contrast. Interesting shot.', '2004-05-20 06:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(728620, 76961, 20395, '<td valign="top">If you can track down something called "spirit gum", its an adhesive used for stage makeup, it would make taking a shot like that a lot less delicate. Also fake eyelash glue that you can get at any grocery store works. <br/> <br/>I like the lighting very much, the DOF is a little shallow for me though. 7</td>', 'If you can track down something called "spirit gum", its an adhesive used for stage makeup, it would make taking a shot like that a lot less delicate. Also fake eyelash glue that you can get at any grocery store works.  I like the lighting very much, the DOF is a little shallow for me though. 7', '2004-05-20 06:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(728623, 76293, 18450, '<td valign="top">lovely leading lines</td>', 'lovely leading lines', '2004-05-20 06:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(728626, 76743, 20395, '<td valign="top">It''s strangely noisy around the frog, but a really nice, emotive shot! He''s got a little froggy smile!</td>', 'It''s strangely noisy around the frog, but a really nice, emotive shot! He''s got a little froggy smile!', '2004-05-20 06:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(728628, 76735, 20395, '<td valign="top">The camera is focused on the sand above the sand dollar. Bringing the focus down would help a lot.</td>', 'The camera is focused on the sand above the sand dollar. Bringing the focus down would help a lot.', '2004-05-20 06:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(728635, 76973, 20395, '<td valign="top">Although the image is centered, the focal point is actually the point of the swirl, which is off center.</td>', 'Although the image is centered, the focal point is actually the point of the swirl, which is off center.', '2004-05-20 06:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(728692, 76351, 20395, '<td valign="top">I reeeeeeeeeeeeeeally like the lighting in this shot. Reaaaaaaaally. I want to crop in just a tad, maybe half an inch all the way around.</td>', 'I reeeeeeeeeeeeeeally like the lighting in this shot. Reaaaaaaaally. I want to crop in just a tad, maybe half an inch all the way around.', '2004-05-20 07:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(728693, 76400, 20395, '<td valign="top">It looks like he''s gonna eat it... Nice DOF, the eyes say ohno! but the mouth says, mmmm tasty,,,</td>', 'It looks like he''s gonna eat it... Nice DOF, the eyes say ohno! but the mouth says, mmmm tasty,,,', '2004-05-20 07:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(728694, 77056, 20395, '<td valign="top">You know, I''m looking at this again Mom, and Gracie really isn''t dead center. Not if the focal point is her eyes. <br/> <br/>That being said, the lighting is really cool. Where did you take this?</td>', 'You know, I''m looking at this again Mom, and Gracie really isn''t dead center. Not if the focal point is her eyes.  That being said, the lighting is really cool. Where did you take this?', '2004-05-20 07:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(728696, 76335, 21594, '<td valign="top">good chice of objects...the light/contrast could be improved though by chainging the curves in ps...also the the rack is out of focus...maybe due to a large aperture!?</td>', 'good chice of objects...the light/contrast could be improved though by chainging the curves in ps...also the the rack is out of focus...maybe due to a large aperture!?', '2004-05-20 07:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(728697, 77115, 20395, '<td valign="top">The selective desaturation sort of makes her look like she''s suffocating!</td>', 'The selective desaturation sort of makes her look like she''s suffocating!', '2004-05-20 07:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(728699, 76952, 20395, '<td valign="top">Creepy. Once you figure out what it is, it''s pretty alarming.</td>', 'Creepy. Once you figure out what it is, it''s pretty alarming.', '2004-05-20 07:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(728700, 76947, 20395, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool abstract. The hot pink has a strange grainy quality to it''s edges I''m not sure I like.</td>', 'Pretty cool abstract. The hot pink has a strange grainy quality to it''s edges I''m not sure I like.', '2004-05-20 07:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(728703, 76752, 18450, '<td valign="top">love the focus, colours, dof of this pic....wonderful</td>', 'love the focus, colours, dof of this pic....wonderful', '2004-05-20 07:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(728704, 76753, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like the strange depth of field here - well, perhaps not strange, but kind of antique, if you follow me. Love the almost model-like sense of detail and tidyness: makes it look so small. Aided by that film-like border, this has a real subtletly that I fear will be lost on the 10 second voters. Not sure that I wouldn''t personally have tried to avoid the blown-out sky, either with some kind of graduated filter or framing the subject against a solid background of other trees. But it''s lovely work as it is. 8</td>', 'I like the strange depth of field here - well, perhaps not strange, but kind of antique, if you follow me. Love the almost model-like sense of detail and tidyness: makes it look so small. Aided by that film-like border, this has a real subtletly that I fear will be lost on the 10 second voters. Not sure that I wouldn''t personally have tried to avoid the blown-out sky, either with some kind of graduated filter or framing the subject against a solid background of other trees. But it''s lovely work as it is. 8', '2004-05-20 07:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(728706, 76635, 6999, '<td valign="top">I think you fall into a slight trap here of just finding a subject and centring it, rather than finding a subject that benefits from being centred. Whilst there is some interest in framing him against pure grass, and the very slight leading lines of the cut pattern help, there isn''t enough to suggest a demand for a centred composition. Technically accomplished though - and perhaps there are things here the British eyes miss. 5</td>', 'I think you fall into a slight trap here of just finding a subject and centring it, rather than finding a subject that benefits from being centred. Whilst there is some interest in framing him against pure grass, and the very slight leading lines of the cut pattern help, there isn''t enough to suggest a demand for a centred composition. Technically accomplished though - and perhaps there are things here the British eyes miss. 5', '2004-05-20 08:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(728707, 76671, 20395, '<td valign="top">Super cool. It would be super cooler without the shadow. Maybe another source of light just shining on the lower level to minimize the shadow?</td>', 'Super cool. It would be super cooler without the shadow. Maybe another source of light just shining on the lower level to minimize the shadow?', '2004-05-20 08:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(728710, 76751, 20395, '<td valign="top">Really cool concept. I wish the guy was doing something a little more interesting though, right now he''s sorta all balled up. 7</td>', 'Really cool concept. I wish the guy was doing something a little more interesting though, right now he''s sorta all balled up. 7', '2004-05-20 08:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(728711, 76577, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not at all sure about this. Obviously highly accomplished, there is little to criticise technically, if at all. Some of your choices confuse me though - the extreme shallow dof - and its affect on the attenae, coming in and out of focus ... also I keep wanting to see more detail in the hairs of it''s head, but they''re out of focus, and I''m not finding enough interest in the patterning of the eyes, which is where he focus is. It''s confusing to my eye, but not challenging. 5</td>', 'Not at all sure about this. Obviously highly accomplished, there is little to criticise technically, if at all. Some of your choices confuse me though - the extreme shallow dof - and its affect on the attenae, coming in and out of focus ... also I keep wanting to see more detail in the hairs of it''s head, but they''re out of focus, and I''m not finding enough interest in the patterning of the eyes, which is where he focus is. It''s confusing to my eye, but not challenging. 5', '2004-05-20 08:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(728712, 77108, 20395, '<td valign="top">I like how the 4 birds in flight almost look like a stop motion image of one bird.</td>', 'I like how the 4 birds in flight almost look like a stop motion image of one bird.', '2004-05-20 08:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(728713, 76144, 7684, '<td valign="top">How did you do this? Great idea. I like the colors and composition. 10.</td>', 'How did you do this? Great idea. I like the colors and composition. 10.', '2004-05-20 08:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(728714, 76698, 7684, '<td valign="top">7.</td>', '7.', '2004-05-20 08:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(728715, 76081, 7684, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. 9.</td>', 'Nice idea. 9.', '2004-05-20 08:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(728738, 76852, 6999, '<td valign="top">Couldn''t work out what the apparent motion blur was at first, but I guess it''s just the out of focus water, yeah? The tilt absolutely makes this: balances the composition nicely, allowing those shapes to give movemnt through the frame rather than blocking them all to one side and one edge. Good work there - wonder how many comments will criticise it? Either your processing or your exposure causes me some problems though - the eye is so dark it feels like a ''wrong'' photo - and the eyes are essential in almost all wildlife photos. Perhaps if you''d under-exposed and then brought the highlights back in post-processing? Might give you more range of detail, without losing that level of contrast completely. 6</td>', 'Couldn''t work out what the apparent motion blur was at first, but I guess it''s just the out of focus water, yeah? The tilt absolutely makes this: balances the composition nicely, allowing those shapes to give movemnt through the frame rather than blocking them all to one side and one edge. Good work there - wonder how many comments will criticise it? Either your processing or your exposure causes me some problems though - the eye is so dark it feels like a ''wrong'' photo - and the eyes are essential in almost all wildlife photos. Perhaps if you''d under-exposed and then brought the highlights back in post-processing? Might give you more range of detail, without losing that level of contrast completely. 6', '2004-05-20 08:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(728744, 76495, 18450, '<td valign="top">really like this photo......the concept, the colours, the detail - everything</td>', 'really like this photo......the concept, the colours, the detail - everything', '2004-05-20 08:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(728750, 76871, 6999, '<td valign="top">Technically, near-perfect. The array of those small leaves gives good blance to the idea of a centred composition here, and allows this shot to work. The de-saturation of the leaves is a personal choice of course - but likewise, it''s a personal bugbear for me (one of the things such techniques opens you up to in a peer-voted competition), and I cannot see a justification for it here, can''t see what it adds, beyond a suggestion of shudder-value, of distaste. Makes it look like the thing is emerging from seware, rather than water. Great capture, for me let down by your processing. 6</td>', 'Technically, near-perfect. The array of those small leaves gives good blance to the idea of a centred composition here, and allows this shot to work. The de-saturation of the leaves is a personal choice of course - but likewise, it''s a personal bugbear for me (one of the things such techniques opens you up to in a peer-voted competition), and I cannot see a justification for it here, can''t see what it adds, beyond a suggestion of shudder-value, of distaste. Makes it look like the thing is emerging from seware, rather than water. Great capture, for me let down by your processing. 6', '2004-05-20 08:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(728791, 76971, 19608, '<td valign="top">A centered beauty, water drops make it even better.</td>', 'A centered beauty, water drops make it even better.', '2004-05-20 10:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(728794, 77155, 19608, '<td valign="top">It is addictive isn''t it?  Great idea but you tried to do too much with this attempt.</td>', 'It is addictive isn''t it?  Great idea but you tried to do too much with this attempt.', '2004-05-20 10:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(728796, 77055, 19608, '<td valign="top">Super idea - very original.  Somehow you needed o figure a way to get some light on the eye.  The colors of the CD are so vibrant, and the eye so "dim" - it loses impact.</td>', 'Super idea - very original.  Somehow you needed o figure a way to get some light on the eye.  The colors of the CD are so vibrant, and the eye so "dim" - it loses impact.', '2004-05-20 10:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(728797, 76104, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great time of day - nice lighting.  The hint of wind with small ripples in the water make the texture terrific.</td>', 'Great time of day - nice lighting.  The hint of wind with small ripples in the water make the texture terrific.', '2004-05-20 10:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(728950, 75891, 16148, '<td valign="top">Good color, depth, and focus.  You should do well in this challenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'Good color, depth, and focus.  You should do well in this challenge.  Good luck.', '2004-05-20 12:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(728972, 76343, 20882, '<td valign="top">This photo could have been improved by taking it on a day when they sky was less monotone.  Maybe at dawn or sunset or on a less cloudy day.</td>', 'This photo could have been improved by taking it on a day when they sky was less monotone.  Maybe at dawn or sunset or on a less cloudy day.', '2004-05-20 13:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(728974, 77129, 20882, '<td valign="top">Thank god this is original!  One more out of focus tulip and I would have quit this site.</td>', 'Thank god this is original!  One more out of focus tulip and I would have quit this site.', '2004-05-20 13:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(728991, 76857, 16126, '<td valign="top">Lighting is very nice. The two dark figures in the back are a bit distracting, my eyes keep wandering to them instead of the center figure.</td>', 'Lighting is very nice. The two dark figures in the back are a bit distracting, my eyes keep wandering to them instead of the center figure.', '2004-05-20 13:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(728993, 76389, 16126, '<td valign="top">Would have been nice with better lighting, it''s way too dark.</td>', 'Would have been nice with better lighting, it''s way too dark.', '2004-05-20 13:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(728996, 76753, 16126, '<td valign="top">Not  bad, but the top and bottom borders are a major distraction.</td>', 'Not  bad, but the top and bottom borders are a major distraction.', '2004-05-20 13:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(729006, 77110, 16126, '<td valign="top">Nice color! I would have liked to see either more cropping at the bottom (removing the houses) or more of the base of the tower and houses. As it is now they appear floating.</td>', 'Nice color! I would have liked to see either more cropping at the bottom (removing the houses) or more of the base of the tower and houses. As it is now they appear floating.', '2004-05-20 13:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(729008, 77155, 16126, '<td valign="top">The idea is nice, but it is quite out of focus and grainy.</td>', 'The idea is nice, but it is quite out of focus and grainy.', '2004-05-20 13:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(729018, 77168, 10686, '<td valign="top">I liike the way the corners are burned in to focus attention on the subject, the grain and the BW are great too. I''m not sure I care for the subject though.  6</td>', 'I liike the way the corners are burned in to focus attention on the subject, the grain and the BW are great too. I''m not sure I care for the subject though.  6', '2004-05-20 13:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(729023, 76209, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but, I don''t thinlk the B&amp;W is effective here, also the fill flash is too bright. 4</td>', 'Nice idea, but, I don''t thinlk the B&W is effective here, also the fill flash is too bright. 4', '2004-05-20 13:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(729025, 77043, 10686, '<td valign="top">I understand what it is, I just don''t really care for it as a photograph. 4</td>', 'I understand what it is, I just don''t really care for it as a photograph. 4', '2004-05-20 13:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(729027, 77162, 10686, '<td valign="top">Good exposure, but not very interesting, might help to change the POV, get down lower, get closer, something to engage the subject. 3</td>', 'Good exposure, but not very interesting, might help to change the POV, get down lower, get closer, something to engage the subject. 3', '2004-05-20 13:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(729028, 76272, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice soft color, the thing that makes it for me is the little piece that is broken off, shows that the bloom is not perfect, or eternal, but is deteriorating. 8</td>', 'Nice soft color, the thing that makes it for me is the little piece that is broken off, shows that the bloom is not perfect, or eternal, but is deteriorating. 8', '2004-05-20 13:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(729033, 76969, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice tight shot, but way too blurry. That ruins the shot. 2</td>', 'Nice tight shot, but way too blurry. That ruins the shot. 2', '2004-05-20 13:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(729036, 75983, 10686, '<td valign="top">Can''t say if I like the clouds or not. Interesting viewpoint, the green stuff looks fake, but I can''t tell for sure. Guess it just doesn''t reach out and grab me the way I want it to. 5</td>', 'Can''t say if I like the clouds or not. Interesting viewpoint, the green stuff looks fake, but I can''t tell for sure. Guess it just doesn''t reach out and grab me the way I want it to. 5', '2004-05-20 13:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(729039, 76072, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, but there''s no "POP" to it. Might try darkening the background a bit. 5</td>', 'Nice DOF, but there''s no "POP" to it. Might try darkening the background a bit. 5', '2004-05-20 13:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(729042, 77089, 20210, '<td valign="top">I"m not really clear on what''s centered about this photo.  Also, the flower petals don''t seem very sharp, and the white on the back top is a little distracting.  Keep at it!</td>', 'I"m not really clear on what''s centered about this photo.  Also, the flower petals don''t seem very sharp, and the white on the back top is a little distracting.  Keep at it!', '2004-05-20 14:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(729043, 76332, 20210, '<td valign="top">I''m very confused about the blue lights on the side.  Interesting shot though.  It either took very little work, or a *lot* or work, depending on exactly what this is. :)</td>', 'I''m very confused about the blue lights on the side.  Interesting shot though.  It either took very little work, or a *lot* or work, depending on exactly what this is. :)', '2004-05-20 14:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(729045, 77005, 20210, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I just wish the DOF covered the whole scene, and the light weren''t quite so harsh.  Still very good for this challenge, however.</td>', 'Great shot, I just wish the DOF covered the whole scene, and the light weren''t quite so harsh.  Still very good for this challenge, however.', '2004-05-20 14:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(729046, 76622, 20210, '<td valign="top">This looks like an interesting piece of artwork, but doesn''t do much for my photographically.</td>', 'This looks like an interesting piece of artwork, but doesn''t do much for my photographically.', '2004-05-20 14:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(729047, 76947, 20210, '<td valign="top">Very odd compression-like artifacts.  Was this a picture taken of a bad printout?  A neat idea, but the quality of the digital photo seems to really detract from the idea.</td>', 'Very odd compression-like artifacts.  Was this a picture taken of a bad printout?  A neat idea, but the quality of the digital photo seems to really detract from the idea.', '2004-05-20 14:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(729072, 76981, 20204, '<td valign="top">I love the detail in this shot, and it''s use of full frame.  Also like the nearly monochromatic, yet red tint; makes a nice feeling.  Great shot!</td>', 'I love the detail in this shot, and it''s use of full frame.  Also like the nearly monochromatic, yet red tint; makes a nice feeling.  Great shot!', '2004-05-20 14:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(729073, 76695, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming it''s use of contrast that made the background whited out... I really like the way the pure clean background emhpasizes the gazebo, and also gives it a contemplative mood.</td>', 'I''m assuming it''s use of contrast that made the background whited out... I really like the way the pure clean background emhpasizes the gazebo, and also gives it a contemplative mood.', '2004-05-20 14:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(729076, 77048, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the depth of this image - it brings together many excellent techniques.  Foreground / background balance, neat reflection, dramatic sky...  It''s obvious when thought goes into an image, and this is well done!</td>', 'I like the depth of this image - it brings together many excellent techniques.  Foreground / background balance, neat reflection, dramatic sky...  It''s obvious when thought goes into an image, and this is well done!', '2004-05-20 14:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(729077, 76852, 20204, '<td valign="top">The use of motion blur and angled orientation works well for me.  This is an interesting image that stands out from the crowd.</td>', 'The use of motion blur and angled orientation works well for me.  This is an interesting image that stands out from the crowd.', '2004-05-20 14:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(729078, 77141, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great exposure!  Not only is the water blur excellent, but the detail in the surrounding regions is very cool as well.  Nice technical composition!</td>', 'Great exposure!  Not only is the water blur excellent, but the detail in the surrounding regions is very cool as well.  Nice technical composition!', '2004-05-20 14:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(729081, 77138, 20204, '<td valign="top">This image has a definite poster quality... The one thing which I keep getting hung up on is the sailor looks almost artificially highlighted.  I''d like to see the subject more silhouetted so that I got the "idea" of the sailor, but could focus on the dramatic skys and water, and how the sailor blends into those elements rather than how the sailor contrasts with the elements.  Hopefully this makes snese - but overall this is a fantastic shot!</td>', 'This image has a definite poster quality... The one thing which I keep getting hung up on is the sailor looks almost artificially highlighted.  I''d like to see the subject more silhouetted so that I got the "idea" of the sailor, but could focus on the dramatic skys and water, and how the sailor blends into those elements rather than how the sailor contrasts with the elements.  Hopefully this makes snese - but overall this is a fantastic shot!', '2004-05-20 14:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(729084, 75908, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the large amount of sky in this, and the amount of grass as well.  Nicely composed.</td>', 'I like the large amount of sky in this, and the amount of grass as well.  Nicely composed.', '2004-05-20 14:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(729086, 77154, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the composition in this.  An interesting and rich blue sky makes a great contrast for the solid black silhouette.</td>', 'I like the composition in this.  An interesting and rich blue sky makes a great contrast for the solid black silhouette.', '2004-05-20 14:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(729091, 76168, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see this taken from a slightly lower point of view with the intent of making the "tracvks to infinity" effect more pronounced.  Also seems slightly overexposed so that some detail is washed out of the rocks in the upper right - possibly exposure compensation -1 would help, or a quicker shutter speed.    I like the way you kept the foreground free of distraction - emphasizes the trackes nicely.</td>', 'I''d like to see this taken from a slightly lower point of view with the intent of making the "tracvks to infinity" effect more pronounced.  Also seems slightly overexposed so that some detail is washed out of the rocks in the upper right - possibly exposure compensation -1 would help, or a quicker shutter speed.    I like the way you kept the foreground free of distraction - emphasizes the trackes nicely.', '2004-05-20 14:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(729092, 77102, 20204, '<td valign="top">This would be a nice shot on its own, but by contrasting the machinery against the sunset it''s very dramatic.  Great saturation in the shy, and excellent composition.</td>', 'This would be a nice shot on its own, but by contrasting the machinery against the sunset it''s very dramatic.  Great saturation in the shy, and excellent composition.', '2004-05-20 14:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(729094, 76219, 20204, '<td valign="top">Looks like a touch of blurring upper right of the flower which is distracting.  Nice cleaning of the background - nothing distracting at all.  I haven''t figured this out yet, but you''ve obviously mastered it!</td>', 'Looks like a touch of blurring upper right of the flower which is distracting.  Nice cleaning of the background - nothing distracting at all.  I haven''t figured this out yet, but you''ve obviously mastered it!', '2004-05-20 14:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(729095, 76966, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great to see the bug in this - I like a subtle detail that rewards the second glance.  Looks like the focus is good except for one spot near upper left.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Great to see the bug in this - I like a subtle detail that rewards the second glance.  Looks like the focus is good except for one spot near upper left.  Nice composition.', '2004-05-20 14:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(729098, 76293, 20204, '<td valign="top">I really like this image.  I''m a sucker for water, piers, and lighthouses.  I would have liked it even more if the horizontal line at the pier''s end was aligned with the horizontal horizon line.  It''s very subtle, but I think it would be an improvement.</td>', 'I really like this image.  I''m a sucker for water, piers, and lighthouses.  I would have liked it even more if the horizontal line at the pier''s end was aligned with the horizontal horizon line.  It''s very subtle, but I think it would be an improvement.', '2004-05-20 14:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(729100, 76085, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great composition - I like the way the flag''s bright colors stand out from the detailed, but almost monochromatic surroundings.  Nice composure, and very well balanced!</td>', 'Great composition - I like the way the flag''s bright colors stand out from the detailed, but almost monochromatic surroundings.  Nice composure, and very well balanced!', '2004-05-20 14:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(729111, 77129, 9668, '<td valign="top">I think the border on this is excessive, and detracts from the photo. You are ''hitting voters over the head'' with the title, but otherwise some wouldn''t figure it out, so that''s justified.<br/>It is a nice image in of itself. I like the contrast between red and yellow.</td>', 'I think the border on this is excessive, and detracts from the photo. You are ''hitting voters over the head'' with the title, but otherwise some wouldn''t figure it out, so that''s justified.It is a nice image in of itself. I like the contrast between red and yellow.', '2004-05-20 14:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(729120, 77159, 9668, '<td valign="top">These seems like a shot that Konador would take (recent macro, color cast). <br/> <br/>Technically perfect, great subject. Should do highly.</td>', 'These seems like a shot that Konador would take (recent macro, color cast).  Technically perfect, great subject. Should do highly.', '2004-05-20 15:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(729122, 76983, 9668, '<td valign="top">This image seems a bit noisy. Seems like more of a snapshot. Nice statue.</td>', 'This image seems a bit noisy. Seems like more of a snapshot. Nice statue.', '2004-05-20 15:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(729124, 76702, 9668, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, the face seems like the center of interest to me.</td>', 'Nice composition, the face seems like the center of interest to me.', '2004-05-20 15:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(729136, 77008, 9668, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, could be setup better.</td>', 'Interesting idea, could be setup better.', '2004-05-20 15:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(729138, 77104, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wet, dark saturated colors. Yep. I like it! 9</td>', 'Wet, dark saturated colors. Yep. I like it! 9', '2004-05-20 15:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(729140, 77114, 6870, '<td valign="top">It would be so nice if you could zoom/crop further, even if just for the web. Nice capture!</td>', 'It would be so nice if you could zoom/crop further, even if just for the web. Nice capture!', '2004-05-20 15:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(729142, 77102, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely. the well deserves it centered position. 10</td>', 'Lovely. the well deserves it centered position. 10', '2004-05-20 15:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(729147, 76752, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture. Nice, sharp focus, and very nice colors. In this instance, the rule of thirds may make this stronger, but still a nice image! 7</td>', 'Lovely capture. Nice, sharp focus, and very nice colors. In this instance, the rule of thirds may make this stronger, but still a nice image! 7', '2004-05-20 15:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(729148, 76540, 6870, '<td valign="top">Handsome guy, and nice camera! To be honest, I think the space on the right of the photographer seems obligatory, but I still like the shot. 8</td>', 'Handsome guy, and nice camera! To be honest, I think the space on the right of the photographer seems obligatory, but I still like the shot. 8', '2004-05-20 15:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(729150, 76745, 6870, '<td valign="top">Such wonderful saturation and tones! Nice work! 10</td>', 'Such wonderful saturation and tones! Nice work! 10', '2004-05-20 15:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(729151, 77141, 6870, '<td valign="top">Almost abstract and very, very lovely. I like the saturated colors and your long exposure of the water. 10</td>', 'Almost abstract and very, very lovely. I like the saturated colors and your long exposure of the water. 10', '2004-05-20 15:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(729153, 76597, 6870, '<td valign="top">So it''s autumn where you are, eh? Nice time of year! Nice colors and point of view here, though you may want to experiment with a bit more depth of field to get more of the flower into focus.</td>', 'So it''s autumn where you are, eh? Nice time of year! Nice colors and point of view here, though you may want to experiment with a bit more depth of field to get more of the flower into focus.', '2004-05-20 15:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(729248, 76618, 21367, '<td valign="top">Great shot, nice post work.  I''m still not sure if I would have gone color or b/w on the turn signals or not.  Still and excellent layout and shot.  Kudos.</td>', 'Great shot, nice post work.  I''m still not sure if I would have gone color or b/w on the turn signals or not.  Still and excellent layout and shot.  Kudos.', '2004-05-20 17:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(729284, 77011, 20210, '<td valign="top">This is aesthetically gorgeous.</td>', 'This is aesthetically gorgeous.', '2004-05-20 17:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(729285, 76618, 20210, '<td valign="top">Great title, and a very professional-style photo.  Almost too much bright light, but not quite.  Well done.</td>', 'Great title, and a very professional-style photo.  Almost too much bright light, but not quite.  Well done.', '2004-05-20 17:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(729286, 76335, 20210, '<td valign="top">This would be more effective if it were dead-on straight and centered.  It''s close, but it makes it look more like a snapshot instead of a great photo.  But still a good photo, good score.</td>', 'This would be more effective if it were dead-on straight and centered.  It''s close, but it makes it look more like a snapshot instead of a great photo.  But still a good photo, good score.', '2004-05-20 17:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(729297, 77032, 6388, '<td valign="top">love it. great lighting. nice crisp focus.  maybe a little shallow depth as the front foot is a little blurry, but no great loss there.  I wonder how many of these you took before you got the one you wanted? ;)  This should score well.  P</td>', 'love it. great lighting. nice crisp focus.  maybe a little shallow depth as the front foot is a little blurry, but no great loss there.  I wonder how many of these you took before you got the one you wanted? ;)  This should score well.  P', '2004-05-20 18:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(729300, 76671, 20210, '<td valign="top">I wish you''d had diffused lighting instead of the apparent flash, so the shadow of the blue one didn''t show up in the pile.  This would have been a much more striking effect, I think.  Nice work though!  Fun shot!</td>', 'I wish you''d had diffused lighting instead of the apparent flash, so the shadow of the blue one didn''t show up in the pile.  This would have been a much more striking effect, I think.  Nice work though!  Fun shot!', '2004-05-20 18:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(729306, 76775, 20210, '<td valign="top">What is the junk on the left side?  Seems like a photoshop job gone horribly wrong.  Otherwise, pretty decent shot.</td>', 'What is the junk on the left side?  Seems like a photoshop job gone horribly wrong.  Otherwise, pretty decent shot.', '2004-05-20 18:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(729310, 76829, 6388, '<td valign="top">cool.  that''s one ugly-ass spider. looks like he''s wearing aviator sunglasses :)  love the shallow depth, and you''ve done a pretty good job onthe lighting/backdrop, though the shadows have a lot of colour noise in them.  nice work.  P</td>', 'cool.  that''s one ugly-ass spider. looks like he''s wearing aviator sunglasses :)  love the shallow depth, and you''ve done a pretty good job onthe lighting/backdrop, though the shadows have a lot of colour noise in them.  nice work.  P', '2004-05-20 18:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(729319, 76574, 6388, '<td valign="top">this seems quite soft to me, perhaps a lighting issue.  It''s hard to get away with soft-focus on the close-up/macros, even if it''s intentional.  A little contrast would go a long way here i think.  great saturation of colours.  P</td>', 'this seems quite soft to me, perhaps a lighting issue.  It''s hard to get away with soft-focus on the close-up/macros, even if it''s intentional.  A little contrast would go a long way here i think.  great saturation of colours.  P', '2004-05-20 18:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(729325, 76168, 20539, '<td valign="top">wish the rails would be at the same height when they touch the side... sort of ruins the whole centered idea.</td>', 'wish the rails would be at the same height when they touch the side... sort of ruins the whole centered idea.', '2004-05-20 18:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(729328, 76740, 20539, '<td valign="top">very cool shot</td>', 'very cool shot', '2004-05-20 18:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(729331, 76068, 20539, '<td valign="top">the drool is just great</td>', 'the drool is just great', '2004-05-20 18:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(729332, 77179, 6388, '<td valign="top">The first thing I notice off the bat is the subject is not all that enticing.  real spiders maybe, plasitc ones...not so much.  secondly the surface that it sits on is a very difficult one to expose properly because of all the shiny bits.  You get lots of little blown out reflections, and it generally will underexpose your subject because of the huge contrast between it and the surface.<br/>On the plus side, your DOF is nice, focus on the middle is sharp, and you''ve controlled the lighting on the object nicely.  <br/>as for meeting the challenge, some of the anal-ysts will get you because they won''t look at the abdomen as the focal point, they choose the sternum and tell you you''re not in the centre. tough to meet the challenge in this case using that perspective on the spider.<br/>Hope this helps.  Sometimes you have to be around DPC awhile before you get the voters figured out.  of course, just when i think I''ve got them figured out i get hammered anyway, but whaddevah. :)<br/>P</td>', 'The first thing I notice off the bat is the subject is not all that enticing.  real spiders maybe, plasitc ones...not so much.  secondly the surface that it sits on is a very difficult one to expose properly because of all the shiny bits.  You get lots of little blown out reflections, and it generally will underexpose your subject because of the huge contrast between it and the surface.On the plus side, your DOF is nice, focus on the middle is sharp, and you''ve controlled the lighting on the object nicely.  as for meeting the challenge, some of the anal-ysts will get you because they won''t look at the abdomen as the focal point, they choose the sternum and tell you you''re not in the centre. tough to meet the challenge in this case using that perspective on the spider.Hope this helps.  Sometimes you have to be around DPC awhile before you get the voters figured out.  of course, just when i think I''ve got them figured out i get hammered anyway, but whaddevah. :)P', '2004-05-20 18:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(729333, 76390, 20539, '<td valign="top">should have included the whole peony</td>', 'should have included the whole peony', '2004-05-20 18:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(729335, 77014, 6388, '<td valign="top">ain''t simplicity grand?  Love this.  heck I''d frame it i think.  I can see this at about 16x20.  it looks nice and sharp, the lighting is fabulous, and the concept rocks.  well done.  P</td>', 'ain''t simplicity grand?  Love this.  heck I''d frame it i think.  I can see this at about 16x20.  it looks nice and sharp, the lighting is fabulous, and the concept rocks.  well done.  P', '2004-05-20 18:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
