(729339, 76704, 20539, '<td valign="top">hmm, i think the flash is a bit too much. maybe if there were a different light source, it would look a little better.</td>', 'hmm, i think the flash is a bit too much. maybe if there were a different light source, it would look a little better.', '2004-05-20 18:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(729340, 76158, 6388, '<td valign="top">magic.  can''t tell if you burned the vignette around her or if this is from your lens, but it works wonderfully (i did it on mine too).  the high-key contrast is awesome, and the grain really works given the subject.  Aside from this challenge i don''t think I''d have cropped it that way, but given the rules, you had to.  very creative.  P</td>', 'magic.  can''t tell if you burned the vignette around her or if this is from your lens, but it works wonderfully (i did it on mine too).  the high-key contrast is awesome, and the grain really works given the subject.  Aside from this challenge i don''t think I''d have cropped it that way, but given the rules, you had to.  very creative.  P', '2004-05-20 18:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(729344, 76379, 6388, '<td valign="top">Smashing.  This will look great framed. the lighting is perfect, the colour saturation works well too.  I might like a little more detail on the vase, but that''s minor.  I''m sure some will tell you it''s not centred, but they''re wrong :)  I hope this does well.<br/> <br/>P</td>', 'Smashing.  This will look great framed. the lighting is perfect, the colour saturation works well too.  I might like a little more detail on the vase, but that''s minor.  I''m sure some will tell you it''s not centred, but they''re wrong :)  I hope this does well. P', '2004-05-20 18:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
