(729498, 77137, 3080, '<td valign="top">Looks like a lion fish to me.  I got stung by a Volitan Lion about a week ago...NOT fun.  Anyway, Very lovely photo.  Your focus and clarity are great, color is perfect, and I think that the lighting was definately a key factor in great focus and color.  Everything about this photo is excellent.  I work for a place that deals with salt water fish, so maybe I''m partial, but this is a 10 from me.  Congrats. ~Heather~</td>', 'Looks like a lion fish to me.  I got stung by a Volitan Lion about a week ago...NOT fun.  Anyway, Very lovely photo.  Your focus and clarity are great, color is perfect, and I think that the lighting was definately a key factor in great focus and color.  Everything about this photo is excellent.  I work for a place that deals with salt water fish, so maybe I''m partial, but this is a 10 from me.  Congrats. ~Heather~', '2004-05-20 21:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(729499, 76741, 3080, '<td valign="top">Molly is a beautiful piggie.  I have 3 piggies, one is sick right now :(  I only wish the eyes were in focus here.  They seem a bit soft.  Also, the lighting on her nose seems to be a slight bit bright.  Definately a centered subject, and a very cute one at that.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Molly is a beautiful piggie.  I have 3 piggies, one is sick right now :(  I only wish the eyes were in focus here.  They seem a bit soft.  Also, the lighting on her nose seems to be a slight bit bright.  Definately a centered subject, and a very cute one at that.  ~Heather~', '2004-05-20 21:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(729502, 76335, 3080, '<td valign="top">Perfect.  Another 10 for me.  I love the shadows.  So lighting is definately a key factor here, and you hit it just right.  Love the black and whiteness.  The little light reflection on the vase is great.  I like it just the way it is.  Focus and clarity are great, and the centeredness is also wonderful.  Thanks for this image. ~Heather~</td>', 'Perfect.  Another 10 for me.  I love the shadows.  So lighting is definately a key factor here, and you hit it just right.  Love the black and whiteness.  The little light reflection on the vase is great.  I like it just the way it is.  Focus and clarity are great, and the centeredness is also wonderful.  Thanks for this image. ~Heather~', '2004-05-20 21:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(729515, 77048, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting shot.  Centered.  Focus and clarity are good.  Lighting creates a nice mood here as well.  Overall, the only thing that I could say is that it''s not exactly centered.  But not a big deal at all.  I like the colors and definately like the mood.  ~Heather~</td>', 'This is a very interesting shot.  Centered.  Focus and clarity are good.  Lighting creates a nice mood here as well.  Overall, the only thing that I could say is that it''s not exactly centered.  But not a big deal at all.  I like the colors and definately like the mood.  ~Heather~', '2004-05-20 21:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(729516, 76762, 3306, '<td valign="top">Really nice. Love the colors and the feel of motion.  Not sure it fits the challenge though.</td>', 'Really nice. Love the colors and the feel of motion.  Not sure it fits the challenge though.', '2004-05-20 21:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(729518, 77053, 3080, '<td valign="top">Your focus and clarity are good.  The photo does not have a lot of punch for me though.  I''m not drawn in and kept there.  It looks like you tried to get it centered, but in fact, it is off to the right a bit.  the bckground is nice, however, there is a small roundish cloud to the upper left of the left face that is a white color, and stands out among the darker clouds creating a distraction.  I like how the faces are silhouetted.  Technically good.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Your focus and clarity are good.  The photo does not have a lot of punch for me though.  I''m not drawn in and kept there.  It looks like you tried to get it centered, but in fact, it is off to the right a bit.  the bckground is nice, however, there is a small roundish cloud to the upper left of the left face that is a white color, and stands out among the darker clouds creating a distraction.  I like how the faces are silhouetted.  Technically good.  ~Heather~', '2004-05-20 21:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(729522, 77060, 3080, '<td valign="top">A very interesting centered subject.  There is a lot to look at here.  The eyes are excellent.  Very green.  I like the blurred stick.  However, I''m not sure if I''d have figured it out without the title.  Great focus and clarity.  Lighting is a slight bit harsh on the left side (our right) of his face, but otherwise, I think the lighting is perfect for the mood of the photo. ~Heather~</td>', 'A very interesting centered subject.  There is a lot to look at here.  The eyes are excellent.  Very green.  I like the blurred stick.  However, I''m not sure if I''d have figured it out without the title.  Great focus and clarity.  Lighting is a slight bit harsh on the left side (our right) of his face, but otherwise, I think the lighting is perfect for the mood of the photo. ~Heather~', '2004-05-20 21:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(729525, 76821, 3080, '<td valign="top">Simple and beautiful.  I don''t like the faded border really though.  I do very much like the centeredness of the island, and I think that focus and clarity are good.  I like how the island reflects in the waves of the water.  I like how the island just kind of comes out of the whiteness.  Very nice find. ~Heather~</td>', 'Simple and beautiful.  I don''t like the faded border really though.  I do very much like the centeredness of the island, and I think that focus and clarity are good.  I like how the island reflects in the waves of the water.  I like how the island just kind of comes out of the whiteness.  Very nice find. ~Heather~', '2004-05-20 21:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(729527, 77180, 2158, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but I wouldn''t really say the shift is the focal point of the picture.</td>', 'Great shot, but I wouldn''t really say the shift is the focal point of the picture.', '2004-05-20 21:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(729528, 76976, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of this shot.  It may be a little busy with so many leaves though.  the leaves kind of come out of the dark, which I like, but I''m wondering if the busy ness of the leaves makes it seem a bit cluttered.  I like how your subject isn''t really what''s centered, rather it''s your negative space that''s centered.  definately orriginal for the challenge.  I like it. ~Heather~</td>', 'I like the concept of this shot.  It may be a little busy with so many leaves though.  the leaves kind of come out of the dark, which I like, but I''m wondering if the busy ness of the leaves makes it seem a bit cluttered.  I like how your subject isn''t really what''s centered, rather it''s your negative space that''s centered.  definately orriginal for the challenge.  I like it. ~Heather~', '2004-05-20 21:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(729530, 76081, 2223, '<td valign="top">Wow thats close! and sharp, i really like this.</td>', 'Wow thats close! and sharp, i really like this.', '2004-05-20 21:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(729532, 77143, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately centered.  I''m wondering though if it''s just a bit too boring.  maybe a tighter crop would draw our attention in a bit more.  focus and clarity are really good, lighting looks good, and the background is alright too.  nothing distracting there.  technically, I think it''s a good shot, but it just doesn''t seem to work for me in the centered challenge.  meaning I guess that some things don''t look as good centered as they would otherwise.  hope that''s not too confusing. ~Heather~</td>', 'Definately centered.  I''m wondering though if it''s just a bit too boring.  maybe a tighter crop would draw our attention in a bit more.  focus and clarity are really good, lighting looks good, and the background is alright too.  nothing distracting there.  technically, I think it''s a good shot, but it just doesn''t seem to work for me in the centered challenge.  meaning I guess that some things don''t look as good centered as they would otherwise.  hope that''s not too confusing. ~Heather~', '2004-05-20 21:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(729535, 76273, 2223, '<td valign="top">OH MY GOD!  I have been wondering what these creatures looked like and here it is!  Awesome capture!</td>', 'OH MY GOD!  I have been wondering what these creatures looked like and here it is!  Awesome capture!', '2004-05-20 21:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
