(731477, 76946, 15207, '<td valign="top">I really like this. It''s one of my favorites so far and I can see you getting a ribbon with this one (or at least top 10). It does look as though you used a bit too much noise reduction to soften the image and that''s a bit distracting. I think I would have liked it just as much without NeatImage or something like that. However, just my personal taste. -9</td>', 'I really like this. It''s one of my favorites so far and I can see you getting a ribbon with this one (or at least top 10). It does look as though you used a bit too much noise reduction to soften the image and that''s a bit distracting. I think I would have liked it just as much without NeatImage or something like that. However, just my personal taste. -9', '2004-05-22 14:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
