(731479, 76743, 15207, '<td valign="top">I really hope you do well with this. This is my absolute favorite. I love those little frogs. I hope you''re able to turn it into a print or sell it to a stock agency when you''re done. This is one of hte best photos I"ve seen in DP Challenge in quite a few weeks! Good luck!</td>', 'I really hope you do well with this. This is my absolute favorite. I love those little frogs. I hope you''re able to turn it into a print or sell it to a stock agency when you''re done. This is one of hte best photos I"ve seen in DP Challenge in quite a few weeks! Good luck!', '2004-05-22 14:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(731480, 77032, 21367, '<td valign="top">Excellent job on this one.  Composition, lighting, clarity and crop are near perfect.  Provokes emotion.</td>', 'Excellent job on this one.  Composition, lighting, clarity and crop are near perfect.  Provokes emotion.', '2004-05-22 14:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
