(731485, 76728, 21367, '<td valign="top">This is a neat idea, I like how the balls continue to reflect inside each other.    I would have like to seen a little more detail, but understand that would be tough to pull off as reflective objects are hard to shot without picking up distractions in a room.  Maybe if this was shot inside a white light box you could have increase the lighting and detail.  Just my thoughts.</td>', 'This is a neat idea, I like how the balls continue to reflect inside each other.    I would have like to seen a little more detail, but understand that would be tough to pull off as reflective objects are hard to shot without picking up distractions in a room.  Maybe if this was shot inside a white light box you could have increase the lighting and detail.  Just my thoughts.', '2004-05-22 15:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
