(731499, 77141, 12802, '<td valign="top">Really nice smooth long exposure here, have you tried using a circular polarise before?  This would have taken out the reflections on the rocks at the side.  Nice shot!</td>', 'Really nice smooth long exposure here, have you tried using a circular polarise before?  This would have taken out the reflections on the rocks at the side.  Nice shot!', '2004-05-22 15:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(731504, 77008, 21367, '<td valign="top">Cool concept, subject centered (people or that nut looking thing I can''t be sure).    If this is a hub cap on a car, I may have shot it from the other side of the car.  The sun tends to blow out the center of your composition and enhance the scratches on the crome surface.  If the crome surface couldn''t be moved, I might have shot this at a different time of day, perhaps noonish or early afternoon.  Sometime where the sun was not in the shot, it just seems to be overpowering here.</td>', 'Cool concept, subject centered (people or that nut looking thing I can''t be sure).    If this is a hub cap on a car, I may have shot it from the other side of the car.  The sun tends to blow out the center of your composition and enhance the scratches on the crome surface.  If the crome surface couldn''t be moved, I might have shot this at a different time of day, perhaps noonish or early afternoon.  Sometime where the sun was not in the shot, it just seems to be overpowering here.', '2004-05-22 15:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
