(731564, 76685, 7560, '<td valign="top">Great luck catching this little guy.  Well centered. The biggest area for improvement is the way the squirrel blends into the tree. And yes, I know you can''t fix that particular problem. :)  Possibly a different angle on the shot, with a colored background (leaves, water something?) Also great use of a shallow DOF, with the critter sharply focused and the background blurred out.</td>', 'Great luck catching this little guy.  Well centered. The biggest area for improvement is the way the squirrel blends into the tree. And yes, I know you can''t fix that particular problem. :)  Possibly a different angle on the shot, with a colored background (leaves, water something?) Also great use of a shallow DOF, with the critter sharply focused and the background blurred out.', '2004-05-22 17:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
