(731638, 76081, 17916, '<td valign="top">My nemesis! :-) Just referring to a shot of my own of a sculpture I entered in the recent Abstract challenge, many thought it looked like a dandelion. Anyways, great shot, love the colors, DOF, crop.</td>', 'My nemesis! :-) Just referring to a shot of my own of a sculpture I entered in the recent Abstract challenge, many thought it looked like a dandelion. Anyways, great shot, love the colors, DOF, crop.', '2004-05-22 20:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
