(731744, 77149, 4494, '<td valign="top">Should have not included the tree in the foreground.   The door of the house looks interesting... you should have tried taking a close up of that instead.</td>', 'Should have not included the tree in the foreground.   The door of the house looks interesting... you should have tried taking a close up of that instead.', '2004-05-22 21:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(731745, 77015, 4494, '<td valign="top">It''s a little out of focus.  And the whites are "blown out", meaning there is a lot of pure white (dead) pixels.</td>', 'It''s a little out of focus.  And the whites are "blown out", meaning there is a lot of pure white (dead) pixels.', '2004-05-22 21:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(731750, 76974, 4494, '<td valign="top">Two things:  1) It''s tilted to the right.  Looks like she is going to slide right off the end of the bench.  2) You should have cropped it a little so the frame is more portrait.  That would fit better with the person and also not show the ends of the bench.  The B&amp;W/Sepia is nice.<br/></td>', 'Two things:  1) It''s tilted to the right.  Looks like she is going to slide right off the end of the bench.  2) You should have cropped it a little so the frame is more portrait.  That would fit better with the person and also not show the ends of the bench.  The B&W/Sepia is nice.', '2004-05-22 21:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(731751, 77180, 4494, '<td valign="top">You''ve probably already heard this:  The shifter isn''t a strong enough subject.  Still a good picture, but just doesn''t fit the challenge well.</td>', 'You''ve probably already heard this:  The shifter isn''t a strong enough subject.  Still a good picture, but just doesn''t fit the challenge well.', '2004-05-22 21:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(731753, 76685, 4494, '<td valign="top">It''s amazing how the fur has almost the exact same texture and color as the bark of the tree.   Excellent picture BTW.  :)<br/></td>', 'It''s amazing how the fur has almost the exact same texture and color as the bark of the tree.   Excellent picture BTW.  :)', '2004-05-22 21:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(731758, 77111, 4494, '<td valign="top">The colors are a little off but the composition and subject is great.  This is a perfectly "weighted" image.  Not sure if it fits the challenge however since the horizon (centered part) really isn''t strong enough to be the subject.  I guess it does fit.</td>', 'The colors are a little off but the composition and subject is great.  This is a perfectly "weighted" image.  Not sure if it fits the challenge however since the horizon (centered part) really isn''t strong enough to be the subject.  I guess it does fit.', '2004-05-22 21:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(731761, 76932, 4494, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  Couple things:  1) It''s tilted to the right.  Amazing how many people miss this.  2) The bird isn''t centered.   Still a cool shot however. 7.</td>', 'Cool shot.  Couple things:  1) It''s tilted to the right.  Amazing how many people miss this.  2) The bird isn''t centered.   Still a cool shot however. 7.', '2004-05-22 22:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(731764, 76897, 4494, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look real to me.</td>', 'Doesn''t look real to me.', '2004-05-22 22:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(731766, 76208, 4494, '<td valign="top">The dark part in the foreground is really destracting.</td>', 'The dark part in the foreground is really destracting.', '2004-05-22 22:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(731773, 76743, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very good lighting.  Love the detail and perfect colors on the frog.  Never seen a frog that looked like that either! :)</td>', 'Very good lighting.  Love the detail and perfect colors on the frog.  Never seen a frog that looked like that either! :)', '2004-05-22 22:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(731775, 76682, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very nice I love the purple and green.  Don''t know that it fits the challenge as well as it could have, if you would have zoomed on the main flower only, etc.  Oh well, nice anyway.</td>', 'Very nice I love the purple and green.  Don''t know that it fits the challenge as well as it could have, if you would have zoomed on the main flower only, etc.  Oh well, nice anyway.', '2004-05-22 22:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(731776, 76971, 4494, '<td valign="top">Looks a little blurry to me.  The contrast is "flat" as well.  Try using PS to increase the contrast.</td>', 'Looks a little blurry to me.  The contrast is "flat" as well.  Try using PS to increase the contrast.', '2004-05-22 22:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(731778, 76973, 4494, '<td valign="top">Cool, it looks like Mars kind of.</td>', 'Cool, it looks like Mars kind of.', '2004-05-22 22:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(731784, 77121, 4494, '<td valign="top">Actually the tree on the right dominates the picture.  Should have tried a different angle, or, tried shooting a brown tree instead.  Looks a little over minipulated in PS also.</td>', 'Actually the tree on the right dominates the picture.  Should have tried a different angle, or, tried shooting a brown tree instead.  Looks a little over minipulated in PS also.', '2004-05-22 22:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(731788, 77113, 4494, '<td valign="top">Don''t really like the grey space.  Couldn''t you just make the image round?  :D</td>', 'Don''t really like the grey space.  Couldn''t you just make the image round?  :D', '2004-05-22 22:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(731792, 76217, 4494, '<td valign="top">Love the white pedals against the green... awesome.   This is probably the best flower pic of the bunch (behind mine of course) :D</td>', 'Love the white pedals against the green... awesome.   This is probably the best flower pic of the bunch (behind mine of course) :D', '2004-05-22 22:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(731794, 76818, 4494, '<td valign="top">Ack, no contrast.  Could be a good shot, but it''s as "flat" as a board.  Use PS to increase contrast.  Use Levels or Curves.</td>', 'Ack, no contrast.  Could be a good shot, but it''s as "flat" as a board.  Use PS to increase contrast.  Use Levels or Curves.', '2004-05-22 22:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(731796, 76914, 4494, '<td valign="top">LOL the "Cow Palace" is in San Francisco, CA. :)   This should looks out of focus.</td>', 'LOL the "Cow Palace" is in San Francisco, CA. :)   This should looks out of focus.', '2004-05-22 22:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(731798, 77164, 4494, '<td valign="top">Should make the frame square.  Right now the frame is opposite of the bottle so it''s a little irratating.</td>', 'Should make the frame square.  Right now the frame is opposite of the bottle so it''s a little irratating.', '2004-05-22 22:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(731801, 76257, 4494, '<td valign="top">Cool.  You should have cropped to exclude the black spots.  I know you would lose some of the great white pedals but it would be well worth it.  Or, you could have cloned the white part out a little as needed to save as much white as possible.</td>', 'Cool.  You should have cropped to exclude the black spots.  I know you would lose some of the great white pedals but it would be well worth it.  Or, you could have cloned the white part out a little as needed to save as much white as possible.', '2004-05-22 22:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(731802, 76945, 4494, '<td valign="top">Should have zoomed in more.  Then straighten it because it''s tilted to the right.  Then use dodging and burning maybe to give it a little more pizzaze.</td>', 'Should have zoomed in more.  Then straighten it because it''s tilted to the right.  Then use dodging and burning maybe to give it a little more pizzaze.', '2004-05-22 22:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(731809, 76538, 4494, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2004-05-22 22:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(731811, 76929, 4494, '<td valign="top">Blue lines??</td>', 'Blue lines??', '2004-05-22 22:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(731812, 75927, 4494, '<td valign="top">Well this is certainly different. :)  Looks like an ad for a car that you would see in 50''s or something.  Interesting.</td>', 'Well this is certainly different. :)  Looks like an ad for a car that you would see in 50''s or something.  Interesting.', '2004-05-22 22:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(731816, 76158, 4494, '<td valign="top">Looks really grainy.  Kind of a cool composition however.  Definetely unique, good job. :)</td>', 'Looks really grainy.  Kind of a cool composition however.  Definetely unique, good job. :)', '2004-05-22 22:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(731824, 76821, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very cool I love it.</td>', 'Very cool I love it.', '2004-05-22 22:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(731828, 77011, 4494, '<td valign="top">That''s really cool.  I hope you mention in the image notes how you did it.  One thing is, I''d have rotated the image 90 degrees and left the "frame" like it is (portrait).  Doesn''t fit the challenge topic that well but... :)</td>', 'That''s really cool.  I hope you mention in the image notes how you did it.  One thing is, I''d have rotated the image 90 degrees and left the "frame" like it is (portrait).  Doesn''t fit the challenge topic that well but... :)', '2004-05-22 22:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(731829, 76968, 4494, '<td valign="top">Looks like some camera shake there.  In low light (low shutter speed), remember to use a tripod especially when you zoom in which it looks like you did here. :)</td>', 'Looks like some camera shake there.  In low light (low shutter speed), remember to use a tripod especially when you zoom in which it looks like you did here. :)', '2004-05-22 22:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(731831, 76847, 4494, '<td valign="top">What I like about this image is the STRONG distinct colors (brown, blue, and green).  Other then that however it''s not very interesting, and it''s tilted to the right.</td>', 'What I like about this image is the STRONG distinct colors (brown, blue, and green).  Other then that however it''s not very interesting, and it''s tilted to the right.', '2004-05-22 22:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(731833, 76540, 4494, '<td valign="top">Looks like a lot of cool stuff in that "garage" to take pictures of. :)</td>', 'Looks like a lot of cool stuff in that "garage" to take pictures of. :)', '2004-05-22 22:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(731837, 77127, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nothing is centered.  You should have zoomed in (and centered on) that bizzare "bulb" on the right instead.  But make sure you have enough light.</td>', 'Nothing is centered.  You should have zoomed in (and centered on) that bizzare "bulb" on the right instead.  But make sure you have enough light.', '2004-05-22 22:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(731845, 76085, 4494, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot!  The flag really stands out nicely in front of the dark building and skylight.</td>', 'Awesome shot!  The flag really stands out nicely in front of the dark building and skylight.', '2004-05-22 23:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(731860, 76351, 20447, '<td valign="top">This photo seems to combine the lilac with just the right amount of green leaves to set the whole photo off for a great center picture.</td>', 'This photo seems to combine the lilac with just the right amount of green leaves to set the whole photo off for a great center picture.', '2004-05-22 23:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(731865, 76168, 20447, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot of railroad track. Makes me wonder whwre it goes.</td>', 'Nice clear shot of railroad track. Makes me wonder whwre it goes.', '2004-05-22 23:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(731878, 76273, 7560, '<td valign="top">This image caught my attention the second I saw it. WOW! Amazing luck in capturing this! Great center balance, excellent DOF, and a striking subject. I live in Maryland and still haven''t come close to seeing this. :) This was my automatic, and only 10. Excellent!</td>', 'This image caught my attention the second I saw it. WOW! Amazing luck in capturing this! Great center balance, excellent DOF, and a striking subject. I live in Maryland and still haven''t come close to seeing this. :) This was my automatic, and only 10. Excellent!', '2004-05-23 00:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(731879, 76802, 7560, '<td valign="top">I have to confess, I''m a sucker for cat pictures. Great sharpness, and texture. Love the vivid blue of the eye. Great choice on crop. 8</td>', 'I have to confess, I''m a sucker for cat pictures. Great sharpness, and texture. Love the vivid blue of the eye. Great choice on crop. 8', '2004-05-23 00:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(731883, 76743, 7560, '<td valign="top">Froggy! I really liked the whimsical element to this image. I like the frog hugging the wine bottle. I think this shot has some serious potential as a stock shot. It needs to be a print at the least. Not knowing what your apature was, the image might be better with more of the frog in focus. But I still love this image. 8</td>', 'Froggy! I really liked the whimsical element to this image. I like the frog hugging the wine bottle. I think this shot has some serious potential as a stock shot. It needs to be a print at the least. Not knowing what your apature was, the image might be better with more of the frog in focus. But I still love this image. 8', '2004-05-23 00:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(731884, 76379, 7560, '<td valign="top">Very striking, and I like the editing choices you made on this one. 8</td>', 'Very striking, and I like the editing choices you made on this one. 8', '2004-05-23 00:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(731885, 75740, 7560, '<td valign="top">I like the balance to this image. Good center weight focus, and the clouds to the left add an interesting contrast for me. I''d love to see this later/earlier in the day with a different light. 8</td>', 'I like the balance to this image. Good center weight focus, and the clouds to the left add an interesting contrast for me. I''d love to see this later/earlier in the day with a different light. 8', '2004-05-23 00:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(731886, 76259, 7560, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you got a bunch of "it''s not centered" comments on this one. I disagree if you did. Good center balance, and a whimsical subject. I like the expression on the frog''s face! The background focuses the attention where it needs to be. 8</td>', 'I''m sure you got a bunch of "it''s not centered" comments on this one. I disagree if you did. Good center balance, and a whimsical subject. I like the expression on the frog''s face! The background focuses the attention where it needs to be. 8', '2004-05-23 00:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(731889, 76864, 7560, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting here. The additon of water drops softens the overall image a bit and adds some excellent contrast. Very nice, soft romatic feel to this one. 8</td>', 'Love the lighting here. The additon of water drops softens the overall image a bit and adds some excellent contrast. Very nice, soft romatic feel to this one. 8', '2004-05-23 00:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(731891, 76068, 7560, '<td valign="top">Been there, done that. :) I''m having flashbacks to my history final freshman year. Only I forgot to study for that one. Great staging of the subject, and by golly that watch is dead center. :) Nice job! 7</td>', 'Been there, done that. :) I''m having flashbacks to my history final freshman year. Only I forgot to study for that one. Great staging of the subject, and by golly that watch is dead center. :) Nice job! 7', '2004-05-23 00:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(731894, 77041, 7560, '<td valign="top">I didn''t enjoy most of the flowers in this challenge. This one I did. The tight crop really focuses me on the beauty of the rose. The water drops add some great contrasting texture. Beautiful shot and one of my 2 highest flower pictures. 8</td>', 'I didn''t enjoy most of the flowers in this challenge. This one I did. The tight crop really focuses me on the beauty of the rose. The water drops add some great contrasting texture. Beautiful shot and one of my 2 highest flower pictures. 8', '2004-05-23 00:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(731898, 76994, 7560, '<td valign="top">I love the use of the metal peg board to hold the marbles. The reflections add a great element to the image. Well centered. 8</td>', 'I love the use of the metal peg board to hold the marbles. The reflections add a great element to the image. Well centered. 8', '2004-05-23 00:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(731899, 76085, 7560, '<td valign="top">This is  simply a well done interior shot! The flag gives you a strong  visual center and adds some perspective to the interior size. Minor technical details include the flag behind the US flag which is a tad distracting, and the light on the right going through another light. That throws the "center" off a bit. I would have considered cropping those lights out. Solid 7. Nice!</td>', 'This is  simply a well done interior shot! The flag gives you a strong  visual center and adds some perspective to the interior size. Minor technical details include the flag behind the US flag which is a tad distracting, and the light on the right going through another light. That throws the "center" off a bit. I would have considered cropping those lights out. Solid 7. Nice!', '2004-05-23 00:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(731900, 76945, 7560, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Well balanced image. And the light painting across the cross is very powerful. Little dark at the bottom, and a little bright in the upper right corner for my tastes, but still a compelling, powerful image. Bumped this into my top images. 8</td>', 'Very nice! Well balanced image. And the light painting across the cross is very powerful. Little dark at the bottom, and a little bright in the upper right corner for my tastes, but still a compelling, powerful image. Bumped this into my top images. 8', '2004-05-23 00:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(731909, 76257, 18505, '<td valign="top">I like the various dimensions you show in this image.  The whites show many different shades of white.  Stunning.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the various dimensions you show in this image.  The whites show many different shades of white.  Stunning.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-05-23 00:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(731919, 76914, 15767, '<td valign="top">Great title!</td>', 'Great title!', '2004-05-23 00:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(732014, 77061, 22022, '<td valign="top">Great composition and simetry... Respects the theme and it''s a nice photo.</td>', 'Great composition and simetry... Respects the theme and it''s a nice photo.', '2004-05-23 03:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(732024, 76150, 6388, '<td valign="top">great subject.  lighting looks a little flat to me.  a little more contrast and/or sharpening might help this.  Unless of course you had to crop a lot to get him in the middle.  I hope you took lot sof this guy he''s worth photographing :)<br/>Pedro</td>', 'great subject.  lighting looks a little flat to me.  a little more contrast and/or sharpening might help this.  Unless of course you had to crop a lot to get him in the middle.  I hope you took lot sof this guy he''s worth photographing :)Pedro', '2004-05-23 03:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(732025, 76072, 6388, '<td valign="top">a little overexposed methinks.  the petals of the flower on the right are blown out a bit.  a little creative burning would take care of that.  nice composition for the challenge, nice depth, and the focus seems pretty sharp too.  good job.<br/>P</td>', 'a little overexposed methinks.  the petals of the flower on the right are blown out a bit.  a little creative burning would take care of that.  nice composition for the challenge, nice depth, and the focus seems pretty sharp too.  good job.P', '2004-05-23 03:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(732027, 76855, 6388, '<td valign="top">really tough shot to expose.  the pagoda looks muted and the lanterns are almost overexposed.  a little fill flash could have help depending on the flash and your distance to the carving.  good concept and great colours.  good luck. P</td>', 'really tough shot to expose.  the pagoda looks muted and the lanterns are almost overexposed.  a little fill flash could have help depending on the flash and your distance to the carving.  good concept and great colours.  good luck. P', '2004-05-23 03:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(732116, 76538, 11897, '<td valign="top">too graphic for my tastes, not even a good photo.</td>', 'too graphic for my tastes, not even a good photo.', '2004-05-23 08:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(732133, 77005, 14603, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot..very well suited to the challenge..I don`t think "Neat Image"? does it justice though as it adds an unnatural grey shade to the shadow areas of the picture.<br/>I think this would be a ribbon winner if it was pin sharp.<br/>Good work<br/></td>', 'Lovely shot..very well suited to the challenge..I don`t think "Neat Image"? does it justice though as it adds an unnatural grey shade to the shadow areas of the picture.I think this would be a ribbon winner if it was pin sharp.Good work', '2004-05-23 10:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(732155, 76538, 19538, '<td valign="top">This could be a top 10 photo, or bottom 10. To truly rate this photo someone needs to know more, either from the title or some background as to what the event was. For example I would rate this photo low if this was a model and this is a staged photo. It would fall into the same caliber as the National Inquire, The Globe, etc.  However if this was an un-staged photo, AND there was an equally powerful story, it goes from being simply a photo going for shock value, to a photo that holds some equally powerful meaning.</td>', 'This could be a top 10 photo, or bottom 10. To truly rate this photo someone needs to know more, either from the title or some background as to what the event was. For example I would rate this photo low if this was a model and this is a staged photo. It would fall into the same caliber as the National Inquire, The Globe, etc.  However if this was an un-staged photo, AND there was an equally powerful story, it goes from being simply a photo going for shock value, to a photo that holds some equally powerful meaning.', '2004-05-23 10:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(732162, 77048, 19538, '<td valign="top">I liked this photo, but there are some every distracting elements that hurt it. First the white (bird droppings?) on the rock totally pulls the viewers attention away  from the person sitting on the rock. Two, a more minor point, the water looks great, the sky looks great, however, the coastline in the distant is a little boring to view. I think the sky has great detail that is lost; if perhaps the photo was titled up a little bit so that there was more sky I would have given it a higher rating.</td>', 'I liked this photo, but there are some every distracting elements that hurt it. First the white (bird droppings?) on the rock totally pulls the viewers attention away  from the person sitting on the rock. Two, a more minor point, the water looks great, the sky looks great, however, the coastline in the distant is a little boring to view. I think the sky has great detail that is lost; if perhaps the photo was titled up a little bit so that there was more sky I would have given it a higher rating.', '2004-05-23 10:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(732188, 76495, 6532, '<td valign="top">This looks like you had a really cool idea.  However, with the orange being cropped off on the sides it seems like something is missing.  Too bad - I think this would have been a very effective shot. 5</td>', 'This looks like you had a really cool idea.  However, with the orange being cropped off on the sides it seems like something is missing.  Too bad - I think this would have been a very effective shot. 5', '2004-05-23 12:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(732192, 76259, 14603, '<td valign="top">Very inventive and perfectly titled ..definitely should be in amongst the honours.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Very inventive and perfectly titled ..definitely should be in amongst the honours. ', '2004-05-23 12:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(732215, 76273, 18505, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot!  I might have cropped it even more, but I''ve looked at this several times, and each time thought "what an amazing shot!!"  Good work and good luck in the challenge.  I hope I get this good some day...</td>', 'Amazing shot!  I might have cropped it even more, but I''ve looked at this several times, and each time thought "what an amazing shot!!"  Good work and good luck in the challenge.  I hope I get this good some day...', '2004-05-23 13:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(732240, 77102, 9755, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2004-05-23 13:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(732241, 77032, 9755, '<td valign="top">cool shot...like the lighting</td>', 'cool shot...like the lighting', '2004-05-23 13:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(732255, 76976, 17916, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.', '2004-05-23 14:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(732258, 76805, 17916, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity, but it''s a bit hard to tell it''s a fence without the title, possible if the first pole were closer to the camera.</td>', 'I like the simplicity, but it''s a bit hard to tell it''s a fence without the title, possible if the first pole were closer to the camera.', '2004-05-23 14:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(732259, 77171, 17916, '<td valign="top">The bench doesn''t grab my eye initially, the bush to the left does, thus not being centered subject. I see what you''re going for though.</td>', 'The bench doesn''t grab my eye initially, the bush to the left does, thus not being centered subject. I see what you''re going for though.', '2004-05-23 14:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(732266, 77177, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely clear blue water. At an angle, the lily might actually be better toward a third, but it works in the center too, especially wtih those other flower artifacts at left.</td>', 'Lovely clear blue water. At an angle, the lily might actually be better toward a third, but it works in the center too, especially wtih those other flower artifacts at left.', '2004-05-23 14:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(732267, 76952, 6870, '<td valign="top">Okay now, give me the gun . . . that''s it . . . nice and slow . . . give me the gun. . . we''re all your friends here, just put it in my hand . . . that''s right . . . nice and slow . . . 9</td>', 'Okay now, give me the gun . . . that''s it . . . nice and slow . . . give me the gun. . . we''re all your friends here, just put it in my hand . . . that''s right . . . nice and slow . . . 9', '2004-05-23 14:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(732269, 77108, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love the tones of water and sky here. The gulls themselves might be on the bright side, but still an interesting shot.</td>', 'I love the tones of water and sky here. The gulls themselves might be on the bright side, but still an interesting shot.', '2004-05-23 14:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(732271, 76819, 6870, '<td valign="top">Slow and steady wins the race! 8</td>', 'Slow and steady wins the race! 8', '2004-05-23 14:38:43.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(732274, 76168, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like shots like this. It mayhelp to either tilt the tracks even more, or just leave them exactly centered and symmetrical in the frame. Try coming at a different time of day, too, just for fun. Or on a cloudy day when the shadows and highlights might be less harsh. Still a nice shot, though. 7</td>', 'I like shots like this. It mayhelp to either tilt the tracks even more, or just leave them exactly centered and symmetrical in the frame. Try coming at a different time of day, too, just for fun. Or on a cloudy day when the shadows and highlights might be less harsh. Still a nice shot, though. 7', '2004-05-23 14:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(732288, 77157, 21217, '<td valign="top">Really centered. Good photo. I hope you win</td>', 'Really centered. Good photo. I hope you win', '2004-05-23 15:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(732359, 76968, 20124, '<td valign="top">Not the most creative idea but beautifully  simple.  Soft focus is good , but just<br/>a tiny bit more sharpening would help some.  Your picture fits the theme,<br/>but how about her facing the camera and not 3/4?  That way both of Amanda''s<br/>eyes would be at the center  of your composition.   I give it  a 7.</td>', 'Not the most creative idea but beautifully  simple.  Soft focus is good , but justa tiny bit more sharpening would help some.  Your picture fits the theme,but how about her facing the camera and not 3/4?  That way both of Amanda''seyes would be at the center  of your composition.   I give it  a 7.', '2004-05-23 17:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(732361, 77184, 20124, '<td valign="top">It''s centered so it fits the theme.   And plain background futher calls attention to<br/>the drop.  Good Macro shot, but not the best.  I give it a 7.</td>', 'It''s centered so it fits the theme.   And plain background futher calls attention tothe drop.  Good Macro shot, but not the best.  I give it a 7.', '2004-05-23 17:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(732363, 76751, 20124, '<td valign="top">I like action shots, because they''re a challenge to pull off, and more interesting<br/>to look at.<br/>Nothing wrong with black and white, but in action we''d have chosen to have it <br/>in color.  Your picture fits this broad theme as it is centered. <br/>And even if the water<br/>is not the main subject, it would be nice if it was less blurry. Still all in all, a good<br/>effort...I give you a 6.</td>', 'I like action shots, because they''re a challenge to pull off, and more interestingto look at.Nothing wrong with black and white, but in action we''d have chosen to have it in color.  Your picture fits this broad theme as it is centered. And even if the wateris not the main subject, it would be nice if it was less blurry. Still all in all, a goodeffort...I give you a 6.', '2004-05-23 17:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(732364, 76217, 6130, '<td valign="top">Just 10+</td>', 'Just 10+', '2004-05-23 17:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(732367, 76274, 11897, '<td valign="top">Flawless</td>', 'Flawless', '2004-05-23 17:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(732370, 76209, 20124, '<td valign="top">The picture has the big AWW factor, as it is adorably touching, with child<br/>and butterfly. I believe butterfiles should be in color,  to better appreciate<br/>their beautiful wings. But on the good side, it is centered so it fits the theme.<br/>And i know it wasn''t easy to have a butterfly to stay on a person''s hand,<br/>even if perfectly still.   In color I would give it a higher score, but as it is, I give you<br/>a 7</td>', 'The picture has the big AWW factor, as it is adorably touching, with childand butterfly. I believe butterfiles should be in color,  to better appreciatetheir beautiful wings. But on the good side, it is centered so it fits the theme.And i know it wasn''t easy to have a butterfly to stay on a person''s hand,even if perfectly still.   In color I would give it a higher score, but as it is, I give youa 7', '2004-05-23 17:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(732373, 77008, 20124, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but not well excecuted.  A bit too blurry.  And having the person''s<br/>head on the reflection blocked out by the center adds to the vagueness.<br/>I give it a 4</td>', 'Nice idea, but not well excecuted.  A bit too blurry.  And having the person''shead on the reflection blocked out by the center adds to the vagueness.I give it a 4', '2004-05-23 17:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(732378, 77024, 20124, '<td valign="top">This picture would garner a higher score in an animal theme, but here<br/>it isn''t centered enough.  Having it face the camera and not 3/4 like it is here,<br/>would help big time. It''s a nice clear picture of a cute dog,  but just isn''t<br/>centered enough. And to really have it centered, have the dog further back from the camera instead of filling up so much space. This would further emphasize<br/>the centeredness of the dog.<br/>Still a good clear pic though, so I give it  a 6.</td>', 'This picture would garner a higher score in an animal theme, but hereit isn''t centered enough.  Having it face the camera and not 3/4 like it is here,would help big time. It''s a nice clear picture of a cute dog,  but just isn''tcentered enough. And to really have it centered, have the dog further back from the camera instead of filling up so much space. This would further emphasizethe centeredness of the dog.Still a good clear pic though, so I give it  a 6.', '2004-05-23 17:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(732379, 76829, 20124, '<td valign="top">Terrific macro photo of an unusual subject. Fits the theme well. Obviously<br/>a fine camera, given the clarity of the zoom. And<br/>the white background contrasts well with the multi colored spider so<br/>the composition is good too. Even if you don''t like spiders, this picture<br/>is hard to ignore. Well done. An 8</td>', 'Terrific macro photo of an unusual subject. Fits the theme well. Obviouslya fine camera, given the clarity of the zoom. Andthe white background contrasts well with the multi colored spider sothe composition is good too. Even if you don''t like spiders, this pictureis hard to ignore. Well done. An 8', '2004-05-23 17:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(732426, 76598, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2004-05-23 18:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(732433, 77048, 6130, '<td valign="top">Great 10</td>', 'Great 10', '2004-05-23 18:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(732439, 76751, 6130, '<td valign="top">Just 10</td>', 'Just 10', '2004-05-23 18:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(732485, 76874, 22054, '<td valign="top">the photo looks really great. the best ive seen in the challenge so far. i would like a print of this. i give it a 10. good luck.</td>', 'the photo looks really great. the best ive seen in the challenge so far. i would like a print of this. i give it a 10. good luck.', '2004-05-23 19:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(732528, 76361, 4767, '<td valign="top">Kermit the TOAD??</td>', 'Kermit the TOAD??', '2004-05-23 20:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(732530, 77053, 4767, '<td valign="top">VERY Interesting photo.  Wish it were in the middle of the scene.</td>', 'VERY Interesting photo.  Wish it were in the middle of the scene.', '2004-05-23 20:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(732532, 77015, 4767, '<td valign="top">A sweet thought.  It doesn''t seem to be in the center of the composition, nor is it in focus.  PLEASE enter more competitions, I love the thought behind the shot, I sure you, as with many of us, will get better and better at making out ideas reality, photo-wise.</td>', 'A sweet thought.  It doesn''t seem to be in the center of the composition, nor is it in focus.  PLEASE enter more competitions, I love the thought behind the shot, I sure you, as with many of us, will get better and better at making out ideas reality, photo-wise.', '2004-05-23 20:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(732534, 77060, 4767, '<td valign="top">WOW!</td>', 'WOW!', '2004-05-23 20:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(732536, 76564, 4767, '<td valign="top">Interesting - the eye is centered, yet is looking out of the frame.  It gives an interesting feel to the image, imo.  I like it!</td>', 'Interesting - the eye is centered, yet is looking out of the frame.  It gives an interesting feel to the image, imo.  I like it!', '2004-05-23 20:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(732542, 75755, 4767, '<td valign="top">The frame does NOT add to the image.  I like the little heart-shaped dark area near the center, but the frame screams ''gimmick'' and I can''t judge the rest of the shot on its own merit.</td>', 'The frame does NOT add to the image.  I like the little heart-shaped dark area near the center, but the frame screams ''gimmick'' and I can''t judge the rest of the shot on its own merit.', '2004-05-23 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(732547, 76704, 4767, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  The hot spot in the middle (and on the central and 7:00 ant) is a distraction for me.  Is it available light?</td>', 'Great shot!  The hot spot in the middle (and on the central and 7:00 ant) is a distraction for me.  Is it available light?', '2004-05-23 20:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(732548, 75846, 4767, '<td valign="top">Looks like a fat green exclamation mark!  I like it!</td>', 'Looks like a fat green exclamation mark!  I like it!', '2004-05-23 20:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(732553, 76259, 4767, '<td valign="top">unique idea!  Well photographed.</td>', 'unique idea!  Well photographed.', '2004-05-23 20:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(732554, 76389, 6199, '<td valign="top">A bit dark on the lower half, besides that, nice.</td>', 'A bit dark on the lower half, besides that, nice.', '2004-05-23 20:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(732556, 76871, 6199, '<td valign="top">That''s a nice moment.  Good focus on the dead center.</td>', 'That''s a nice moment.  Good focus on the dead center.', '2004-05-23 20:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(732557, 77124, 16957, '<td valign="top">This is simply gorgeous. You''ve captured a stunning array of colours and patterns. I like the suggestion of boatsbut it could be anything. Well done.</td>', 'This is simply gorgeous. You''ve captured a stunning array of colours and patterns. I like the suggestion of boatsbut it could be anything. Well done.', '2004-05-23 20:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(732558, 76844, 6199, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2004-05-23 20:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(732559, 76408, 16957, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait and nicely composed with the blackness to left and tree trunk to right. Congratulations on capturing the expression and seeing so much detail. Effective entry at a high standard.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait and nicely composed with the blackness to left and tree trunk to right. Congratulations on capturing the expression and seeing so much detail. Effective entry at a high standard.', '2004-05-23 20:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
