(732589, 76735, 6199, '<td valign="top">focus is a bit too much on the top. and you could have dusted the sand off maybe?</td>', 'focus is a bit too much on the top. and you could have dusted the sand off maybe?', '2004-05-23 21:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(732624, 76965, 8911, '<td valign="top">Very crisp shot. I''m not sure that the decision to have it in black and white wasa good one, though. I find it busy and hard to look at - even though the fairly shallow depth of focus theoretically keeps the foreground crisp and background blurry, the values are so close that I find it''s not too comfortable to look at, that I have to work a little to pull that information out. It''s a tiring image to look at, because I''m not sure what to make of most of it, or where to rest my eyes.</td>', 'Very crisp shot. I''m not sure that the decision to have it in black and white wasa good one, though. I find it busy and hard to look at - even though the fairly shallow depth of focus theoretically keeps the foreground crisp and background blurry, the values are so close that I find it''s not too comfortable to look at, that I have to work a little to pull that information out. It''s a tiring image to look at, because I''m not sure what to make of most of it, or where to rest my eyes.', '2004-05-23 22:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(732626, 76621, 16135, '<td valign="top">wow gorgeous bike</td>', 'wow gorgeous bike', '2004-05-23 22:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(732630, 77168, 16135, '<td valign="top">nice shot i like the sort of grainy effect, it adds character</td>', 'nice shot i like the sort of grainy effect, it adds character', '2004-05-23 22:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(732643, 77156, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like this one - but it''s a bit busy. I gather by the title that I should be looking to her, but my eye catches on her, then roams to the pole to her side, then follows the hanging across and down, then catches on the "Dulcimer" sign and follows it right out of the frame. The picture is very busy - a tighter focus on her might have helped? (So might a shallower depth but I don''t see how you could get her crisp and keep all the elements that distracted blurry....)</td>', 'I like this one - but it''s a bit busy. I gather by the title that I should be looking to her, but my eye catches on her, then roams to the pole to her side, then follows the hanging across and down, then catches on the "Dulcimer" sign and follows it right out of the frame. The picture is very busy - a tighter focus on her might have helped? (So might a shallower depth but I don''t see how you could get her crisp and keep all the elements that distracted blurry....)', '2004-05-23 22:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(732646, 77053, 8911, '<td valign="top">Fascinating statue - and I love the colors and the water-color-ish look of the background. The statue itself is a bit dark, though, the details indistinct. I would have liked to be able to see the stone of the faces more clearly.</td>', 'Fascinating statue - and I love the colors and the water-color-ish look of the background. The statue itself is a bit dark, though, the details indistinct. I would have liked to be able to see the stone of the faces more clearly.', '2004-05-23 22:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(732647, 77168, 8860, '<td valign="top">Art. Just great - and a perfect use of the centred format. The grain and DOF here is supreme (refreshing actually for this site) so welcome to myy favourites after the challenge and your blue ribbon win!!  :)</td>', 'Art. Just great - and a perfect use of the centred format. The grain and DOF here is supreme (refreshing actually for this site) so welcome to myy favourites after the challenge and your blue ribbon win!!  :)', '2004-05-23 22:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
