(733135, 77001, 8522, '<td valign="top">Sorry you felt my comment was not worthy or useful enough to tick... even though it says exactly the same as the first comment. Maybe this is the wrong place for you, if you''re not ready to take on board constructive criticism. You already seem to think that your photos are great, why bother trying to improve? For what it''s worth, I gave you a 4.</td>', 'Sorry you felt my comment was not worthy or useful enough to tick... even though it says exactly the same as the first comment. Maybe this is the wrong place for you, if you''re not ready to take on board constructive criticism. You already seem to think that your photos are great, why bother trying to improve? For what it''s worth, I gave you a 4.', '2004-05-24 07:30:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(733139, 77168, 13602, '<td valign="top">This is a masterpiece. I didn''t get to vote nor I participated in this challenge but damn, I''m shocked whenever a shot like this doesn''t get what it deserves. Well better luck next time when there won''t be so many frogs insects flowers and such in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a masterpiece. I didn''t get to vote nor I participated in this challenge but damn, I''m shocked whenever a shot like this doesn''t get what it deserves. Well better luck next time when there won''t be so many frogs insects flowers and such in the challenge.', '2004-05-24 07:35:33.000000', NULL, 0),
