(733262, 76853, 19672, '<td valign="top">The sky was a touch hazy this day...sadly, such is not something in my control.<br/> <br/>"Hey God....clear the haze will ya...I''m trying to take a bloody photo!"<br/> <br/>(just didn''t seem like it would work)<br/> <br/>This is my second submission. I am actually happy with the result. At first I was disappointed with a 5. But then i realized that the top photos are usually only in the sevens.  Um...I would really like to know why two people gave it only a "2".  The threes I can grin and swallow. But I do not feel that the two 2''s were warranted. Probably didn''t effect the score too much.<br/> <br/>I had another that I would have loved  to submit but was one day outside the entrance. I swear, it is so neat I might submit it anyways for a contest and who cares if it gets DQ''d.  It was a trick photo. Incorporating a palm tree and a lighted chandelier. I managed to make it look like the chandelier is floating like a crown upon the palm tree in broad daylight.<br/> <br/>I really wished DP had like a 3 month "Best Of" or even the ability for a person to list their 10 personal best and have people rate them. That would be COOL!</td>', 'The sky was a touch hazy this day...sadly, such is not something in my control. "Hey God....clear the haze will ya...I''m trying to take a bloody photo!" (just didn''t seem like it would work) This is my second submission. I am actually happy with the result. At first I was disappointed with a 5. But then i realized that the top photos are usually only in the sevens.  Um...I would really like to know why two people gave it only a "2".  The threes I can grin and swallow. But I do not feel that the two 2''s were warranted. Probably didn''t effect the score too much. I had another that I would have loved  to submit but was one day outside the entrance. I swear, it is so neat I might submit it anyways for a contest and who cares if it gets DQ''d.  It was a trick photo. Incorporating a palm tree and a lighted chandelier. I managed to make it look like the chandelier is floating like a crown upon the palm tree in broad daylight. I really wished DP had like a 3 month "Best Of" or even the ability for a person to list their 10 personal best and have people rate them. That would be COOL!', '2004-05-24 09:46:56.000000', NULL, 0),
