(733383, 76971, 7322, '<td valign="top">I guess I should have just looked for a different shot. Here is the original I took. It is much better in terms of focus but it could use some cropping also. This is was taken on an overcast day just after rain. The overcast lighting displays the color so much better. I took this the day before the challenge started.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=75654" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/7322/thumb/75654.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/7322/thumb/75654.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/7322/thumb/75654.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I guess I should have just looked for a different shot. Here is the original I took. It is much better in terms of focus but it could use some cropping also. This is was taken on an overcast day just after rain. The overcast lighting displays the color so much better. I took this the day before the challenge started.', '2004-05-24 11:58:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(733384, 77005, 6405, '<td valign="top">I like your Pentax photos better ! :-)</td>', 'I like your Pentax photos better ! :-)', '2004-05-24 11:59:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(733386, 76259, 6388, '<td valign="top">I was bothered by this when i first saw it.  Of course, that''s only because as soon as I saw it I knew <i>for sure</i> I wasn''t going to win.  <br/>You''ve now won two of your last three...pretty impressive :)<br/> <br/>Just a fabulous shot.  A local phone company here uses wildlife in it''s ads all the time, and this is an good as anything they''ve used.  It was the first thing i thought of when i saw it - good enough to be published.  Great job, Jean.<br/> <br/>Pedro</td>', 'I was bothered by this when i first saw it.  Of course, that''s only because as soon as I saw it I knew for sure I wasn''t going to win.  You''ve now won two of your last three...pretty impressive :) Just a fabulous shot.  A local phone company here uses wildlife in it''s ads all the time, and this is an good as anything they''ve used.  It was the first thing i thought of when i saw it - good enough to be published.  Great job, Jean. Pedro', '2004-05-24 12:00:28.000000', NULL, 0),
