(733448, 77141, 6388, '<td valign="top">Nice Jubei.  Cool you found time in your busy schedule to get up there.  That''s definitely print-worthy.<br/> <br/>how long was the shutter on this?  And I assume you used an ND filter, given that in broad daylight, the d100 can''t take more than about 1/3 of a second at ISO 200 and max aperture.  details appreciated.<br/> <br/>Pedro</td>', 'Nice Jubei.  Cool you found time in your busy schedule to get up there.  That''s definitely print-worthy. how long was the shutter on this?  And I assume you used an ND filter, given that in broad daylight, the d100 can''t take more than about 1/3 of a second at ISO 200 and max aperture.  details appreciated. Pedro', '2004-05-24 12:38:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(733500, 76504, 16636, '<td valign="top">I really wanted to bring out the central area on this image (hence the DOF)and slightly tilted the camera to try to acheive a bit more shape, not really sure that this worked?<br/>Anyway, thanks for the comments.</td>', 'I really wanted to bring out the central area on this image (hence the DOF)and slightly tilted the camera to try to acheive a bit more shape, not really sure that this worked?Anyway, thanks for the comments.', '2004-05-24 13:09:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(733534, 76068, 17148, '<td valign="top">The blue thing is his shirt, sorry if that took away from the pic, not much else I could have done with the shadow though...guess those are the breaks</td>', 'The blue thing is his shirt, sorry if that took away from the pic, not much else I could have done with the shadow though...guess those are the breaks', '2004-05-24 13:34:45.000000', NULL, 0),
