(733569, 76622, 13381, '<td valign="top">I think this is really nice. Beautiful colors show up well against the black background. It''s a great abstract, and the irregularity of the circles gives it character.  I didn''t get a chance to vote on it during the challenge, but I think it should''ve been rated higher than it was.</td>', 'I think this is really nice. Beautiful colors show up well against the black background. It''s a great abstract, and the irregularity of the circles gives it character.  I didn''t get a chance to vote on it during the challenge, but I think it should''ve been rated higher than it was.', '2004-05-24 14:10:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(733588, 77168, 2764, '<td valign="top">Yep. I agree with all.  I gave it a 10 also.</td>', 'Yep. I agree with all.  I gave it a 10 also.', '2004-05-24 14:25:19.000000', NULL, 0),
