(733887, 77141, 20210, '<td valign="top">I''ll throw my vote in for this one.  I''m very disappointed it didn''t make at least top-5.  I gave it an 8, and looking at it now, I might have gone 9!  A truly aesthetic shot.</td>', 'I''ll throw my vote in for this one.  I''m very disappointed it didn''t make at least top-5.  I gave it an 8, and looking at it now, I might have gone 9!  A truly aesthetic shot.', '2004-05-24 16:14:01.000000', NULL, 0),
