(733963, 77118, 714, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite flowers.  Nice shot!</td>', 'One of my favorite flowers.  Nice shot!', '2004-05-24 16:39:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(733967, 77118, 714, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by awpollard:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice shot.  I think I would have tried to get a little more lighting in the center of the center flower to draw out a little more detail from that area.  dof is pretty good. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>If you notice the flower is darker in the center so if you try that you end up with a picture that looks nothing like the flower.  I have tried to take pictures of these flowers and it is hard.  The are so dark and any more light can make it look bad.  <br/> <br/>I think it is fine, just doesn''t have the "wow" factor.</td>', 'Originally posted by awpollard: Nice shot.  I think I would have tried to get a little more lighting in the center of the center flower to draw out a little more detail from that area.  dof is pretty good.   If you notice the flower is darker in the center so if you try that you end up with a picture that looks nothing like the flower.  I have tried to take pictures of these flowers and it is hard.  The are so dark and any more light can make it look bad.   I think it is fine, just doesn''t have the "wow" factor.', '2004-05-24 16:42:05.000000', NULL, 0),
