(734111, 76273, 20613, '<td valign="top">you are so lucky to have caught that!  the cicadas are here in kentucky, too, and i have tried to get pictures.  great shot!</td>', 'you are so lucky to have caught that!  the cicadas are here in kentucky, too, and i have tried to get pictures.  great shot!', '2004-05-24 18:57:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(734170, 76577, 9763, '<td valign="top">What lenses were used for this bee photo?  I see an N/A in the photographer''s comments section, but I''d love to know if the bee is alive or not, and what macro lenses or filters were used in this particular photo.  That would be great.  I love this photo!</td>', 'What lenses were used for this bee photo?  I see an N/A in the photographer''s comments section, but I''d love to know if the bee is alive or not, and what macro lenses or filters were used in this particular photo.  That would be great.  I love this photo!', '2004-05-24 19:21:54.000000', NULL, 0),
