(738766, 76971, 8054, '<td valign="top">I agree that the first attempt is much nicer in terms of lighting and focus. This is an interesting macro subject so keep exploring!  :)</td>', 'I agree that the first attempt is much nicer in terms of lighting and focus. This is an interesting macro subject so keep exploring!  :)', '2004-05-27 03:59:04.000000', NULL, 0),
